{{bor+|tl|es|ave}}, from {{der|tl|la|avē|t=hello, hail}}. The senses {{m-g|calling of attention}} could possibly be {{bor+|tl|es|aba||watch out|nocap=1}}, either from {{der|tl|la|apage|t=go away}}, from {{der|tl|grc|άπαγε}}, or from {{der|tl|ar|اِبْعَد|tr=-}}.

