===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|alakós}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|alakós|b=+}}

# [[bamboo]] [[arch]] or [[archway]] usually built during [[festival]]s
#: {{syn|tl|arko|balantok|singkaban|balukay|kaluskos}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|mag-alakos|alakusan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Diksyunaryo tesauro Pilipino-Ingles 1973|page=25}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala|115|Arcos. Arcos (pp) que ponen para las fiestas, son de cañas hendidas.}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|71|Arco) Arcos (pp) C .{{!}}. alacos, de fieſtas}}
* {{R:CEDOF|1|8}}
