Page 612 alam: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|ms|alam}}, from {{der|tl|ar|عَالَم|t=world, universe}}, from {{der|tl|arc|עָלְמָא}} / {{m|syc|ܥܳܠܡܳܐ|tr=ʿāləmā}} or {{der|tl|he|עוֹלָם|tr=ʿōlām}}, possibly from {{der|tl|akk|𒂖𒆷𒈬𒌋𒀀|ts=ellamu, illamu}}. Compare {{cog|bcl|aram}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|alám|+<qq:now uncommon>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|alám|head2=+|b=+}}

# [[knowledge]]; [[learning]]; [[wisdom]]
#: {{syn|tl|talino|dunong}}
# [[understanding]]; [[sense]]
#: {{syn|tl|unawa}}
# [[involvement]]; [[participation]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[goodwill]]; [[kindheartedness]]
#: {{syn|tl|bait|mabuting-loob}}
#: {{ux|tl|Malaking lubha ang '''alam''' ng loob mo.|The '''kindness''' of your heart is too great.}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[gentleness]]; [[meekness]]
#: {{syn|tl|amo}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[affability]]

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|alám|b=+}}

# [[known]]; [[familiar]]
#: {{syn|tl|batid|lantad}}
# [[aware]]; [[conscious]]; [[cognizant]]; [[sensible]]
#: {{syn|tl|batid|tukoy}}
# [[clear]]; [[understood]]
#: {{syn|tl|maliwanag}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|alamin|kaalam|kaalaman|kawalang-alam|kinalaman|ipaalam|maalam|hindi ko alam|hindi alam|makaalam|makialam|makipag-alam|magbigay-alam|ipagbigay-alam|malaman|mapakialam|pakialaman|pakialamero|pakialamera|pakialam|pakikipag-alam|pagbigay-alaman|pagbigyang-alam|pagkaalam|pagkakaalam|walang-kinalaman|walang-nalalaman|nakaaalam|nakakaalam|mapag-alaman|umalam|kaalam-alam|ipaalam|bigay-alam|kawalang-alam|pagbibigay-alam|magkaalaman|alaman|dalub-alaman|pagmamaalam|pagmaalaman}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[notification]] or [[request]] asking [[permission]] to [[proceed]]

=====Usage notes=====
* The sense is now only used in derived terms.

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magpaalam|magpaalaman|paalam|pagkapagpaalam|pagpaalaman|pagpapaalam|pagpapaalaman|pamamaalam|mamaalam|makapagpaalam}}

