===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|alaskadór}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|alaskadór|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|slang}}

# [[teaser]]; a person who likes to [[tease]]
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1989|author=Reuel Molina Aguila|title=Ligalig, at iba pang dula|isbn=9789718577295
|passage=REY. '''Alaskador''' ka pa rin. DOM. No, tell me,  Rey. Bumusina ka lang kung nasasaktan na kita.
|t=REY. You're also a teaser. No, tell me, Rey. Tell me only if I've already hurt you.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1997|title=Pulang hamtik
|passage=Sabi nga ng mga kasama niya, '''alaskador''' kasi si Ka Vito, kaya pati usapin ng kamatayan ay inaalaska pa rin. Alaskador. ... ito ang trademark niya sa kilusan.
|translation=What his friends said is that Vito is an teaser, so [he] still tries to poke fun on the topic of death. ''Alaskador'' [teaser] is his trademark in the movement.}}
-------- end text --------
