===Etymology===
From earlier ''*ʔādaw'', from Proto-Central Philippine ''*qaldaw'', from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*qaljaw}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*qaləjaw}}. Cognate with {{cog|ilo|aldaw||day}}, {{cog|pag|agew}}, {{cog|pam|aldo}}, {{cog|bcl|aldaw||day}}, {{cog|ceb|adlaw||sun, day}}, {{cog|mrw|ndaw||sun}}, {{cog|ch|atdao||sun}}, {{cog|mg|andro||day}}, {{cog|mqy|leso||sun, day}}, {{cog|tet|loro}}, {{cog|haw|ao||daylight, day}}, {{cog|mi|ao||daytime}}. {{doublet|tl|adlaw}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<n^><hmp:Arao>|aráw<a^>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|astronomy}} [[sun]]
#: {{syn|tl|sol|q1=rare|adlaw|q2=neologism}}
# [[day]] {{gl|any period of 24 hours}}
# [[daytime]] {{gl|the part of the day between sunrise and sunset}}
# [[date]]
#: {{syn|tl|petsa}}
# [[birthday]]; [[anniversary]]
#: {{syn|tl|kaarawan|kapanganakan}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[opportunity]]; [[chance]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagkakataon}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Araw''' mo na para magbago.|Now is your '''chance''' to change.}}

