===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|ayao|ayau||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}

===Etymology 1===
From Proto-Central-Philippine ''*ayáw'' ({{m-g|do not}}). Cognate with {{cog|ceb|ayaw||do not}}. Compare also {{cog|jv|ꦲꦪ꧀ꦮ||do not}} and {{cog|kaw|haywa||do not}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+,ayáw}}

====Verb====
{{tl-verb|+|head2=ayáw|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|pseudoverb}} to not [[want]]; to not [[like]]
#: {{syn|tl|ataw|q=obsolete}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|+|head2=ayáw|b=+}}

# [[dislike]]; [[aversion]]; [[distaste]]
#: {{syn|tl|ataw|q=obsolete}}
# act of [[refusing]]; [[refusal]]
#: {{syn|tl|tanggi}}
# {{lb|tl|by extension}} act of [[give up|giving up]]

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|+|head2=ayáw|b=+}}

# [[unwanted]]; not [[liked]]
#: {{syn|tl|ataw|q=obsolete}}
# [[loath]]; [[averse]] to; [[unwilling]] to
#: {{syn|tl|ataw|q=obsolete}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|ayawan|ayoko|kaayawan|pag-ayaw|umayaw|walang-inaayawan|ayaw paawat|mapaayaw|ipaayaw|manayaw|paayawin|magpaayaw|ayaw ka man}}

===Etymology 2===
From Proto-Central-Philippine ''*áyaw'' (“to leave, redistribute”), from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*ayáw||depart; separate from}}. Cognates with {{cog|msk|ayaw||to leave}} and {{cog|ceb|ayaw||to cry (as a child) when left behind}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+<n^proportion; distribution of parts>|ayáw<n^act of leaving (something)>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[part]]; [[proportion]] {{q|of each one}}
# [[distribution]] of a [[part]] or [[proportion]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|ayaw-ayaw|mag-ayaw-ayaw|pag-ayaw-ayawin|pagkakaayaw-ayaw|pag-ayaw-ayaw|ayaw-ayawin|mag-ayaw|umayaw|ayawan|pag-ayawan|pangayaw|ipangayaw|mangangayaw|pangayawan|mangayaw|iayaw|magkaayaw-ayaw|maayaw|pag-aayaw|pangangayaw}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|ayáw|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# act of [[leaving]] something {{q|either on purpose or accidentally}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|ayawan|aywan|aywan ko|iwan|iwanan|mag-iwan|magpaiwan|maiwan|maiwanan|mang-iwan|mapag-iwanan|paiwan}}

===Etymology 3===
Compare {{cog|pam|ayo}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|ayáw}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|ayáw|b=+}}

