#: {{syn|tl|pulmon}}
#: {{ux|tl|Nawalan na ng lakas na huminga ang kanyang mga '''baga'''.|translation=His '''lungs''' lost their strength to breathe.}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*baʀah||ember}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*baʀah||ember, glowing coal}}. Cognate with {{cog|ppu|balah||charcoal}}, {{cog|ilo|bara||red-hot}}, {{cog|ceb|baga}}, {{cog|ms|bara}}, and {{cog|mqy|wara}}.

====Pronunciation====
