{{der3|tl|magbaga|nagbabaga|pabagahin|pagbagahin}}

===Etymology 3===
Ultimately from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*baʀəq||abscess, boil}}. Cognate with {{cog|ifu|bala||ulcer}}, {{cog|hnn|baga}}, {{cog|mg|[[bay]], [[vay]]||wound, boil}}, {{cog|ms|barah||abscess}}, and {{cog|mqy|bara||swollen}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bagâ}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bagâ|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|pathology}} [[abscess]]; [[tumor]] {{q|especially of the breast}}

