===Etymology===
Elision of {{IPAchar|/l/}} from ''*balay'', from Proto-Central Philippine ''*balay'', from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*balay}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*balay}}. Cognate with {{cog|pam|bale}}, {{cog|bno|bayay}}, {{cog|ceb|bay}} / {{m|ceb|balay}},  {{cog|hil|balay}}, {{cog|msk|baray}}, {{cog|tsg|bāy}}, {{cog|ms|balai}}, {{cog|mi|whare}}, {{cog|haw|hale}}, {{cog|dru|balriw}}, {{cog|pau|bai}}, and {{cog|tao|vahay}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<n^>|baháy<a^>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[house]]
#: {{syn|tl|kaligan|baler|q2=gay slang|haybol|q3=slang}}
#: {{ux|tl|Naghahanap sila ngayon ng mapagtatayuan ng magarang '''bahay'''.|They are now looking for a place on which to build an elegant '''house'''.}}
# [[edifice]]; [[building]]; [[hall]]
#: {{ux|tl|'''Bahay'''-pamahalaan ng Infanta, Quezon.|Infanta, Quezon administrative '''building'''.}}
# [[residence]]; [[home]]; [[abode]]; [[dwelling]]
#: {{syn|tl|tirahan|tahanan|tinitirhan|residensiya}}
# {{lb|tl|cards}} [[card]] [[set]]; [[meld]] {{q|in the {{w|tong-its}} game}}
# {{lb|tl|board game}} [[smaller]] [[hole]]s of a [[congkak]] [[board]]

