Page 2203 banda: Skipped, no changes
Page 2203 banda: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|es|banda||band; gang; bank; border; edge; side of a ship}}, from {{der|tl|fr|bande}}, from {{der|tl|pro|banda||regiment of troops}}, from {{der|tl|gmw-pro|*banda}} or {{der|tl|got|𐌱𐌰𐌽𐌳𐍅𐌰||sign; inidication; flag}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+<audio:Tl-PH-banda1.ogg>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[band]] {{q|of musicians}}
#: {{ux|tl|Maraming '''banda''' ang tutugtog sa palabas.|Many '''bands''' will perform in the show.}}
# [[group]] of [[people]], [[animal]]s, [[fowl]], etc.

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magbanda|makipagbanda|pagbabanda}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|tl|es|banda||band; sash}}, from {{der|tl|fr|bande}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|bande}}, of {{der|fr|gem|-}} origin, from {{der|fr|frk|*bindan|*binda|t=join, link}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+<audio:Tl-PH-banda1.ogg>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[narrow]] [[strip]] of [[band]] {{q|such as ribbon or metal bands}}

=====Related terms=====
{{rel3|tl|bandereta|banderilya|banderin|abanderado|bandera}}

===Etymology 3===
Early {{glossary|borrowing}} from {{bor|tl|es|banda||band; gang; bank; border; edge; side of a ship}}, from {{der|tl|fr|bande}}, from {{der|tl|pro|banda||regiment of troops}}, from {{der|tl|gmw-pro|*banda}} or {{der|tl|got|𐌱𐌰𐌽𐌳𐍅𐌰||sign; inidication; flag}}. Similar to etymology 1 but borrowed earlier, shown by the shift in stress.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bandá<audio:Tl-PH-banda2.ogg>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bandá|b=+}}

# [[direction]]; [[side]]; [[place]]
#: {{syn|tl|dako|gawi}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|banda sa|sa kabilang banda}}

====Preposition====
{{tl-prep|bandá|b=+}}

# [[around]] {{q|of location or time}}
#: {{ux|tl|Aalis ako nang '''bandang''' alas kuwatro ng hapon.|I'll leave at '''around''' four PM.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Banda''' roon lang nakalagay ang susi.|The keys have been placed just '''around''' there.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Dito '''banda''' dumaan si Tatay.|Father passed '''around''' here.}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|dapit}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:CEDOF|1|38}}

