Page 2243 banta: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*bantaq||to argue with}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*bantaq}}. Cognate with {{cog|ceb|banta||to warn someone not to do something; to plan to do harm}}, {{cog|id|-}} and {{cog|ms|bantah||altercation}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|bantá7|banta7<qq:obsolete><n^intent, intention>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|bantâ|b=+}}

# [[threat]]; [[menace]]
#: {{syn|tl|bala|panakot}}
#: {{uxi|tl|May '''banta''' sa akin ang mga kaaway ko.|My enemies have a threat against me.}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Banta''' sa seguridad ng bansa ang planong pagpasok ng ilang teroristang grupo mula sa Gitnang Silangan.|The planned entry of terrorist groups from the Middle East constitute a national security threat.}}
# [[suspicion]]; [[surmise]]
#: {{syn|tl|sapantaha|bintang}}
# {{lb|tl|Batangas|colloquial}} [[notion]]; [[idea]]
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[intent]]; [[intention]]; [[plan]]
#: {{syn|tl|balak|plano|hangad|hangarin}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magbanta|pagbantaan|pagbabanta}}

====References====
* {{R:Diccionario de terminos comunes tagalo-castellano|16}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala}}
-------- end text --------
