===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|nan-hbl|-}}, possibly {{m|zh|[[慢]][[遲遲]]|tr=bān tî-tî|t=[[sluggishly]] [[slow]]}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Chan-Yap 1980|page=133}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bantitì<n^>|bantitî<a^>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bantitì|b=+}}

# [[delay]]; [[withhold]]ing
#: {{syn|tl|antala}}
# [[hesitation]]; [[doubt]]
#: {{syn|tl|pag-uurong-sulong|pag-aalinlangan}}
# [[falling]] of [[liquid]] in [[small]] [[drop]]s

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|bantitî|b=+}}

# [[hesitant]]; [[irresolute]]
#: {{syn|tl|atubili|alinlangan|bantulot}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|tl|nan-hbl|-}}, according to the ''Vocabulario de la lengua tagala'' (1860).<ref>{{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860|41}}</ref> Possibly related to etymology 1.

====Pronunciation====
