Page 2446 basta: WARNING: Saw more than one rhyme in {{rhymes}}: {{rhymes|tl|a|asta|s=2}}
Page 2446 basta: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|bas|ta}}
Page 2446 basta: Replaced {{tl-IPA|bastâ}} with {{tl-pr|bastâ}}
Page 2446 basta: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 2446 basta: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|es|basta}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bastá|+}}

====Interjection====
{{tl-head|interjection|bastá|head2=+|b=+}}

# {{n-g|used to react when one refuses to give an explanation}}: [[just because]]!; [[none of your business]]!; no [[need]] to [[ask]]!; [[whatever]]!
#: {{ux|tl|Bakit ka nandito? '''Basta'''!|Why are you here? '''Just because'''!}}
# {{n-g|used to react to one's sudden loss for words during an explanation}}
#: {{ux|tl|Ay, '''basta'''! Nakakainis talaga siya!|Urghh, '''whatever'''! He's just so annoying!}}

====Conjunction====
{{tl-head|conjunction|bastá|head2=+|b=+}}

# [[as long as]]; [[provided]] [[that]]; [[only if]]
#: {{ux|tl|Kahit mahirap, '''basta't''' masipag, ay aasenso.|t=Even in poverty, '''as long as''' one is hardworking, one's lifestyle will improve.}}

====Adverb====
{{tl-adv|bastá|head2=+|b=+}}

# {{n-g|used to reduce the force of an imperative}}: [[simply]]; [[just]]
#: {{ux|tl|'''Basta''' panoorin mo ako.|'''Just''' watch me.}}
# {{n-g|used to emphasize that one's knowledge or concern is limited}}: [[just]]; [[all]] I [[know]] is that; all that [[matter]]s is that; [[all]] I can [[say]] is that
#: {{ux|tl|'''Basta''' ibinigay niya sa akin ang bata, at hindi na siya nagpaliwanag.|'''All I know is that''' he gave me the child, and he didn't explain.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Basta''' ayaw ako mahuli ng pulis.|I '''just''' don't want to be caught by the police.'''}}
# [[just]]; [[only]]; [[merely]] {{q|used in the negative}}
#: {{ux|tl|Hindi lang siya '''basta''' guwapo, matalino pa.|He's not '''just''' handsome, but intelligent too.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Magtrabaho ka naman at hindi '''basta''' natutulog lang buong araw.|Do your work and, not '''just''' sleep all day.}}
# {{n-g|used to emphasize lack of discernment in one's actions}}: [[just]]
#: {{ux|tl|Huwag kang '''basta''' maniniwala sa mga grupong nanghihikayat na sumama ka sa kanila.|Don't '''just''' believe in groups that persuade you to go with them.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|basta-basta|basta-bastahin}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bastâ}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bastâ|b=+}}

# [[packaging]]; [[packing]]; [[baling]]
#: {{syn|tl|pakete}}
# [[bundle]]; [[bale]]; [[large]] [[bundle]]
#: {{syn|tl|paldo}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|bastain|magbasta|mabasta|magbabasta|mambabasta|pagbabasta|pagkakabasta}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

