Page 2720 BI: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From [[Philippine English|Philippine]] {{bor|tl|en|BI}}, from an {{initialism|en|bad influence|nocat=1|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|bi7ay}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=bi ay}} {{tlb|tl|slang}}

# [[bad influence]] {{gl|something or someone that teaches others to do wrong or encourages wrong actions and thoughts by example}}
#* {{quote-book
|tl
|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Tara_Sulat_Tayo_Volume_1/oxZOEAAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=bad%20influence&printsec=frontcover
|year=2021
|title=Tara, Sulat Tayo Volume 1
|author=Emerald Blake
|publisher=Ukiyoto Publishing
|isbn=9789354907326
|page=93
|text=Gaya ng sabi ko last time. Maganda 'yong may accountability partner ka or writing buddy para may magre-remind sa iyo sa goals mo as a writer. Someone na hindi ka ibi-'''BI''' ('''bad influence''')
|t=Like I said last time. It will be great if you have an accountability partner or writing buddy so that someone can remind you of your goals as a writer. Someone who will not '''BI''' ('''bad influence''') you.
}}
#* {{quote-book
|tl
|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Time_After_Time/XAB7EAAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=BI%20bad%20influence
|year=2022
|title=Time After Time
|author=Rose Tan
|publisher=Precious Pages Corporation
|isbn=9786210307429
|text="No! Hindi kita kaibigan. Pahamak ka, eh. Ikaw ang totoong '''BI'''." '''Bad Influence'''. "Ikaw ang nagpapahamak sa'kin. Hindi ko alam kung bakit ka ganyan pero ayoko nang alamin. Just... stay away from me."
|t="No! You're not my friend. You're a danger, eh. You are the true '''BI'''." '''Bad Influence'''. "You are the one endangering me. I don't know why you are like that but I don't want to know. Just... stay away from me."
}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Tagalog Slang Dictionary|9}}
-------- end text --------
