===Etymology 1===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

=====Adjective=====
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# {{alt form|tl|bobo|t=foolish, stupid}}

=====Noun=====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{alt form|tl|bobo|t=fool, idiot}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*bubu}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*bubu}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*bubu₂}}. Cognate with {{cog|ami|fofo}}, {{cog|ilo|bobo}}, {{cog|ceb|bubu}}, {{cog|mg|vovo}}, {{cog|ms|bubu}}, {{cog|bpz|bufu}}, {{cog|bzq|pup}}, and {{cog|pon|uu}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[round]] [[bamboo]] [[basket]] used as a [[fish trap]]

===Etymology 3===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bubó}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bubó|b=+}}

# act of [[frighten]]ing and [[drive away|driving away]] a [[flock]] of [[bird]]s
#: {{syn|tl|bulabog|bulahaw}}
# [[sudden]] [[flight]] of [[bird]]s {{q|after being frightened and driven away}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|pagbubo|bubuhin|bumubo}}

===Etymology 4===
{{rfe|tl|possibly related to Etymology 5 "spill"?}}

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|búbò}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bubò|b=+}}

# [[cast]]ing; [[pour]]ing into a [[mold]]
# [[something]] [[form]]ed in a [[mold]]
#: {{syn|tl|molde}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|binubo|bubuan|bubuin|ibubo|magbubo|kabubo|mambububo|pagbubo|pagbububo}}

===Etymology 5===
From {{der|tl|poz-pro|*buqbuq||pour}}. Cognate with {{cog|pam|bubu}}, {{cog|ceb|bubu}}, and {{cog|jv|ꦧꦸꦧꦸꦃ||put in by accident}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bubô}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|bubô|b=+}}

# [[overflowing]]; [[pour out|pouring out]]
#: {{syn|tl|buhos|salin|ligwak|huho}}
# [[spill]]ed; [[poured]] out [[accidentally]]

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bubô|b=+}}

# [[act]] of [[pour out|pouring out]]
#: {{syn|tl|buhos|salin}}
# [[spillage]]; [[act]] of [[spill]]ing
#: {{syn|tl|ligwak}}
# [[spilled]] [[material]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|bumubo|ibubo|magbubo|mabubo}}
