===Etymology 1===
Derivation unknown. Either from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*budaq}},<ref>{{R:map:ACD|budaq1}}</ref> {{inh|tl|map-pro|*bujəq}} via {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*bujəq}},<ref>{{R:map:ACD|bujeq}}</ref> or {{bor+|tl|es|bula||bubble|nocap=1}}. The word {{m|es|burbuja}} has since displaced {{m|es|bula||bubble}} in Spanish, then the old meaning remained in Tagalog if borrowed.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bulâ}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bulâ|b=+}}

# [[foam]]; [[bubble]]; [[sud]]s
#: {{syn|tl|espuma|ampolya|subo|q3=obsolete}}
# [[foam]]ing [[saliva]] caused by [[disease]] or [[great]] [[excitement]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|bumula|magbula|bulang-gugo|mabula|sabula|magsabula|parang bula|may-sabula|pabulain|pampabula|bulangsagwan|bulantubig}}

===Etymology 2===
Possibly from {{der|tl|ms|bolak||prevarication}}. Alternatively, possibly from {{der|tl|nan-hbl|誣賴|tr=bû-lōa||to falsely incriminate}}, according to Manuel (1948).

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|búlà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bulà|b=+}}

# [[lie]]; [[falsehood]]; [[fib]]
#: {{syn|tl|kabulaanan|kasinungalingan}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|bulaan|bula-bulaan|mambula|di-nagkabula|kabulaanan|di-mapabubulaanan|magbulaan|magkabula|magpabulaan|pabulaanan|pabulaan|pagbubulaan|pagbulaanan}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*bulah}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*buləS||Shorea albus}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bulá}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bulá|b=+}}

# [[Philippine mahogany]] ({{taxlink|Toona calantas|species}})
#: {{syn|tl|kalantas}}

===Etymology 4===
{{bor+|tl|es|bula||bull}}, from {{der|tl|ML.|bulla||seal, sealed document; bull}}, from {{der|tl|la|bulla||bubble, rounded object}}. {{doublet|tl|bola}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[bull]] {{q|document}}

===Etymology 5===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|bulà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|bulà|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[scaring]] of [[crow]]s

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magbula|bulain|mamula}}

=====See also=====
{{col3|tl|bulaga|so|bugaw}}

====Interjection====
{{tl-head|interjection|bulà|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# {{n-g|word used for scaring crows away}}: [[shoo]]

