{{lbor|tl|ceb|bulan}} from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*bulan}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*bulan}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*bulaN}}. Proposed by Eusebio Daluz by the 20{{sup|th}} century to use the Visayan word instead of {{cog|tl|buwan||moon; month}} to distinguish {{m-g|moon}} and {{m-g|month}} to have equivalents for {{ncog|es|luna||moon}} and {{ncog|es|mes||month}}. {{doublet|tl|buwan}}.

