* {{sense|municipalities in Ilocos Sur and La Union}} Named after {{w|José Burgos}}, Filipino priest of the [[Gomburza]] movement.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|b=+}}

