#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=X5RkAAAAMAAJ&dq=mga+butsi&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=butsi|year=2002|title=Sa kagubatan ng isang lungsod|author=Abdon M. Balde Jr.|page=112
|passage=Alam n'yo , dito sa amin ay kinakain ang '''butsi'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=c78LAQAAMAAJ&dq=mga+butsi&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=butsi|year=2008|title=A Continuing Narrative on Philippine Theater: The Story of PETA: Philippine Educational Theater Association|author=Laura L. Samson, Jovenal D. Velasco, Philippine Educational Theater Association|page=45
|passage=Para namang '''butsi''' pala 'yon na may asukal. Ano ba ito, '''butsi''' lang ito. Of course, the chocolate was good.}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|tl|es|buche||gizzard; crop}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|butsé|butsí<qq:colloquial>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|butsé|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|anatomy}} [[crop]]; [[craw]] {{q|of fowl}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://archive.org/details/kanghsiconsolida0000kess/|year=1905|title=The Bible in Tagalog: Biblya _|publisher=BookRix|page=Levitico 1:16
|passage=At aalisin niya ang '''butsi''' pati ang mga balahibo, at ihahagis sa tabi ng dambana, sa dakong silanganan, sa kinalalagyan ng mga abo:}}
# {{lb|tl|slang|figurative|euphemistic}} [[anger]]
#: {{syn|tl|galit}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=UgORajfMyp8C&pg=PA108&dq=mga+butsi&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwji7sHM6KL0AhXzr1YBHS6LApUQ6wF6BAgKEAE#v=snippet&q=butsi&f=false|year=2006|title=(H)istoryador(a)|author=Victor Emmanuel Carmelo D. Nadera|page=108
|passage=Ang hirap sa inyo, ginagatungan ninyo ang taumbayan para magalit nang magalit sa pamahalaan at kapag nagputok na ang kanilang '''butsi''' saka kayo magtatakbuhan sa inyong mga bundok.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=zQ9xDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA94&dq=mga+butsi&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwji7sHM6KL0AhXzr1YBHS6LApUQ6wF6BAgGEAE#v=onepage&q=mga%20butsi&f=false|year=2018|title=Ang Lihim Ng Kahapon|author=Cristina de Leon|page=94
|passage=Sumasabog ang mga '''butsi''' ninyo sa pagrereklamo na natanggal kayo sa trabaho pero hindi man lang ninyo naisip na kahit na ano'ng kumpanya ang pagtrabahuhan ninyo, kung magnanakaw naman kayo ay talagang tatanggalin kayo.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=KLLfDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA216&dq=mga+butsi&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwji7sHM6KL0AhXzr1YBHS6LApUQ6wF6BAgFEAE#v=onepage&q=mga%20butsi&f=false|year=2019|title=Basag: Modernong Panitikan ng mga Kuwentistang Wasak|author=Juan Bautista|page=216
|passage=“L-Leon po,” nahihintakutang tugon ko na lalong nagpalatak sa kanilang mga '''butsi''' sa katatawa.}}

