===Etymology===
Elision of {{IPAchar|/l/}} from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*bulan}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*bulan}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*bulaN}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|bulan}}, {{cog|pag|bulan}}, {{cog|pam|bulan}}, {{cog|ceb|bulan}}, {{cog|hil|bulan}}, {{cog|war|bulan}}, {{cog|mrw|bolan}}, {{cog|id|bulan}}, {{cog|su|ᮘᮥᮜᮔ᮪}},  {{cog|jv|ꦉꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦭꦤ꧀}}, {{cog|ms|bulan}}, {{cog|fj|vula}}, {{cog|mg|volana}}, and {{cog|niu|pula}}. {{doublet|tl|bulan}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|buwán|+<qq:now uncommon><a:now,dialectal,Rizal,alternative>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|buwán|b=+}}

# [[moon]]
#: {{syn|tl|bulan|q1=neologism}}
# [[month]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|bubuwanin|kabilugan ng buwan|buwanan|buwan-buwan|kabuwanan|buwanang dalaw|buwang palaba|buwang kabilugan|buwang patunaw|bagong buwan|dagang buwan|patay ang buwan|hugis-buwan|kalahatian-ng-buwan|sambuwan|suntok sa buwan|tunaw na buwan}}

