[[Image:Crocodylus_acutus_jalisco_mexico.jpg|thumb|mga buwaya]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|buaya}}
* {{alt|tl|buhaya}}
* {{alt|tl|bwaya}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|tl|poz-pro|*buqaya}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*buqaya}}. Compare {{cog|ms|buaya}}, and {{cog|ebk|fowaya}}.

Senses of {{m-g|corrupt police officer; greedy and corrupt, etc.}}, from the 1970s and 1980s, are an allusion to the brown color of the {{w|Philippine Constabulary}} (PC) uniform.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}
{{rfap|tl}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[crocodile]]; [[caiman]]
#: {{syn|tl|kokodrilo}}
# {{lb|tl|by extension}} [[alligator]]
# {{lb|tl|slang}} [[corrupt]] [[police officer]]
# {{lb|tl|figuratively}} [[greedy]] or [[corrupt]] [[person]] {{q|especially a [[politician]]}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1987|author=Alfredo Navarro Salanga|title=Kamao: Tula Ng Protesta 1970–1986
|passage=Inaayunan pa nito, sa halip na bakahin ang nagmamalasakit na mga pinuno ng bayan. Ang mga '''buwaya''' at baboy sa Kongreso&#39;y patuloy na nasasandat.
|translation=He still agrees with them, instead of taking up the struggle of concerned national leaders. The "crocodiles" and "pigs" in Congress still remain in their positions.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1992|title=Rebolusyonaryong panunuring masa sa sining at panitikan: mga dokumento ng 1971 ng Panulat para sa Kaunlaran ng Sambayanan (PAKSA) at Nagkakaisang Progresibong Artista-Arkitekto (NPAA).|isbn=9789713300010
|passage=Ipinakikita si Marcos bilang isa sa mga '''buwaya''' na hawak-hawak ang tali ng gusaling kinaroroonan ng Con-Con.
|t=Marcos is shown as one of the "crocodiles" [corrupt politicians] holding a rope tied on the building where the Con-Con [Constitutional Convention] is held.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=2003|author=Jay De Castro|title=At tumestigo ang asintado: Gov. Luis "Chavit" Singson
|passage=Maraming beses silang kinutya at tinakot ng mga '''buwaya''' sa Kamara at ahas sa  Malacanang na walang ... Itinuloy nila ang kanilang sinimulang laban sa  Kongreso sa iba&#39;t ibang pulong sa mga paaralan at rally sa mga lansangan.
|translation=They are ridiculed and intimidated many times by the "crocodiles" (corrupt politicians) in the Batasang Pambansa and the "snakes" (turncoats) in Malacañang who have no ... They continued what they started against Congress at various conferences in schools and rallies in the streets...}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|figurative}}

# [[greedy]]; [[avaricious]]; [[rapacious]]
#: {{syn|tl|ganid|suwapang|masakim|makamkam}}
# [[corrupt]]
#: {{syn|tl|korap|kurakot|tiwali}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''buwayang''' pulis|'''corrupt''' policeman}}
# [[tricky]]
#: {{syn|tl|suwitik|magdaraya|manlilinlang}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|dilang-buwaya|buwaya sa katihan|buwakaw|luha ng buwaya|buwayang-lubog|buwayahin|balat-buwaya|mabuwaya}}

