Page 3936 daan: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|da7án|da7an<a:dialectal,Southern Tagalog>}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*dálan}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*zalan}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*zalan}}. Compare {{cog|pam|dalan}}, {{cog|bcl|dalan}}, {{cog|ceb|dalan}} / {{m|ceb|dan}}, {{cog|tsg|dān}}, {{cog|ckv|razan}}, {{cog|ch|chalan}}, {{cog|ms|jalan}}, and {{cog|ami|lalan}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|daán|head2=+|b=+}}

# [[path]]; [[way]]; [[road]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalye|lansangan|kalsada|yagban|kamino}}
# [[passageway]]; [[space]] to [[pass through]]
#: {{syn|tl|lagusan|daanan}}
# [[act]] of [[pass through|passing through]]; [[act]] of [[pass by|passing by]]
# [[act]] of [[drop in|dropping in]]
# [[elapsing]] {{q|of time}}
#: {{syn|tl|lipas|paglipas}}
# [[means]]; [[way]]; [[method]]
# {{lb|tl|possibly|obsolete|figurative}} [[capacity]] left of a person to eat [[food]] when eating

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alt|tl|raan||dialectal|Rizal|informal}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|daanan|dumaan|madaan|madaanan|makadaan|pagdaan|bigyang-daan|magbigay-daan|kaparaanan|karapatang dumaan|daanin|daangbakal|daang tuwiran|di-maraaanan|magdaan|paraan|pagpaparaan|maraanan|makiraan|magparaan|paraanin|maparaan|mapamaraan|para-paraan|nakaraan|nakararaan|pagdaraan|pagdaraanan|pamamaraan|pangnagdaan|tabing-daan|pinagdaraanan|pinagdaanan|sangandaan|dumaan sa butas ng karayom|idaan|daang-bayan|daraanan}}

{{numberbox|tl}}

===Etymology 2===
By extension of etymology 1 in the Southern Luzon axis. Compare {{cog|pam|dalan||hundred}}. Possibly related to {{cog|tft|cala|t=1000}} and {{cog|loa|calana|t=1000}}.

====Numeral====
{{tl-num|daán|head2=+|b=+}}

# {{cln|tl|cardinal numbers}} [[hundred]]
#: {{syn|tl|siyen|q1=uncommon}}

