{{bor+|tl|ms|jala}}, from {{der|tl|sa|जाल|t=net}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Potet|TBC|pages=70 & 278}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[small]] [[dragnet]]; [[casting]] [[net]]
# [[fishing]] with a [[small]] [[dragnet]]

