Page 4075 dalawa: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|dalawá}}
Page 4075 dalawa: Skipped, no changes
Page 4075 dalawa: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|dalaua|dalua||obsolete|Abecedario}}
* {{alt|tl|dalwa||uncommon}}

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|tl|dalwa}}, from earlier ''*darua'' < ''*dadua'', from Proto-Central Philippine ''*da-duha'' (with irregular loss of ''*h''), from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*duha|*da-duha}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*duha|*da-duha}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*duSa|*da-duSa}}. Cognate with {{cog|ms|dua}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|dalawá}}

===Numeral===
{{tl-num|dalawá|b=+}}

# [[two]]
#: {{syn|tl|dos}}

====Usage notes====
* To describe the quantity of something, the number is placed before the noun and affixed with a '''-ng''' when the word ends with a vowel, and a separate word '''[[na]]''' for a consonant.
*: '''''Isang''' saging, '''dalawang''' pinya''
*: '''''Apat na''' mansanas, '''anim na''' mangga''

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|dalawampu|bukas-makalawa|kamakalawa|dadalawahin|dalawahan|dala-dalawa|makalawa|dalawahin|ikalawa|pangalawa|ikalabindalawa|panlabindalawa|labindalawa|ikadalawampu|pandalawampu|makadalawa|samakalawa|pagdalawahin|pangalawahan|dadalawa|dalawandaan|dalawanlibo|dadalawampuin|dalawampu't anim|dalawampu't apat|dalawampu't dalawa|dalawampu't isa|dalawampu't lima|dalawampu't pito|dalawampu't siyam|dalawampu't tatlo|dalawampu't walo|tatlumpu't dalawa|apatnapu't dalawa|limampu't dalawa|animnapu't dalawa|pitumpu't dalawa|walumpu't dalawa|siyamnapu't dalawa|Ikalawang Digmaang Pandaigdig|magdalawang-isip|pangalawang batis|dumalawa}}

====Related terms====
