Page 4259 dati: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|+,date<q:colloquial>}}
Page 4259 dati: Skipped, no changes
Page 4259 dati: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|rati||dialectal|Rizal|informal}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|ms|jati||original; pure; genuine}}, from {{der|tl|pi|jāti||birth; nature; reality}}, from {{der|tl|sa|जाति||birth; production}}, according to Zorc (1982). {{doublet|tl|yari}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+,date<q:colloquial>}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# [[former]]; [[previous]]; [[old-time]]; [[ex-]]
#: {{syn|tl|noon|noong una|una}}
#: {{uxi|tl|Siya ang '''dati'''ng may-ari ng kompanyang ito.|He is the previous owner of this company.}}
# [[accustomed]]; [[used]] to
#: {{syn|tl|sanay|hirati}}
# [[old]]
#: {{syn|tl|matanda}}
#: {{uxi|tl|Giniba na ang '''dati'''ng simbahang nakatayo roon.|The '''old''' church there was already demolished.}}

===Adverb===
{{tl-adv|b=+}}

# [[originally]]; [[at first]]
#: {{syn|tl|noon|sa simula}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Dati''' nang maliit lang ang bahay na ito.|This house was small at first.}}
# [[previously]]; [[formerly]]; [[used to]]
#: {{syn|tl|noong una|noong araw}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Dati''' kaming dumadalaw sa lolo at lola namin.|We used to visit our grandparents.}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Dati''' silang nakatira sa Pampanga.|They previously lived in Pampanga.}}
#: {{uxi|tl|Bumalik kami sa '''dati''' naming pinuntahan.|We went back to the same place we went to.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|datihan|dati-rati|hirati|mahirati|pagkahiratihan|parati|paratihin}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:CEDOF|3|116}}

