===Etymology===
From {{m|tl|[[dayang|Dayang]] [[hirang|Hirang]]|t=the Chosen Lady}}, the title and name of a noblewoman from [[Batangas]], which became a cognomen after conversion to Christianity and was adopted as hereditary surname thereafter during Spanish rule. {{rfv-etym|tl}}

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|b=+}}

# {{surname|tl|from=Tagalog}}, ''most common in Batangas''

