Page 4529 di: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}} (3); remove {{rhymes}} same as auto-generated rhyme and syllable count (2); remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification (2)
Page 4529 di: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*diq|t=particle of negation}}. Blust (2010-) notes that this word is believed by some to be short for {{m|tl|hindi|t=no; not}}, but its agreement with the monosyllabic word in other languages suggests that this shorter form is older. See also {{m|tl|dili|t=not; no; hardly; rarely; seldom}}. Compare {{cog|tao|ji}}, {{cog|ilo|di}}, {{cog|isd|di}}, {{cog|ceb|[[di]]/[[dili]]}}, {{cog|mrw|di}}, {{cog|suc|di}}, {{cog|msk|di}}, {{cog|tsg|di'}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|di7|de7<qq:relaxed>}}

====Adverb====
{{tl-adv|dî|b=+}}

# [[no]]; [[not]]
#: {{ant|tl|oo|opo|q2=respectful}}

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alt|tl|'di}}
* {{alt|tl|d||text messaging|Internet slang}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|hindi|'di ba|'di nga|di hamak}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|tl|di-}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Adverb====
{{tl-adv|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|sometimes|preceded by {{l|tl|eh}}}} [[then]]; [[in that case]]
#: {{syn|tl|kung gayon|kung ganoon|kundi|q3=Marinduque|garod|q4=Nueva Ecija}}
#: {{ux|tl|Eh, '''di''' wow.|Well, '''then''' {{m-g|Wow}}.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Di''' sino ang daingan kundi ang Padre?|'''Then''' to whom to complain to if not the Father?}}
#: {{ux|tl|Kung sarado ang pintuan, '''di''' buksan mo.|If the door is closed, '''then''' open it.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sino pa bang maglilinis kung hindi si ate, '''di''' ako!|Who else would clean if not our older sister, '''then''' [none other than] me!}}

===Etymology 3===
{{bor+|tl|en|dee}}, the English name of the letter {{m|en|D}}/{{m|en|d}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{tl-letter name|D|d|alph=fil}}
#: {{syn|tl|da|q1=in the Abakada alphabet|de|q2=in the Abecedario}}

=====See also=====
* {{list:Latin script letter names/tl}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|diq}}

