#: {{syn|tl|himod}}
# [[tongue]] of a [[shoe]] {{gl|flap under the laces}}
# {{lb|tl|music}} [[reed]] {{q|of a woodwind instrument}}
# [[long]], [[narrow]] [[flame]]

