* {{alt|tl|jologs||common}}
* {{alt|tl|jolog}}
* {{alt|tl|jologz}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from a {{suffix|tl|{{blend|tl|dilis|t1=anchovy|tuyo|t2=dried fish|itlog|t3=egg|nocap=1}}|s}}, food which poor people eat.

