#: {{ux|tl|May mga '''dyologs''' na nakatira doon sa may estero.|Some '''slum youngster''' live by the estuary.}}
# [[person]] exhibiting the [[crude]] [[behavior]] of [[slum]] [[youngster]]s
#: {{ux|tl|Wag ka nga magulo, '''dyologs''' ka ...|Hey cut it out, you're being ''dyologs'' ...}}

