#: {{syn|tl|walang-hiya|makapal ang mukha|{{l|tl|masama|masama}} ang {{l|tl|ugali}}}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[contemptible]]; [[obnoxious]]; [[displeasing]]; [[gross]]
#: {{syn|tl|nakakadiri|karumal-dumal}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|gamól|b=+}}

# [[filth]] or [[dirt]] on the [[face]]
#: {{syn|tl|dumi|dungis|amol|amos|damos|musing}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative|colloquial}} [[ill-mannered]] person; [[indecent]] person; [[jerk]]

