Page 5605 gansa: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}} (2); remove {{rhymes}} same as auto-generated rhyme; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification (2)
Page 5605 gansa: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|ms|gangsa}}, variant of {{m|ms|angsa||goose}}, from {{der|tl|sa|हंस}}, from {{der|tl|iir-pro|*ȷ́ʰansás||goose}}, from {{der|tl|ine-pro|*ǵʰh₂éns||goose}}. Compare {{cog|pam|galsa}}, {{cog|bcl|gangsa}}, {{cog|war|gangsa}}, {{cog|ms|angsa}}, {{cog|jv|ꦒꦁꦱ}}, {{cog|my|ဟင်္သာ}}, and {{cog|hi|हंस}}. Some sources think it is from Spanish {{m|es|gansa||female goose}}, but this is rejected by Potet (2016) and Zorc (1982).

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|gansâ}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|gansâ|b=+}}

# [[goose]]; [[gander]]

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alt|tl|gangsa||obsolete}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|gansaan}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|tl|ms|gangsa||bell-metal; bronze}}, from {{der|tl|sa|कंस}}. Compare {{cog|id|kangsa}}, {{cog|jv|ꦒꦁꦱ}} and {{cog|ban|ᬕᬗ᭄ᬲ}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|percussion instruments}}

# [[Ifugao]] [[brass]] [[gong]] with [[convex]] [[side]] and [[forked]] [[stick]] as a [[handle]]

===Further reading===
* {{R:KWF Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860|120|'''GANGSA'''. pc. {{l|es|ganso}}.}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|328|Ganſo) Gangſa [(pc)] C. grande [que los] traen [de china]}}
* {{R:CEDOF|3|133}}
* {{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=282}}

{{C|tl|Geese}}
