Page 5789 ginhawa: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|guinhaoa|guinhaua||obsolete|Abecedario}}
* {{alt|tl|ginghawa}}

===Etymology===
From Proto-Central Philippine ''*ginhawa'', from Proto-Greater Central Philippine ''*gi-nihawa'' (cf. {{cog|ceb|ginhawa||breath}}, {{cog|mba|ganihawa||life}}, {{cog|msk|ginawa||breath}}, {{cog|mrw|ginawa||breath}}, {{cog|tsg|nyawa||soul}}), from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*ʀi-nihawa||breath}} (cf. {{cog|ilo|gin-awa||relief; comfort}}, {{cog|pag|linawa||breath}}, {{cog|pam|inaua||breath; respiration}}, {{cog|tao|inawan||breath}}), from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*nihawa}} (cf. {{cog|haw|manawa||feelings; heart}}, {{cog|jv|ꦚꦮ||life; soul}}, {{cog|ms|nyawa||life; soul}}, {{cog|mi|manawa||heart; breath}}, {{cog|tkl|manava||belly; abdomen}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*NiSawa}} (cf. {{cog|fos|xinawa||breath}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+,ginhawà}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|ginháwa|head2=ginhawà|b=+}}

# [[comfort]]; [[ease]] of [[living]]
# [[convenience]]; [[easiness]] {{q|in doing or making something}}
# [[prosperity]]; [[abundance]]; [[freedom]] from [[want]]
#: {{syn|tl|kasaganaan|pananagana}}
# [[consolation]]; [[satisfaction]]
#: {{syn|tl|aliw|kaaliwan|kasiyahan}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kaginhawahan|maginhawa|guminhawa|makaginhawa|magpaginhawa|paginhawahin|pampaginhawa|nakagiginhawa}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|Guinhawa}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|ginháwa|head2=ginhawà|b=+}}

# [[easy]]; [[convenient]] {{q|to do or make}}
# [[comfortable]] to [[use]]
#: {{syn|tl|kombenyente}}
# [[prosperous]]; [[abundant]]
#: {{syn|tl|masagana}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
