===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|h}}. Each pronunciation has a different source:
* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der-lite|tl|en|h}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m-lite|tl|ᜑ|sc=Tglg|tr=ha}}.
* Abecedario pronunciation is from {{der-lite|tl|es|h}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr
