Page 6228 -han: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 6228 -han: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}
Page 6228 -han: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Suffix===
{{tl-verb|b=+|addlpos=noun,adverb}}

# {{alt form|tl|-an|nocap=1|nodot=1}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, {{IPAchar|/h/}} is inserted before {{m|tl|-an}} when a root word ending with a vowel is not followed by a glottal stop. In some cases, phoneme change can occur and {{IPAchar|/h/}} becomes {{IPAchar|/n/}}.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|laba|[[labahan|laba'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|ganti|[[gantihan|ganti'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|talo|[[talunan|talu'''n'''an]]}}
* Sometimes, the final vowel of the root word disappears when the suffix is added.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|laba|labhan}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|bili|bilhan}}

