From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*hapun||to roost}}. Compare {{cog|bno|hapon}}, {{cog|bcl|hapon}}, and {{cog|hil|hapon}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[afternoon]]
# [[supper]]; [[dinner]]
#: {{syn|tl|paghahapunan}}
# [[perching]] of a [[bird]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagdapo|dapo}}
# [[roosting]] of [[fowl]]s {{q|usually in the late afternoon to rest and sleep}}

