Page 6279 Hapon: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|Japón||Japan}}, from {{der|tl|pt|Japão}}, from either or both:
* {{der|tl|ms|Jepun}}, from {{der|tl|nan-hbl|日本|tr=Ji̍t-pún}}, from {{der|tl|ltc|日本||sun origin}}.
* {{cog|id|-}} {{der|tl|ms|Jepang}}, from {{der|tl|nan-tws|日本|tr=Ji̍k-púng}}, from {{der|tl|ltc|日本||sun origin}}.
{{doublet|tl|Sapon}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|Hapón}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|Hapón|b=+}}

# {{place|tl|country|r/East Asia|t=Japan}}
#: {{syn|tl|Sapon|q1=obsolete}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|Hapón|b=+}}

# [[Japanese]] {{q|person}}
#: {{syn|tl|Hapones|Haponesa|q2=feminine|Sapon|q3=obsolete}}
#: {{ux|tl|Dumating ang mga turistang '''Hapon''' ngayong hapon.|The '''Japanese''' tourists arrived this afternoon.}}
# [[Japanese]] {{q|language}}
#: {{syn|tl|Hapones|Nihongo|Sapon|q3=obsolete}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|mag-Hapon|Hapunin|Hukbalahap}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|Hapones}}

===See also===
* {{l|tl|hapon}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|Hapón|b=+}}

# [[Japanese]] {{gl|pertaining to Japan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

