{{tl-verb|+|hinapunan|hinahapunan|hahapunan|b=+}}

# to [[perch]]; to [[roost]] on {{q|of a bird}}

====Conjugation====
{{tl-infl-in-an|h|a|pun|hapon|object}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|hapunán|b=+}}

