===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|hiraya}}

===Etymology===
Possibly ultimately from {{der|tl|sa|हृदय|t=soul, mind, spirit|lit=heart}}, according to Zorc (1982). Compare {{cog|pi|hadaya|t=feeling|lit=heart}}, {{cog|kaw|ḥṛdaya|t=mind}}, and {{cog|id|daya}}. Many sources say it is from {{cog|ceb|haraya}}, but Zorc (1982) does not believe so.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|harayà}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|harayà|b=+}}

# [[imagination]]
#: {{syn|tl|guniguni|imahinasyon}}

