===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|hayón}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|hayón|b=+}}

# [[over there]]! [[yonder]]! {{q|far from both the speaker and the person addressed}}
#: {{syn|tl|iyon}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|tl|hayun}}
* {{alt|tl|ayon}}

====See also====
{{tl-dem pronouns}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|hayón|b=+}}

# [[act]] or [[ability]] to [[carry on]] until the [[end]]
#: {{syn|tl|agdon}}
# [[farthest]] [[distance]] one can [[reach]]
#: {{syn|tl|abot}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|hayón|b=+}}

# [[able]] to [[carry on]] until the [[end]]
#: {{syn|tl|maaagdon|makaaagdon}}

