===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+|hihíp<qq:obsolete>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[blowing]] of [[air]] from one's [[mouth]]
# [[playing]] of a [[wind instrument]]
# [[gust]] of [[wind]]; [[puff]] of [[wind]]
#: {{syn|tl|simoy}}
# [[blowpipe]] to [[stoke]] a [[fire]] by [[blowing]] {{q|usually a small bamboo or iron tube}}

