# [[play]]ing with a [[baby]] while [[carry]]ing it and [[pretend]]ing to [[tickle]] it to make it [[laugh]] {{defdate|18th|19th c.}}
# [[tickle|tickling]] all over the [[body]] {{defdate|16th|17th c.}}

====Usage notes====
* Fr. Domingo de los Santos (1835) provided an illustration of playing with a child wherein feet are played with the palms.

