* {{bor+|tl|es|hipocondría}}, influenced by the pronunciation of {{der|tl|en|hypochondria}}, from {{der|tl|ML.|hypochondria}}, from {{der|tl|LL.|hypochondria}}.

Both routes come from the plural of {{der|tl|la|hypochondrium}}, from {{der|tl|grc|ὑποχόνδριον}}.

