Page 6739 huli: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*udəhi||last; come after or behind; late}} with metathesis. Cognate with {{cog|ilo|udi}}, {{cog|bcl|huri}}, {{cog|ceb|[[ulhi]], [[ulahi]]}}, {{cog|mrw|ori}}, {{cog|ms|udi||back, subsequent}}, and {{cog|ban|uri||back; be behind}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|hulí}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|hulí|b=+}}

# [[last]]; [[final]]
#: {{syn|tl|katapusan|pangkatapusan|wakas|pangwakas|panghuli|kahuli-hulihan}}
# [[late]]; [[tardy]]
#: {{syn|tl|atrasado|gahol}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Huli''' ka na sa eskwela!|You are already '''late''' for school!}}
# [[previous]]; [[last]]
#: {{syn|tl|nakaraan}}
#: {{ux|tl|Tingnan mo ang '''huli'''ng labas ng dyaryo.|Look at '''previous''' issue of the newspaper.}}
# [[left]] [[behind]] {{q|as in a race}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|hulí|b=+}}

# [[lateness]]; [[tardiness]]
#: {{syn|tl|atraso|pagkaatraso|kaatrasuhan|pagkahuli}}
# [[person]] or [[thing]] arriving [[late]]
#: {{ux|tl|Papasukin ninyo ang '''huli'''.|Let the '''late''' (person) enter.}}
# [[back]]; [[rear]]
#: {{syn|tl|hulihan|likod|likuran|puwit|puwitan}}
#: {{ux|tl|Pumasok ka sa pinto sa '''huli'''.|Enter through the door at the '''rear'''.}}
# [[tail]]; [[tail-end]]
#: {{syn|tl|buntot}}
#: {{ux|tl|Inilagay siya sa '''huli''' ng pila.|He was put at the '''tail''' of the line.}}
# [[last]]; [[final]]
#: {{syn|tl|wakas|katapusan}}

====Adverb====
{{tl-adv|hulí|b=+}}

# [[last]]; [[previously]]
#: {{ux|tl|Kailan ka '''huli'''ng nagpakonsulta sa doktor?|When did you '''last''' consult the doctor?}}
# [[late]]; [[tardily]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|hulihan|kahulihan|pinakahuli|kahuli-hulihan|huling-habilin|huling-paalam|huling-salita|huling-rekurso|ikahuli|ihuli|ipahuli|ipagpahuli|magkanghuhuli|mahuli|manghuli|mapahuli|pagkahuli|pamahulihan|panghuli|sa huli|huling hantungan|Huling Hapunan|Huling Paghuhukom|hukumang huling dulugan|Simbahan ni Jesucristo ng mga Banal sa mga Huling Araw}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

