#: {{syn|tl|silo|pagsilo}}
# [[catch]] {{q|from hunting or fishing}}
#: {{syn|tl|nadakip|nasilo}}
#: {{ux|tl|Kamusta ang '''huli''' ngayon?|How was the '''catch''' for today?}}
# [[person]] [[under arrest]]

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# [[caught]]; [[arrested]]; [[apprehended]]
#: {{syn|tl|nahuli|hinuli|inaresto|dinakip|tutop|q5=caught in the act}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''huli''' sa akto|'''caught''' in the act}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|hulihan|hulihin|humuli|ipanghuli|magpahuli|mahuli|manghuli|mapanghuli|pagkakahuli|paghuli|pahuli|panghuli|magkahulihan ng loob|huli ka|huli sa akto|tagahuli}}

