===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*huluʀ}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*huluʀ}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*Suluʀ||to lower, let down, as on a rope}}. Compare {{cog|pwn|surur||a taut-stretched line}}, {{cog|ilo|ulog||to descend, go down}}, {{cog|bcl|hulog}}, {{cog|ceb|hulog}}, {{cog|tsg|hulug}}, {{cog|ms|hulur||letting go, slacking or paying out (a line)}}, and {{cog|mqy|ulur||to lower, let oneself down}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<n^>|hulóg<a^>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[fall]]; [[falling]] {{q|from a height}}
#: {{syn|tl|bagsak|pagbagsak|lagpak|paglagpak|laglag|paglaglag}}
# [[drop]]; [[dropping]] {{q|of something}}
# [[accidental]] [[fall]] {{q|from a high place}}
#: {{syn|tl|bulid|pagbulid|pagkabulid}}
# [[lapse]]; [[slip]] {{q|into a bad habit}}
#: {{syn|tl|pagkabuyo|pagkaligaw}}
# [[failure]] {{q|in examinations}}
#: {{syn|tl|bagsak|kalabasa|kamote}}
# [[capture]]; [[ensnarement]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagkabihag|pagkadakip|pagkakadakip}}
# [[dropping]] of a [[letter]] in a [[mailbox]]
# [[payment]] by [[installment]]
#: {{syn|tl|paghuhulog|paghuhurnal}}
# [[installment]] {{q|payment}}
#: {{syn|tl|aplaso|hurnal}}
#: {{ux|tl|Tatlong '''hulog''' na lang ang kailangan para bayad ka na sa utang.|You only need three '''installments''' for your debt to be paid.}}
# [[contribution]] [[paid]]; [[fee]]; [[quota]] {{q|to an organization as a member}}
#: {{syn|tl|kontribusyon|ambag|butaw}}
# {{lb|tl|banking}} [[amount]] of [[deposit]]
#: {{syn|tl|deposito}}
# [[tally]] {{q|count, number}}
#: {{syn|tl|paya|tantos}}
# [[translation]]
#: {{syn|tl|salin|pagsasalin|pagkakasalin}}
# [[meaning]] {{q|of a word}}
#: {{syn|tl|kahulugan}}
# one's [[interpretation]]; [[explanation]]; [[version]]
#: {{syn|tl|pakahulugan|palagay|paliwanag}}
# [[grace]]; [[blessing]] {{q|from God}}
#: {{syn|tl|pala|pagpapala|kaloob|grasya|talaga|q5=colloquial}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''hulog''' ng langit|'''blessing''' from heaven}}
