#*: Malakas na humagikgik ang tatlong salbaheng daga. “Di hamak na mas malaki  ang ating ihian!” The rats have long been observing the habits of Joyce&#39;s family.  From their burrow built by the older rats, they could even watch each member of&nbsp;...

