Page 6830 huy: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Probably a variation of {{m|tl|hoy}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|colloquial|informal}} {{alt form|tl|hoy}}: {{n-g|expression used to call the attention of somebody}}: [[hey]]!
#: {{ux|tl|'''Huy'''! Gising ka na!|'''Hey'''! Wake up already!}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial|informal}} {{alt form|tl|hoy}}: {{n-g|expression used as a warning or as a protest}}: [[hey]]!
#: {{ux|tl|'''Huy''', hindi ako ang kumuha ng pera mo!|'''Hey''', it's not me who took your money!}}

====Usage notes====
* Compared to {{m|tl|hoy}} which can be perceived as disrespectful in some contexts, the expression {{m|tl|huy}} is perceived as more low-key, thus more casual.

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|uy|oy}}

