===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*i-}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|b=+}}

# {{non-gloss definition|benefactive trigger}}: to perform the action of the verb for someone or something {{q|expresses various kinds of actions}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|i-|bili|t2=buy|ibili|t3=to buy something for someone}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Ibili''' mo ako ng saging.|'''Buy''' me bananas.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|object trigger}}: to do something to a person or a thing {{q|expresses various kinds of actions}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|i-|tapon|t2=throw|itapon|t3=to throw}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Itapon''' mo iyan sa basurahan.|Throw that to the garbage.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|instrumental trigger}}: to use something for a certain purpose {{q|expresses various kinds of actions}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|i-|sulat|t2=write|isulat|t3=to use something for writing}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Isulat''' mo ng listahan ang lapis.|Use the pencil to write a list.}}

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|tl}}

===Further reading===
* https://learningtagalog.com/grammar/verbs/verb_affixes/i_1.html
* https://learningtagalog.com/grammar/verbs/verb_affixes/i_2.html

