===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*i-kahu}} (compare {{cog|bcl|ika}}, {{cog|ceb|ikaw}}, {{cog|ch|hao}}, {{cog|haw|ʻoe}}, {{cog|hil|ikaw}}, {{cog|ms|engkau}}, {{cog|mi|koe}}, {{cog|rap|koe}}, and {{cog|war|ikaw}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*(i-)kaSu}} (compare {{cog|tay|isu'}}, {{cog|ami|kiso}}, {{cog|bnn|kasu}}, and {{cog|dru|kusu}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|ikáw}}

===Pronoun===
{{tl-pron|ikáw|b=+}}

# [[you]] {{q|singular}}
#: {{syn|tl|ka|q=postpositive form}}

====Usage notes====
The word '''''ikaw''''' is replaced by {{m|tl|ka}} in the inverted sentence position when it is the topic of the sentence and immediately followed by a noun, verb, adjective, or adverb in a phrase.

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kaikawan|ika'y}}

====See also====
{{tl-personal pronouns}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|ikáw|b=+}}

