Page 7102 impo: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|im|po}}
Page 7102 impo: Replaced {{tl-IPA|impó}} with {{tl-pr|impó}}
Page 7102 impo: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 7102 impo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Either from the following:
* From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*əmpu|t=grandparent/grandchild (recipr.); ancestor; lord, master, owner}}<ref name="Blust"/>
* From {{der|tl|nan-hbl|-}}, possibly {{m|nan-hbl|姆婆|tr=ḿ-pô}}<ref name="Hispanico-Sinicum"/> or {{m|nan-hbl|引婆|tr=ín-pô}},<ref name="Chin1"/><ref name="Chin2"/> recorded in the Dictionario Hispanico Sinicum (1626-1642) as “''m̄ pō''” and “''ìn pō''”.<ref name="Hispanico-Sinicum"/>

Zorc (1985) records both etymologies but finds the Chinese etymology as less likely.<ref name="Zorc"/>

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|impó}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|impó|b=+}}

# [[grandmother]]
#: {{syn|tl|lola|lelang|abwela|agwela|q4=archaic|inana|q5=dialectal|inang-tanda|inda-poon}}

====Coordinate terms====
{{col3|tl|ingkong}}

===References===
<references>
<ref name="Blust">{{R:map:ACD|empu}}</ref>
<ref name="Hispanico-Sinicum">{{R:Dictionario Hispanico Sinicum|23/10 & 36/18 & 170/151 & 322/300}}</ref>
<ref name="Chin1">{{cite-book|title=晋江市方言志|page=51 (PDF) / 119 (Book)|url=https://www.slideshare.net/terrifuc/ss-157157583}}</ref>
<ref name="Chin2">{{cite-book|year=1913|title=最新番婆弄公婆拖歌本|page=8|location=上海市|publisher=國立臺灣大學圖書館特藏組|url=https://dl.lib.ntu.edu.tw/s/kua-a-tsheh/item/691269#?c=&m=&s=&cv=7&xywh=1504%2C112%2C788%2C713}}</ref>
<ref name="Zorc">{{R:CEDOF|4|179}}</ref>
</references>

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

