Possibly from {{noncog|nan-hbl|蔭|tr=ìm|t=to protect; to shelter}} + {{noncog|nan-hbl|寶|tr=pó|t=treasure}}, according to Manuel (1948). However, Chan-Yap (1980) disagrees that the word comes from the said Hokkien morphemes.

