===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|India||India}}, from {{der|tl|la|India}}, from {{der|tl|grc|Ἰνδία}}, from {{m|grc|Ἰνδός|t=Indus River}}, from {{der|tl|peo|𐏃𐎡𐎯𐎢𐏁|tr=hi<sup>n</sup>dūš}}, from {{der|tl|sa|सिन्धु|t=a river, stream|tr=síndhu}}.

