{{bor+|tl|nan-hbl|-}}, possibly {{m|nan-hbl|[[引叔]]|tr=ín-chek|t=uncle}}<ref>{{R:Dictionario Hispanico Sinicum|170/151 & 522/497}}</ref><ref>{{cite-web|date=March 10, 2019|title=紀念“宿務無名氏（引叔）”施維鵬 2018-2019年度校長、教師昨舉行頒獎典禮|work=菲律賓商報 Chinese Commercial News|location=Binondo, Manila|url=http://www.shangbao.com.ph/qtdt/2019/03-10/80345.shtml}}</ref><ref>{{cite-web|date=October 26, 2021|title=中正學院培幼園 三位教師獲僑委會獎|work=CKS College News|location=Tondo, Manila|url=https://cksc.edu.ph/archives/news/2362-2021-10-25-17-18-07}}</ref><ref>{{cite-web|title=宿霧施維鵬 仙逝|work=世界臨濮施氏宗親總會|location=彰化縣鹿港鎮復興路|titleurl=http://www.linpokshih.com.tw/page/publication/show.aspx?num=114&page=6}}</ref><ref>{{cite-book|last=Chu|first=Richard T.|year=2012|title=Chinese and Chinese Mestizos of Manila: Family, Identity, and Culture, 1860s-1930s|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=PRewCQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Santiago+Guan+yu&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjahaHCier7AhV9s1YBHQRNCTQQ6AF6BAgFEAI#v=onepage&q=Santiago%20Guan%20yu&f=false|page=1}}</ref> or {{m|nan-hbl|[[𪜶]][[叔]]|tr=in chek|lit=his/her/their uncle}}. Compare {{cog|ceb|Insik}}, {{cog|ms|encik}}, {{cog|id|encek}}, {{cog|th|เจ๊ก}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|Intsík}}

