===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|espagete||colloquial}}
* {{alt|tl|spageti}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|en|spaghetti}}, from {{der|tl|it|spaghetti}}, plural of {{m|it|spaghetto}}. The dance move was popularized by {{w|SexBomb Girls}} who released ''The Spageti Song'' in 2003.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+|spageti<qq:colloquial>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[spaghetti]]
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1997|author=Teresita Ang See; Caroline Sy Hau; Joaquin Sy|title=Voices Mga Tinig The Best of Tulay
|passage=Para maugpungan ang kita ng bana, alas-kuwatro pasado pa lang ng madaling-araw ay nagigising na siya para magprito ng saba, lumpia, kamote, at magluto ng biko, '''ispageti''' at iba pang meryenda.}}
# {{lb|tl|dances}} [[dance move]] in which the [[dancer]] would [[twirl]] down then up while pointing the [[index finger]] up with [[elbow]]s [[bent]]

