Page 7604 itlog: Skipped, no changes
Page 7604 itlog: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|iklog||uncommon}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*qitəluʀ}} (compare {{cog|akl|itlog}}, {{cog|ceb|itlog}}, {{cog|ilo|itlog}}, {{cog|xbr|tilo}}, {{cog|mg|atody}}, {{cog|ms|telur}}, {{cog|slm|iklug}}, {{cog|tsg|iklug}}, {{cog|tet|tolun}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*qiCəluʀ}} (compare {{cog|xnb|'iciuru}}, {{cog|ckv|tiRuR}} and {{cog|pwn|qecilu}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|itlóg<audio:Tl-PH-itlog.ogg>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|itlóg|b=+}}

# [[egg]]
#: {{ux|tl|Gusto kong bumili ng '''itlog'''.|I want to buy some '''eggs'''.}}
# {{lb|tl|anatomy|euphemistic|colloquial|sometimes|_|vulgar}} [[testicles]]
#: {{syn|tl|bayag}}
#: {{ux|tl|O, ano, gusto mo palang basagin ko ang '''itlog''' mo!?|You want me to break your balls, don't you!?}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=2014|author=Demver Gomez|title=Diary Ng Itlog Ko
|passage=Kuya, puwedeng pahawak ng '''itlog''' mo? Nagulat akong bigla sa sinabi niya. Bakit mo hahawakan? Kasi parang sarap himasin, parang masarap tikman at mukhang mabango. What the fuck? Ok lang kaya ito.<br>Bro, can I touch your balls? I'm shocked by what he said. Why will you touch it? Because I think it feels good to touch, tastes good, and smells good. What the fuck? This is OK, you know?}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1987|title=Tulay: Literary Journal of the World News
|passage=Mapapahagikhik ito sabay nahihiyang tingin sa pangkat ng mga batang ang sabi ng suot na uniporme'y Cecilio Apostol High School. "Huwag kang malikot," anang Announcer sa bata. "Baka 'yang '''itlog''' mo ang gawin kong sisiw."}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[score]] of [[zero]] {{q|on an examination, game, etc.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|bahay-itlog|balat-itlog|puti ng itlog|pritong itlog|hugis-itlog|tabas-itlog|itlog na pula|itlugan|itlugin|mag-iitlog|maitlog|mangingitlog|mangitlog|paing-itlog|paitlugan|pangitlugan|paitlugin|pangingitlog|pula ng itlog|pipisaing-itlog|tuktukan ng itlog|umitlog|itlog-balang|itlog-buwaya|betlog|tagaitlog|tagapangitlog|itlog-na-maalat}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|bor=1|alj|itlog}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|estrelyado}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|qiCeluR}}

{{C|tl|Eggs}}
