}}
{{tl-noun|jéjemón|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|slang}}

# a style of [[text]]ing or [[type|typing]] words with unnecessary [[alternating caps]], [[addition]] of extra letters, and [[substitution]] of letters with similar looking or sounding [[keyboard]] [[character]]s which may in turn, seem [[incomprehensible]] to others
