{{bor+|tl|es|Joló}}, spelled historically as {{m|es|Xoló}} with the initial most likely pronounced with the {{w|Early Modern Spanish}} {{IPAfont|/}}{{IPAlink|ʃ}}{{IPAfont|/}} sound, from {{der|tl|tsg|Sulug|t=Sulu}}, an older form of {{m|tsg|Sūg|t=Sulu}}, possibly from {{der|tl|tsg|sulug}}, an older form of {{m|tsg|sūg||current}}.<ref>{{cite-book|last=Saleeby|first=Najeeb M.|title=The History of Sulu|url=https://www.gutenberg.org/files/41771/41771-h/41771-h.htm|year=1908|page=133}}</ref> Compare {{cog|mrw|Solog|t=Sulu; Jolo}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|Holó}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|Joló|b=Holo}}

# {{place|tl|provincial capital|p/Sulu|c/Philippines|t=Jolo}}
# {{place|tl|island|c/Philippines|t=Jolo}}

