#: {{coord|tl|Inang Bayan}}
# {{alt sp|tl|Juan de la Cruz}}: {{w|John of the Cross}}

====Usage notes====
* Where a middle name or maternal surname is provided, this may also be rendered as [[Juan Reyes dela Cruz]] or [[Juan Santos dela Cruz]].

