===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|kagad}}
* {{alt|tl|kaagar||dialectal|Rizal|informal}}

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|tl|ka-|agad}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|ka7agád}}

===Adverb===
{{tl-adv|kaagád|b=+}}

# [[right away]]; [[immediately]]
#: {{syn|tl|kawasa|madali|madalian|kapagdaka|di-kawasa|mandin|q6=enclitic}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kaagad''' akong pinunta sa hospital.|I was '''immediately''' sent to the hospital.}}

====Usage notes====
* The word can be used as an enclitic.
*: {{ux|tl|Dumating sila '''kaagad'''.|They came '''immediately'''.}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
