#: {{syn|tl|babae|kaapid|kalaguyo|kerida|bata|q5=colloquial|kaagulo}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1996|title=Ani
|passage=May tomboy na kasama ang '''kabit''' niyang Pinay, pulos lilimampuin ang hawak. May isang weyter na TNT na nguya nang nguya sa isang tabi at panay ang  sagupsop ng orange juice. May playboy na ngising-demonyo, tipong sinusuwerte.
|translation=His Filipina mistress is joined by a lesbian, holding fifty-liter bottles. There is a waiter, an illegal, who keeps on chewing and sipping orange juice on the corner. There is also a playboy who smiles like the devil, one who is happy-go-lucky.}}

