===Etymology===
From Proto-Central Philippine ''*kahuy'', from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*kahiw}} (cf. {{cog|ceb|kahoy}}, {{cog|pam|kiew}}, and {{cog|tao|kayo}}), from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*kahiw}} (cf. {{cog|mg|hazo}}, {{cog|ms|kayu}}, and {{cog|mi|kau}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*kaSiw}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<audio:Tl-PH-kahoy.ogg>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[wood]]
# [[lumber]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|bungangkahoy|bulak-kahoy|kahuyan}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# [[wooden]]

