Page 7960 kakampink: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|kakampínk}}
Page 7960 kakampink: Skipped, no changes
Page 7960 kakampink: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
A {{blend|tl|kakampi|t1=ally|pink|lang2=en|nocap=1}}, the color associated with Robredo's campaign.<ref>{{cite-journal|date=November 23, 2021|title=Leni, Kiko hold joke session; ask supporters to spread joy, happiness|journal=Manila Bulletin|passage=Kakampink is a combination of the words ‘kakampi (ally)’ and ‘pink,’ the campaign color of Robredo.}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kakampínk}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kakampínk|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|Philippine politics|slang}}

# a supporter of 14th Philippine vice-president {{w|Leni Robredo}} on her {{w|2022 Philippine presidential election}} campaign
#* {{quote-journal|tl|year=2021|title=Leni, Kiko hold joke session; ask supporters to spread joy, happiness|journal=Manila Bulletin|quotee=Senator Kiko Pangilinan|passage=At kami, tayo po, araw-araw sa nakikita naming pagkukusa po ninyo, napapangiti rin kami, dahil ramdam namin ng pagmamahal ninyong mga '''kakampink''' at ng ating mga kababayan.|t=And us, because we see you volunteering every day, you make us smile, too, because we can feel your love, '''kakampinks''' and our fellowmen.|month=November 23}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=May 16, 2022|title=VP Leni, mga anak sinalubong ng ilang ‘kakampink’ sa New York|work=ABS CBN News|url=https://news.abs-cbn.com/video/news/05/16/22/vp-leni-mga-anak-sinalubong-ng-ilang-kakampink-sa-new-york |text=Masayang sinalubong ng mga “'''kakampink'''” sa New York sina Vice President Leni Robredo at mga anak niya paglapag ng kanilang eroplano mula Pilipinas.|t=Her “'''kakampink'''” supporters in New York greet Vice President Leni Robredo and her children as their plane arrives from the Philippines.|trans-title=VP Leni, children met by ‘kakampink’ in New York}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=February 12, 2023|author=Nitz Miralles|title=Sen. Imee gumanda, Cristine at Eula favorite ng ‘the bash’!|work=Philstar|url=https://www.philstar.com/pang-masa/pang-movies/2023/02/12/2244351/sen-imee-gumanda-cristine-eula-favorite-ng-the-bash |text=Ngayon naman, si Eula ang binabakbakan ng mga basher at '''Kakampink'''.|t=Now Eula is fighting the haters and the '''Kakampink'''.|trans-title=Senator Imee doing better, Cristine and Eula favorite of ‘the bash’!}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|pinklawan}}

===References===
<references/>
-------- end text --------
