Page 8059 kalatas: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|kalatás}}
Page 8059 kalatas: Skipped, no changes
Page 8059 kalatas: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|calatas|caltas||obsolete|Abecedario}}
* {{alt|tl|kaltas||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from the following:
* Early {{glossary|tl|borrowing}} from {{der|tl|es|cartas}}, plural of {{m|es|carta||letter, missive, chart}}, from {{der|tl|la|charta}}. The Spanish etymology was provided by the ''Vocabulario de la lengua tagala'' of Noceda & Sanlucar, and by the {{w|Commission on the Filipino Language}}.
* From {{der|tl|ms-cla|kertas|t=paper}}, from {{der|tl|ar|قِرْطَاس}}, from {{der|tl|arc|קַרְטֵיסָא}} / {{m|syc|ܩܪܛܝܣܐ|tr=qarṭīsā}}. However, according to Potet (2013), paper was little known by 15{{sup|th}} century in the {{w|Malay archipelago}}.
Both routes come from {{der|tl|grc|χάρτης}}, possibly derived from {{der|tl|phn|𐤇𐤓𐤈𐤉𐤕}}.  Compare {{cog|mdh|kalëtas}} / {{m|mdh|kaltas}} / {{m|mdh|karatas|t=paper}}, {{cog|mrw|karatas|t=paper}}, {{cog|tsg|kātas|t=paper}}, {{cog|kxd|keratas}}, and {{cog|ms|kertas}}. {{doublet|tl|karta|tsart|kard}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kalatás}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kalatás|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|archaic}}

# [[paper]]
#: {{syn|tl|papel}}
# [[letter]] {{gloss|written message}}
#: {{syn|tl|sulat|liham}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:KWF Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:tl:Leo James English|page=277}}
* {{R:Diksyunaryo tesauro Pilipino-Ingles 1973|page=226}}
* {{R:Diccionario tagálog-hispano|432}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860|78}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|463|Papel) Calatas (pc) C. anſi le ſolian llamar .{{!}}. caltas. pero y ale llaman todos papel.}}
* {{R:CEDOF|2|68}}
* {{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=317}}
* {{R:tl:Potet|APL|page=204}}
* {{R:tl:Hispanismos 1972|page=118|q=kalatas}}

{{C|tl|Paper}}
