Page 8110 kalingkingan: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 8110 kalingkingan: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|calinquing̃an|calingquing̃an|calincqing̃an||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|kalinkingan}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*k<al>iŋkiŋ}}, from {{der|tl|poz-pro|*kiŋkiŋ}}. Compare {{cog|bno|kamayingking}}, {{cog|akl|kumaeengking}}, {{cog|ceb|kumayingking}}, {{cog|hil|kamalingking}}, {{cog|war|kamuyingking}}, {{cog|yka|kingking}}, {{cog|mdh|kingking}}, {{cog|tsg|kingking}}, {{cog|id|kelingking}}, {{cog|ms|kelengkeng}}, {{cog|kaw|kaliṅkiṅan}}, and {{cog|tpi|kilikili}}. {{surf|tl||alt1=*kalingking|-an}}, the root from {{infix|tl||alt1=*kingking|*al}}. (c.f. {{cog|ms|-el-}} infix).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kálingkíngan}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kálingkíngan|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|anatomy}} [[little finger]] or [[little]] [[toe]]; [[pinky]]
#: {{syn|tl|hinliliit}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[bound]]; [[boundary]]; [[confine]]; [[limit]]
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=J77kDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA45&dq=wala+ka+pa+sa+kalingkingan&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj6lajY_K31AhX7sFYBHcvsD1oQ6AF6BAgIEAI#v=onepage&q=wala%20ka%20pa%20sa%20kalingkingan&f=false|year=2016|title=That Promdi Girl: Book 3|author=owwSIC|page=45|text=Kumpara sa'yo, 'yang hinanakit mo, wala pa sa '''kalingkingan''' ng mga hinanakit na naranasan ko.|t=Compared to you, that [[hurt#Noun|hurt]] in you, it's not yet at the '''bounds''' of the [[hurt#Noun|hurt]] I experienced.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der2|tl|wala sa kalingkingan|ang sakit ng kalingkingan, damdam ng buong katawan|gakalingkingan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|219|Dedo) Calingcqing̃an (pp) q̃ llamanos meñique}}
