* {{alt|tl|calunuran||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|calonoran||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|canloran||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|kalunuran||archaic}}

===Etymology===
From a {{metathesis|tl||nocap=1}} of a {{sync|tl|kalunuran|nocap=1}} ({{af|tl|lunod|ka- -an}}), meaning the "place of drowning" because the sun "drowns" or sets in the west. Compare {{cog|ceb|kalundan}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|hmp=Kanluran}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[west]]; the [[direction]] of [[sunset]]
#: {{syn|tl|oeste|oksidente|habagat|q3=obsolete}}
#: {{ux|tl|Pa'''kanluran''' ang tinatakbo ngayon ng bagyo|The typhoon is now moving to the '''west'''}}

====Coordinate terms====
* {{list:compass points/tl}}

