Page 8369 kapal: Skipped, no changes
Page 8369 kapal: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|capal||obsolete|Abecedario}}

===Etymology 1===
From Western {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*kapal}} or {{inh|tl|map-pro|*kaS(ə)pal}}. Compare {{cog|id|kapal}} and {{cog|ms|kapal}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|kapál|b=+}}

# [[thickness]]
# [[multitude]]; [[numerousness]]
#: {{syn|tl|dami|tambak|sagana|damulas|katerba}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial|derogatory}} {{ellipsis of|tl|kapal ng mukha}}
#: {{ux|tl|Ang '''kapal''' talaga ng hayop na yun!|The '''shamelessness''' of that animal!}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|makapal|kumapal|kapalan|pakapalin|kapal ng mukha|pagkapal|magpakapal|pampakapal|kakapalan}}

===Etymology 2===
Unknown. Possibly related to etymology 1 or an apocope from {{bor|tl|ms|kepala||head, source (metaphorical)}}, from {{der|tl|sa|कपाल||head}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|kapál|b=+}}

# [[figure]]; [[creation]]
#: {{syn|tl|likha|lalang|gawa}}
# [[cake]] out of [[bread]]; [[tart]]
#: {{syn|tl|keyk}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''kapal''' na tinapay|'''cake''' of bread}}
# [[lump]] made of [[wax]]
#: {{uxi|tl|'''kapal''' na pagkit|'''lump''' of wax}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|ikapal|kumapal|Maykapal|kapalin|ipakapal}}

