Page 8428 kaplastikan: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}} (2); remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification (2)
Page 8428 kaplastikan: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{af|tl|plastik|ka- -an}}. Attested from the 1990s.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|ka.plástikan}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|kaplástikán|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|idiom|informal|of a person}} [[insincerity]]; [[fakeness]]
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1991|author=Michael A. Hamlin|title=Remembering Gasty: A Man of Peace, a Man for Others
|passage=Marahil, hindi rin niya matatagalan ang bolahan, '''kaplastikan''', kakitiran ng utak at pagkamanhid ng maruming nasa loob nito. Malinaw ang kanyang pananaw  hinggil sa kahulugan ng kaunluran: pagpapalakas sa masa, paglaya, at  pagsulong&nbsp;...
|translation=Possibly, he cannot endure the flattery, insincerity, narrow-mindedness and insensitivity inside him. His view on the meaning of prosperity is clear: empowering the masses, freedom, and advancing...}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1999|title=Bayan Iii - Makatao at Maunlad Na Lipunan (batayang Aklat)1st Ed. 1999|page=250|publisher=Rex Bookstore, Inc.|isbn=9789712325359
|passage=Kadalasan, ibinubunyag ng mga krisis ang kahinaan ng mga sistemang ibinubunsod ng ilan tulad ng '''kaplastikan''', kaliluhan sa kapangyarihan at  pagkagahaman sa kapangyarihan.
|t=Crises frequently reveal the weaknesses of systems led by a few like insincerity, betrayal of public trust and greed for power.}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{prefix|tl|ka|plastikan}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|ka.plastikan}}

