===Etymology===
{{glossary|Learned borrowing}}{{cln|tl|learned borrowings from Cebuano|terms borrowed from Cebuano}} from {{af|tl|ceb:tarong|t1=just; proper|ka- -an|pos2=abstract noun-forming circumfix}}. {{coinage|tl|2=Eusebio T. Daluz|w=-|in=the early 20th century}},<ref>{{cite-web|last=Morrow|first=Paul|title=The Filipino language that might have been (Third of a three-part series)|url=https://www.canadianfilipino.net/culture/the-filipino-language-that-might-have-been-third-of-a-three-part-series|work=Canadian Filipino Net|year=2017}}</ref> one of the founders of the ''Akademya ng Wikang Pilipino'' (Academy of the Filipino Language), one of the predecessors of the {{w|Commission on the Filipino Language|''Komisyon sa Wikang Filipino'' (KWF)}} (Commission on the Filipino Language). Compare {{cog|pag|katonongan}} and {{cog|bcl|katadongan}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[justice]]
#: {{syn|tl|hustisya}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1914|author=Pedro Gatmaitan|title=Tungkos ng̃ alaala: katipunan ng̃a mg̃a tulã
|passage=Siyang̃â! At dì man ganáp na liwanag ó dì man tagumpáy ang aming mámalas sa '''katarung̃an''' mó't mg̃a pagsisikap sa pagsasarilí ng̃ bayan mong apí'y mayroón na ng̃ayón kahì't bábanaag ng̃ isáng pag-asa at dakilàng palad, anopá ng̃â't kamí'y tubós na sa hirap.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1933|author=Antonio G. Sempio|title=Ang punyal na ginto
|passage=May '''katarungan'''g lalong dakila na makasusumpong ng lalong tumpak na kaparusahan sa mga mapangapi——iyan ang '''katarungan''' ng Dios!}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kawalang-katarungan|di-makatarungan|makatarungan}}

