===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*gatəl}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*gaCəl}}. Cognate with {{cog|ilo|gatel}}, {{cog|pam|gatal}}, {{cog|bcl|gatol}}, {{cog|war|katol}}, {{cog|mrw|gatel}}, {{cog|mg|hatina}}, {{cog|ms|gatal}}, and {{cog|mqy|katel}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|katí}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|katí|b=+}}

# [[itch]]; [[itchiness]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagkati|pangangati}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[urge]]; [[lust]]
#: {{syn|tl|tukso|hibo|simbuyo}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[restlessness]]; [[uneasiness]]
#: {{syn|tl|balisa|pagkabalisa}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|kumati|mangati|pangatihan|makapangati|magpakati|makati|pangathan|pangangati|kating-putakti|makati ang palad|makati ang paa|makati ang dila|makati ang kamay|kati ng talampakan|kati ng paa|kati ng kamay|kati ng ulo}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*ka-qati}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*qaCi}}. Cognate with {{cog|ilo|ati||dry, evaporated}}, {{cog|pag|kati}}, {{cog|bcl|ati}}, and {{cog|wlo|kaati||shallowness, low tide}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[low tide]]; [[ebb tide]]; [[ebb]]
#: {{ant|tl|taog|taeb|suwag}}
# [[land]] not reached by sea  or [[river]]s
# [[land]] as opposed to [[sea]]
#: {{syn|tl|katihan}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|katihan|kumati|pangkatihan|hukbong-kati|hukbong-katihan|lintang-kati|pating sa kati}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# [[recede]]d {{q|of tides}}

===Etymology 3===
{{bor+|tl|ms|kati}}. Cognate with {{cog|ilo|kati}} and {{cog|bcl|kati}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# unit of weight equivalent to 623.70 [[gram]]s or 20 [[ounce]]s

{{numberbox|tl}}

===Etymology 4===
From {{der|tl|sa|कोटि||ten million}}, presumably through {{bor|tl|ms|keti||hundred thousand}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Number====
{{tl-head|number|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|archaic}}

# {{lb|tl|mathematics}} [[ten million]]

===Etymology 5===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|katî}}

