From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*kátiq}}. Cognate with {{cog|ibl|kati||rooster trained to lure wild roosters}}, {{cog|hnn|kati||decoy wild cock}}, {{cog|akl|kati||to decoy, entice}}, and {{cog|mrw|kati'||bantam}}.

