Page 8798 kawani: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|ka|wa|ni}}
Page 8798 kawani: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr|kawaní|+<qq:nonstandard>}}
