Page 8898 kesyo: Removing rhyme esjo, same as pronunciation-based rhyme for respelling '' and syllable count 2 matches: {{rhyme|tl|esjo|s=2}}
Page 8898 kesyo: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|kes|yo}}
Page 8898 kesyo: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 8898 kesyo: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{rhyme}} same as auto-generated rhyme and syllable count; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 8898 kesyo: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|kesiyo}}

===Etymology===
{{unc|tl}}. Possibilities include:
* From {{der|tl|es|-}}, possibly a {{univerbation|tl|qué sé yo|lang1=es|nocap=1}}, {{m|es|qué es eso}},<ref name="PD"/> or {{der|tl|es|[[que]] [[sea]]}}. Compare {{noncog|es|eso que}} and {{noncog|pt|que seja}}.
* From {{der|tl|zh|-}},<ref name="PD"/><ref name="KWFD"/><ref name="Panganiban"/> one proposal being {{zh-l|家|tr=ke|t=house}} + {{zh-l|事|tr=sū|t=matters}}, according to Manuel (1948).<ref name="Manuel"/> See also {{ncog|nan-hbl|假痟|tr=ké-siáu|t=to feign madness}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Adverb===
{{tl-head|adverb|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|colloquial}} 

# {{n-g|used to enumerate one or some of the flimsy and/or exasperating excuses someone else gave for doing something}}: [[saying]] that; saying [[because]]; [[one]] of the [[reason]]s [[said]] being; [[reasoning]] that {{gl|placed before the excuse}}
#: {{usex|tl|Ayaw niya lumabas, '''kesyo''' mainit daw.|He/She won't be coming out '''saying''' it's hot.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1988|title=Philippine Currents
|passage=Ngayon, dumarami ang kaso ng pagpapaalis sa mga magsasaka sa maraming mga kadahilanan -- '''kesyo''' hindi sila kinikilalang ... Hangga't maaari hanapin natin ang tamang landas walang mainit na tensiyon o komprontasyon;
|translation=Now, farmers are increasingly being evicted for a myriad of reasons -- like they do not recognize ...[i.e. their rights, etc.] Where possible, let's find the right way without heated tensions or confrontations.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=2002|title=Ang aklat likhaan ng tula at maikling kuwento, 1999
|passage='''Kesyo''' alagaan ko na lang daw si Kikay. Grumadweyt na raw ako para makapagtrabaho na at maging one cute ... Hindi ko narinig ang sagot mo, pero mainit na mainit ang hininga mo sa mga labi ko.
|translation=They said, just take care of Kikay. They said that I should graduate already, so that I can work already and become one cute ... I didn't hear your answer, but what you just breathed is so hot on my lips.}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|kesehoda}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|colloquial}}

# [[fuss]]; [[flimsy]] or [[exasperating]] [[excuse]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kesyo-kesyo|makesyo|kakesyuhan}}

===References===
<references>
<ref name="KWFD">{{R:KWF Diksiyonaryo}}</ref>
<ref name="PD">{{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}</ref>
<ref name="Manuel">{{R:tl:Manuel 1948|q=kesyo|page=30}}</ref>
<ref name="Panganiban">{{R:Diksyunaryo tesauro Pilipino-Ingles 1973|page=282}}</ref>
</references>
-------- end text --------
