Page 8980 kina: Removing rhyme a, same as pronunciation-based rhyme for respelling 'kiná': {{rhymes|tl|a}}
Page 8980 kina: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|ki|na}}
