===Phrase===
{{tl-head|phrase|Kiong Hee Huat Tsai|b=Kiyong Hi Huwat Tsay}}

# [[happy|Happy]] [[Chinese New Year]]
#: {{syn|tl|Kung Hey Fat Tsoy}}

====Usage notes====
* Some {{w|Chinese Filipino}}s recommend the usage of {{m-self|tl|Kiong Hee Huat Tsai}} more than {{m-self|tl|Kung Hey Fat Tsoy}}, despite historical 20th century prevalence of the latter, as majority of {{w|Chinese Filipino}}s in the Philippines speak or have {{w|Philippine Hokkien|Hokkien}} as their {{w|heritage language}}, rather than [[Cantonese]].

