Page 9143 kompetisyon: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|kumpetisyon}}

===Etymology===
Most likely a {{pseudo-loan|tl|es|en:competition|nocap=1}}, and influenced by {{der|tl|es|competición}}. A direct borrowing from {{cog|es|competición}} is unlikely because the earliest attested quote is from 1971, the word does not appear in dictionaries prior to that, and the word for "competition" in Spanish before World War II is {{m|es|competencia}} (see {{noncog|tl|kompetensiya}}), while {{cog|es|competición}} was a rarer word.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kompetisyón}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kompetisyón|b=+}}

# [[competition]] {{gl|contest}}
#: {{syn|tl|patimpalak|paligsahan|labanan|kompetensiya|kontest|timpalak}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1971|author=Amado Guerrero|title=Lipunan at rebolusyong Pilipino
|passage=-hunan upang magpalawak ng negosyo, proteksiyon mula sa '''kompetisyon''' ng pamahalaan, pagtatangi sa pagkakaloob ng pautang ng pamahalaan, paggamit ng pondo ng GSIS at SSS, at mga espesyal na pangganyak sa pagluluwas.}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
