Page 9327 kring-kring: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|kring-kring}}
Page 9327 kring-kring: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 9327 kring-kring: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 9327 kring-kring: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{onomatopoeic|tl}}. Compare {{m|tl|krung krung}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|onomatopoeia}} {{n-g|imitating the sound of a ringing telephone, alarm, or bell}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2002|author=Joi Barrios; Roland B. Tolentino|title=Ang aklat likhaan ng tula at maikling kuwento, 2000|isbn=9789715423496
|passage='''Kring-Kring''' Lilia F. Antonio ang pagtawag sa telepono sa taong marapat ibaon  sa limot ay tulad sa pagkutkot ng sugat. habang tinutuklap ang tumitigas na  langib kay-kati, kay sarap. subalit kapag nalantad ang mamula-mulang laman  muling&nbsp;...}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2003|author=Joaquin Sy|title=五月花節 : 柯清淡小說精選: tatlong piling kwento|isbn=9789718857304
|passage="'''Kring'''! '''Kring'''! '''Kring'''!" Tumunog ang telepono at pinutol ang malalim kong  pagmumuni-muni. Pagkatapos sagutin ang telepono, sinabi ng anak kong lalaki,  "Yung tauhan kong Chua ang apelyido, dalawampung minuto nang naghihintay  diyan&nbsp;...}}

====Usage notes====
* ''Kring-kring'' may be written as just ''kring'' or duplicated several times such as ''kring kring kring''.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|tl|kring}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|slang|dated|humorous|mildly|offensive}} [[crazy]]; [[mentally]] [[disturbed]]
#: {{syn|tl|baliw|loko-loko|tililing}}

====Usage notes====
* As persons with mental disorders are socially stigmatized in the Philippines, this is sometimes considered mildly offensive if not taken humorously and if a mental disorder has not been diagnosed with certainty.

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo|kring}}
* {{R:Tagalog Slang Dictionary|77}}
-------- end text --------
