From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*kulit||skin; hide; rind; bark}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*kuliC||rind, peeling of fruits or tubers}}. Compare {{cog|mrw|kolit}} and {{cog|ms|kulit}}.

