====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|plant}}

# [[Indian mulberry]]; [[noni]] {{gl|{{taxfmt|Morinda citrifolia|species}}, tree whose [[bark]] yields a [[dye]]}}
