Page 9472 kumapit sa patalim: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 9472 kumapit sa patalim: -------- begin text --------
{{was fwotd|tl|2017|December|30}}

===Etymology===
{{lit|to clutch onto a blade}}, from the proverb {{m|tl|ang taong nagigipit, sa patalim kumakapit}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kumapit sa patalím}}

===Verb===
{{tl-verb|[[kumapit]] [[sa]] [[patalím]]|kumapit sa patalim|kumakapit sa patalim|kakapit sa patalim|type=actor I|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|idiomatic}} to [[live]] in a [[dangerous]] or [[precarious]] situation; to live on the [[razor's edge]]
# {{lb|tl|idiomatic}} to [[resort]] to any [[activity]], especially [[crime]], to [[survive]] or [[earn a living]]
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1981|title=Ang Bagong Pamana
|passage=Napilitang '''kumapit sa patalim''' ng pagsasamantala ang mag-amang Itoy at Clemenia sa pag-babaka-sakaling maagaw sa kuko ng kamatayan ang asawa&#39;t  inang may sakit kahit ang kanilang sarili ang maging kabayaran.|t=The father Itoy, and daughter Clemenia, were forced '''to hold on a blade''' ('''to exploit''') in hopes of stealing his ill wife from the brink of death even if the payment was himself.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2004|author=Frank G. Rivera|title=Oyayi: sarswela ng pamilyang Pinoy|isbn=9789715062640
|passage=Biniro ko pa si Lino Brocka na kung meron siyang gagawing pelikulang ''Kapit sa Patalim'', mas nauna akong '''kumapit sa patalim''' sa pagtatrabaho sa UL. Sinabi niyang sana raw ay hindi ako masugatan sa aking gagawin.|t=I even made a joke to Lino Brocka that if he would make a film titled ''Kapit sa Patalim'' (“A Hold on a Blade”), I was first in '''holding on a blade''' (resorting to a strenous activity) by working at the [{{l|en|university of life|University of Life}}]. He said that he hopes I do not get wounded in what I would do.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2014|author=Taga Imus|title=Ang Mga Lihim ng Pulang Diary: Tagalog Gay Stories|publisher=Taga Imus M2M Books - TGIMS Publishing Services|isbn=9781497516304|page=69
|passage=Ilan ba sa mga iyon ang hindi natanggap at '''kumapit sa patalim''' para makakain? Lahat pinaiikot nga ng pera at kung wala ka nito ay kawawa ka.|t=How many of them were rejected and '''held onto a blade''' ('''ditched to last resort''') in order to eat? Everything really revolves about money, and if you don't have it, you'll be suffering.}}
# {{verb form of|tl|kumapit sa patalim||compl|asp}}

====Conjugation====
{{tl-infl-um|k|a|pit sa patalim}}
-------- end text --------
