Page 9588 kupal: Skipped, no changes
Page 9588 kupal: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|copal||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|dupal}}

===Etymology===
The word has been existing and even used as an insult since the 17th century. The colloquial etymology that the word is  {{glossary|backslang}} of ''pa-cool'', from {{pre|tl|pa|cool|lang2=en|lit=trying to be cool|nocat=1}} may be false.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|vulgar}}

# {{lb|tl|biology}} [[smegma]]; [[prepuce]]
# {{lb|tl|colloquial|derogatory}} [[asshole]] {{gl|mean or rude person}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kupal''' ka; ang sama ng ginagawa mong paninira sa kapatid mo.|You '''ass'''; that's cruel of you to slander your brother.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kumupal|kupalin|magpakupal|pagkakupal|napakakupal|mangupal|kuping|kupalan}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|ano ba 'yan|Diyos ko po|putang ina}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|tamod}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|vulgar}}

# [[smegma]]-[[like]]
# {{lb|tl|colloquial|derogatory}} [[asshole]]; [[bitch]]; [[prick]]

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|vulgar}}

# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[crap]]!
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kupal''' naman o, hanggang baywang na ang tubig-baha!|Oh '''crap''', the floodwaters are waist-high!}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613}}
** page 30: “Afrenta) Copal (pp) diciondo eſta palabra por afrenta”
** page 562: “Suçiedad) Copal (pp) del miembro viril, copal mo (diçe vno a otro por afrenta) la ſuçiedad de tu miembro”
