===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*kutu}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*kutu}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*kuCux}}. Compare {{cog|ms|kutu}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[louse]] {{gl|insect}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|hinguto|kutuhan|kutuhin|kutong-aso|kutong-lupa|kutong-tubig|manghinguto|pahinguto|hingutuhan|hingutuhin|paghihinguto|hingutan|maghingutuhan|magpahinguto|pahingutuhan}}

=====See also=====
{{col3|tl|muoy|kuyumad|kato}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|kutô}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|kutô|b=+}}

# [[sound]] of [[bursting]] [[bubble]]s {{q|as created by the [[stomach]] or [[rice]] being [[cook]]ed}}
# [[swarm]]; [[crowd]]; [[throng]]; [[swarming]]; [[crowding]]
#: {{syn|tl|kutitap}}
# [[sound]] produced by the [[swarm]]ing of [[many]] [[tiny]] [[insect]]s together
#: {{syn|tl|kulo}}
# [[teeming]] or [[swarm]]ing [[movement]]s {{q|of small ants, worms, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|kutitap|kulisaw|kuyaw}}

===References===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
