Page 9751 kuwintas: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|couentas|couintas|cuentas|cuintas||obsolete|Abecedario}}
* {{alt|tl|kuintas||obsolete}}
* {{alt|tl|kwintas||nonstandard}}

===Etymology===
Either of the following:
* From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*kulintas||necklace}} with elision of {{IPAchar|/l/}}. Compare {{cog|pag|kulintas}} / {{m|pag|kolindas}}, {{cog|xsb|kolintah}}, {{cog|abp|kolinta}}, {{cog|bno|kulintas}}, {{cog|agn|kolintat}}, {{cog|bcl|kulintas}}, {{cog|akl|kulentas}}, and {{cog|ceb|kulintas}}, and {{cog|hil|kolintas}}. Possibly coincidental and conflated with {{der|tl|es|cuentas}}.
* Early {{glossary|borrowing}} from {{bor|tl|es|cuentas||beads}}, plural of {{m|es|cuenta||bead (small spherical object)}}. However, expected word would be ''*kuntas'' if borrowed early but possibly an exception. Compare {{cog|ilo|kuentas}}, {{cog|bcl|kuwentas}}, {{cog|ceb|kuwintas}}, and {{cog|war|kwentas}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kuwintás}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kuwintás|b=+}}

# [[necklace]]
#: {{syn|tl|gargantilya|pamigti|binaysok|balagat|binigsa}}
# [[rosary]]
#: {{syn|tl|rosaryo|kuwintas-dasalan|dasalang-kuwintas}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kuwintasan|kuwintasin|kuwintas-dasalan|dasalang-kuwintas|magkuwintas|magkukuwintas|manguwintas|ipanguwintas}}

