===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|labin-||for [[compound]]s with next [[stem]] starting with the letter ''{{angbr|d}}'', ''{{angbr|l}}'', ''{{angbr|s}}'', or ''{{angbr|t}}''.}}
* {{alt|tl|labim-||for [[compound]]s with next [[stem]] starting with the letter ''{{angbr|b}}'' or ''{{angbr|p}}''.}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|tl|labi|-ng-|t1=excess|pos2=[[compound word|compound]] [[enclitic]] [[interfix]]}}. {{m|tl|labing-isa}} would literally mean 1 excess from 10, with 10 implied.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|labíng-}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|labíng-|b=+}}

# {{n-g|[[cardinal|Cardinal]] [[prefix]], denoting [[excess]] [[over]] the [[count]] of [[ten]], if the next [[stem]] in the [[compound]] starts with a [[vowel]] or ''{{angbr|w}}''.}}
#: {{affixusex|tl|labing-|isa|t2=[[one]]|[[labing-isa|'''labing-'''isa]]|t3=[[eleven]]}}
#: {{affixusex|tl|labing-|apat|t2=[[four]]|[[labing-apat|'''labing-'''apat]]|t3=[[fourteen]]}}
#: {{affixusex|tl|labing-|anim|t2=[[six]]|[[labing-anim|'''labing-'''anim]]|t3=[[sixteen]]}}
#: {{affixusex|tl|labing-|walo|t2=[[eight]]|[[labingwalo|'''labing'''walo]]|t3=[[eighteen]]}}

====Derived terms====
* {{prefixsee|tl}}
