# [[pluck|plucking]] out; [[uprooting]]; [[sharp]] [[pull]] and [[twist]] {{q|of hair, weeds, roots, feathers, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|bunot|ganot|sabunot|q3=of hair|piral|q4=of ears|pingol|q5=of ears or nose}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|labnutin|lumabnot|pagkalabnot|paglabnot|labnutan}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|hablot}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|labnót|b=+}}

