{{inh+|tl|phi-pro|*rəgrə́g}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|regreg||fall}}, {{cog|bcl|ragrag||crumbs}}, and {{cog|ceb|dagdag||fall}}. Possibly related to {{noncog|nan-hbl|落|tr=lak||to fall; to drop}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|laglág}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|laglág|b=+}}

