#: {{syn|tl|bagsak|hulog|lagpak|paglagpak|pagkahulog}}
# [[dropping]] from a [[height]]
#: {{syn|tl|paglalagpak|paghuhulog}}
# [[failure]] {{q|in an examination}}
#: {{syn|tl|bagsak|pagbagsak|lagpak|pagkahulog|di-pagpasa}}
# {{lb|tl|euphemistic}} [[abortion]]; [[forced]] [[miscarriage]]
# {{lb|tl|figurative|colloquial}} [[betrayal]]

