{{der3|tl|laglagan|laglagang-luksa|laglag-luksa|lumaglag|malaglag|magpalaglag|malaglagan|pagkalaglag|pagpapalaglag|pampalaglag|ipalaglag|laglag-panti|makalaglag-panti|ilaglag}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|laglág|b=+}}

# [[fallen]] {{q|as of fruits from a tree}}
#: {{syn|tl|bagsak|bumagsak|lagpak}}
# [[failed]] {{q|in an examination}}
#: {{syn|tl|bagsak|hulog|lagpak|bumagsak|di-pasado|di-pumasa}}
# {{lb|tl|euphemistic}} [[aborted]]; [[deliberately]] [[miscarried]]

