Page 9961 laki: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*dakəl}}, with elision of {{IPAchar|/l/}} then a sound shift of {{IPAchar|/d/}} to {{IPAchar|/l/}}. Compare {{cog|tao|rako}}, {{cog|ilo|dakkel}}, {{cog|pag|dakel}}, {{cog|kne|dakdakë}}, {{cog|duo|dakal}}, {{cog|ibl|shakel}}, {{cog|isd|dakkal}}, {{cog|pam|dakal}}, {{cog|pam|dagul}}, {{cog|bcl|dakol}}, {{cog|ceb|dako}}, {{cog|hil|daku}}, {{cog|msm|dakey}}, and {{cog|mrw|dakel}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|lakí|laké<qq:colloquial>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|lakí|b=+}}

# [[bigness]]; [[largeness]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalakihan|pagkamalaki}}
# [[size]]; [[measurement]] {{q|especially in bigness}}
#: {{syn|tl|sukat}}
# [[growth]] {{q|of plants, animals, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|pagtubo|q=of plants}}
# [[bulk]]
#: {{syn|tl|bulto}}
# [[high tide]]
#: {{syn|tl|taog|pagtaog|taeb}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[greatness]]
#: {{syn|tl|kadakilaan|kabantugan}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kalakihan|ilaki|ilaki ng loob|ipagmalaki|lakihan|laki sa layaw|lumaki|lumaki ang ulo|magkasinlaki|magmalaki|magpalaki|palakihin|malakihan|malakhin|malaki|malaki-laki|malaking-malaki|mapagkalakhan|mapagmalaki|may-kalakihan|napakalaki|pagkalakhan|paglaki|pagmalakhan|magmalaki|pagmamalaki|pagpapalaki|palaki|pampalaki|sinlaki|kasinlaki|hinlalaki|Kalakhang Maynila}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|dakila|lalaki}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|lakí|b=+}}

# [[brought up]]; [[grew up]] {{q|in a certain situation}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|dakél}}

-------- end text --------
