Page 10177 lapulapu: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|lapulapo}}

===Etymology===
Named after {{w|Lapu-Lapu}}, the 16th century datu of Mactan. 
And also from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*kuʀapu|t=the sea perch, giant rock cod, giant grouper, Epinephelus spp.}}. 
Compare {{cog|ms|kerapu}}, {{cog|id|kerapu}},
{{cog|tsg|kulapu}}, 
{{cog|slm|kulapu}}
{{cog|ceb|pugapo}},
{{cog|bcl|pugapo}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|lápulápu}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|lápulápu|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|fish}} [[grouper]] {{gl|fish of the family {{w|Epinephelinae}}}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|lapulapung-liglig|lapulapung-senyora|lapulapung-lupot|lapulapung-senyorita}}

