* {{cite-book|author=José Rizal|translator=Frank Ernest Gannett|title=Friars and Filipinos: An Abridged Translation of Dr. José Rizal's Tagalog Novel, "Noli Me Tangere"|publisher=St. James Press|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=FEdFAAAAIAAJ&pg=PA84&lpg=PA84&dq=noli+me+tangere+liampo&source=bl&ots=ORs0iqkmAh&sig=ACfU3U2MBqpqoHId67TSxsuw6jm0ra2DUQ&hl=en&sa=X&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=Liam-po&f=false|year=1900|page=84}}
