===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|luñgsod|lung̃sod|lonzor||obsolete|Abecedario}}
* {{alt|tl|lungsor||dialectal|Rizal|informal}}
* {{alt|tl|lunsod}}

===Etymology===
{{lbor+|tl|ceb|lungsod||town}}.<ref>{{R:Diksyunaryo tesauro Pilipino-Ingles 1973}}</ref> Said to be introduced by {{coinage|tl|Eusebio T. Daluz|w=-|in=1915|notext=1}},<ref>{{R:Filipino-English vocabulary}}</ref><ref>{{cite-web|last=Morrow|first=Paul|title=The Filipino language that might have been (Third of a three-part series)|url=https://www.canadianfilipino.net/culture/the-filipino-language-that-might-have-been-third-of-a-three-part-series|work=Canadian Filipino Net|year=2017}}</ref> one of the founders of the ''Akademya ng Wikang Pilipino'' (Academy of the Filipino Language), one of the predecessors of the {{w|Commission on the Filipino Language|''Komisyon sa Wikang Filipino'' (KWF)}} (Commission on the Filipino Language).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|lungsód}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|lungsód|b=+}}

# [[city]]
#: {{syn|tl|siyudad}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Lungsod''' ng Maynila|'''City''' of Manila}}

====Usage notes====
* This word is part of [[Appendix:Cebuano–Tagalog relations#False friends and false cognates|Tagalog–Cebuano false friends]]. The Cebuano definitions can be seen at [[lungsod#Cebuano]].

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kalungsuran|panlungsod|punong-lungsod|tagalungsod|palungsod|Lungsod Quezon}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|bor=1|bcl|lungsod}}

===References===
<references/>

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:tl:Pinoy Dictionary}}

{{C|tl|Cities|sort=tl:Cities}}
