Page 10935 lungti: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|lunti}}

===Etymology===
Exact etymology is unknown. Possibilies are:
* {{back-form|tl|lungtian}}, possibly a {{glossary|clipping}} of {{m|tl|halungtiyang||green}}.
* From {{noncog|zh|-}}, possibly from {{noncog|nan-hbl|[[濃]][[青]]|tr=lông-chhiⁿ||deep green}}.
* Related to {{noncog|phi-pro|*luh(ə)naw}}. Compare {{noncog|ceb|lunhaw}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|lungtî}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|lungtî|b=+}}

# [[green]] {{q|color/colour}}
#: {{syn|tl|berde|lungtian|halungtiyang}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|lungtî|b=+}}

# [[green]] {{q|color/colour}}
#: {{syn|tl|berde|lungtian|halungtiyang}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kalungtian|lungtian|lungtiin|luntidinsol|luntikatwan|luntikakaphay|laging-lungti}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:tl:Manuel 1948|page=104|q=Lungtián}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860}}

{{C|tl|Greens}}
