Page 10939 lupa: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|lupà}}
Page 10939 lupa: Skipped, no changes
Page 10939 lupa: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From Greater Central Philippine ''*lupaʔ'' (“earth”). Compare {{cog|mrw|lopa'}}, {{cog|mdh|lopa}}, and {{cog|tsg|lupa}}. Possibly related to {{cog|sa|रुप्|tr=rúp||earth}}. An alternate etymology posits it to be from {{cog|ms|rupa||form, appearance}}, from {{cog|sa|रूप||outward appearance, color, form, shape}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|rupa}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|lupà}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|lupà|b=+}}

# [[earth]]; [[ground]]; [[soil]]
#: {{syn|tl|tiyera|q1=uncommon}}
# {{lb|tl|by extension|uncommon}} [[clay]]
#: {{syn|tl|luad}}
#: {{uxi|tl|bangang '''lupa'''|'''clay''' jar}}
# [[earth]]; [[world]]
#: {{syn|tl|mundo|daigdig}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[country]]; [[nation]]
#: {{syn|tl|bayan|bansa}}
#: {{uxi|tl|tinubuang '''lupa'''|motherland / '''country''' of birth|lit='''land''' where sprouted}}
# [[land]] [[property]]
# [[basement]]; [[ground floor]]; [[downstairs]]
#: {{syn|tl|silong}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} act of [[own]]ing a [[land]] [[property]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[embankment]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kalupaan|katawang-lupa|guho ng lupa|hilig-makalupa|laang lupa|lamang-lupa|lupaan|lupain|lupaing-bayan|lupang-tinubuan|makalupa|maylupa|panlupa|sangkalupaan|hampaslupa|lupang payapa|langit-lupa|langit at lupa|Lupa|pinagsakluban ng langit at lupa|panginoong maylupa|Lupang Hinirang|sumalupa|isalupa|maglupa}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|lupalop}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613}}
** page 2: {{m-g|Abajo) Lupa (pp) en la tierra}}
** page 105: {{m-g|Barro) Lupa (pp) la brado en cantaros o ollas, o el yama ſado ꝑa la brallas}}
** page 492: {{m-g|Poſeſion) Lupa (pp) tierra o ſembrado}}
** page 573: {{m-g|Terraplenar) Lupa (pp) algo}}
** page 574: {{m-g|Tierra) Lupa (pp) la que piſamos}}

===Anagrams===
* {{anagrams|tl|pula}}

