===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|M}}. Each pronunciation has a different source:
* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der|tl|en|M}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m|tl|{{tl-bay sc|ma}}}}.
* Abecedario pronunciation is from {{der|tl|es|M}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr
|ém<qq:letter name, Filipino alphabet>
|má<qq:letter name, Abakada alphabet>
|eme<qq:letter name, Abecedario>
|+<qq:phoneme>
}}

