* {{list:Latin script letters/tl}}

===Letter===
{{tl-letter|b=ma}}

# {{tl-letter-def|10|ma|alph=abak}}

===Letter===
{{tl-letter|b=eme}}

# {{lb|tl|historical}} {{tl-letter-def|15|eme|alph=abec}}

