Page 11056 maano: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|ma|a|no}}
Page 11056 maano: Replaced {{tl-IPA|ma7anó}} with {{tl-pr|ma7anó}}
Page 11056 maano: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 11056 maano: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|tl|ma|ano|t2=what; something}}. For sense “how's it going?”, compare {{cog|hil|maano||what will you do?}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|ma7anó}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|maanó|b=+}}

# [[have|having]] much of an [[indefinite]] [[quality]] or [[quantity]] {{gl|which would be understood in context between speakers}}
#: {{syn|tl|makuwan}}
#: {{ux|tl|Maano ang ahas na iyan. Huwag kang lumapit.|That snake is '''full of something'''. Don't come close to it.}}

===Verb===
{{tl-verb|maanó|naano|naaano|maaano|b=+}}

# to have something happen to someone or something else
#: {{ux|tl|Hindi ka niya '''maano''' ngayon.|He can't '''do the thing/something''' today.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Paano kung '''maano''' ka diyan.|What if '''something happens''' to you there.}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|mapaano}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|maanó|b=+}}

# {{n-g|expression of a wish}}: [[may]]; [[would]] {{gl|usually with ligature {{m|tl|-ng}}}}
#: {{syn|tl|nawa|harinawa|harinaga}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Maanong''' manalo tayo bukas.|'''May''' we win tomorrow.}}
# [[please]]
#: {{syn|tl|pakiusap}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Maanong''' tumulong ka.|'''Please''' help.}}
# [[so what]]; [[even if]] {{gl|usually with ligature {{m|tl|kung}}}}
#: {{syn|tl|[[ano]] [[naman]]|[[ano]] [[ngayon]]}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Maano''' kung mayaman man siya?|'''So what''' if he's rich?}}
# {{lb|tl|dialectal|Southern Tagalog}} [[how's it going]]? [[how are you]]?
#: {{syn|tl|kumusta}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Maano''' ang ama mo?|'''How''''s your father?}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Maano''' ka?|'''How are you'''?}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|tl|mano||how's it going?}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|174|Comoeſta)  Maano (pc)}}
-------- end text --------
