===Etymology===
From {{m|tl|mabini}}. The places in the Philippines are named after {{w|Apolinario Mabini}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|b=+}}

# {{surname|tl|from=Tagalog}}
# {{w|Apolinario Mabini}} {{gl|Filipino revolutionary}}
# {{place|tl|several <<locations>> in the <<c/Philippines>>}}:
## {{place|tl|municipality|p/Batangas|c/Philippines}}
