Page 11792 mahal: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|mahál<audio:tl-ph-mahal.ogg>}}
Page 11792 mahal: Skipped, no changes
Page 11792 mahal: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{der|tl|sa|महार्घ}} via {{bor|tl|ms|mahal}}. Compare {{cog|pam|mal}}, {{cog|bcl|mahal}}, {{cog|ceb|mahal}}, and {{cog|bno|mahay}}, {{cog|jv|ꦩꦲꦭ꧀|tr=-}} ({{m|jv|mahal}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|mahál<audio:tl-ph-mahal.ogg>}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|mahál|b=+}}

# [[dear]]; [[precious]]; [[cherished]]
#: {{syn|tl|mahalaga}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Mahal''' kong Maynila, sayo'y hindi mawawalay.|My '''dear''' Manila, I won't part ways from you.}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Mahal''' na [mga] Araw|Holy Week|lit='''Valued''' Days}}
# [[expensive]]; [[high-priced]]
#: {{syn|tl|magastos|maharlika|Mahalia Jackson|q2=gay slang|q3=gay slang}}
#: {{ant|tl|mura}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''mahal''' na pang-matrikula|'''expensive''' tuition fee}}
# {{lb|tl|archaic}} [[noble]]; [[exalted]]
#: {{syn|tl|dakila|kagalang-galang|maginoo|maharlika|noblesa|marangal|pinagmamalaki}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[grave]]; [[serious]]
#: {{syn|tl|grabe}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|mahál|b=+}}

# [[beloved]]
#: {{syn|tl|ibig|irog}}
#: {{ux|tl|O aking '''mahal''', sadyang pinagtagpo tayo ng tadhana!|O my '''beloved''', we have been led to meet by fate!
}}
# [[expensive]] [[item]]s

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|mahal kita|magmahal|minahal|kamahalan|mamahal|mapagmahal|mapamahal|matimyas na pagmamahal|mapagkandiling pagmamahal|pakamahalin|pagmamahal|pagmamahalan|napakamahal|kamahal-mahalan|mahal na tao|mahal na ugali|kamahanlan|Mahal na Ina|mamahalin}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|halaga|mahalaga|maharlika}}

