#* {{quote-web|1=tl|date=20 May 2019|author=Cherrylin Caacbay|site=RMN Networks|title=Init sa NAIA, umabot ng 45.1 degrees Celsius|url=https://rmn.ph/init-sa-naia-umabot-ng-45-1-degrees-celsius/|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200414203845/https://rmn.ph/init-sa-naia-umabot-ng-45-1-degrees-celsius/|archivedate=14 Apr 2020|text=Patuloy na makakaranas ang Metro Manila ng mainit at '''mahalumigmig''' na panahon ngayong Lunes ngunit posible ring magkaroon ng pagkulog at pagkidlat sa bandang hapon.|t=Metro Manila will continue experiencing a hot and '''humid''' weather this Monday but it is also possible that there will be thunders and lightnings in the afternoon.}}
