Page 11896 makakalimutin: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{af|tl|kalimot|ma- -in}} with partial {{rdp|tl|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|makakalimutín}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|makakalimutín|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|informal}} [[forgetful]]
#: {{syn|tl|malilimutin}}
#* {{quote-journal|tl|year=1972|journal=Liwayway
|passage=Kaya&#39;t ipinagbigay-alam sa pulisya at NBI na siya&#39;y nawawala. Pinaghanap siya ng mga ito. Talagang lahat ng henyo&#39;y totoong '''makakalimutin'''. Kaya naniniwala akong akmang ikapit sa kanya ang taguring ito.
|translation=So the police and the NBI are notified that he is missing. They asked him to search. It's true all geniuses are really '''forgetful'''. So I believe it's right to stick this nickname to him.}}
#* '''2015''', Kirsten Nimwey, ''The Explorers Series Box Set (Tagalog Edition)'', Kirsten Nimwey ({{ISBN|9781311146847}})
#*: {{quote|tl|“Heh, '''makakalimutin''' ka pala eh. Ako si Augustus Sawyer ng Pioneer! Nalimutan mo na ba? O hindi mo lang ako namukhaan?"
|translation="Heh, you're really '''forgetful'''. I'm Augustus Sawyer of Pioneer! Don't you forget? Or you just haven't recognized me?"}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|ulianin}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
