Page 12057 malandi: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 12057 malandi: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{pre|tl|ma|landi}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|malandî}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|malandî|b=+}}

# [[flirtatious]]
#: {{syn|tl|landi|maharot}}
# {{lb|tl|mildly|_|vulgar}} [[lewd]]; [[promiscuous]]
#: {{syn|tl|bastos|walang hiya}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2016|author=Vins Santiago|title=TransFormed: Mula sa Pagiging Transwoman|publisher=OMF Literature|isbn=9789710095506
|passage=“Eh, selfish ka naman pala, talagang '''malandi''' ka, ano?” “Pagod na akong  magkunwari na mahal siya, Joan. Sana maunawaan mo ako kung nagawa ko  man ito.” Pinuno ni Vinna ng damit ang maleta.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2015|author=Mikki Eugenio|title=Elesi|publisher=Senpai Books|page=147
|passage="Eh, '''malandi''' ka kasi!" "Wala kang karapatang sabihin iyan sa akin!" Sabunutan  at balyahan ang naganap: isa laban sa lahat ng kamag-anak. Lahat dahil sa  sama ng loob na itinanim nila sa isa&#39;t isa sa napakatagal na panahon. "Tama na!}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1992|title=Supreme Court Reports, Annotated
|passage=... no relations using sexually explicit words in the presence of his wife? And it is  equally difficult to believe that the wife would join in the name-calling and declare , "Putang babae ka. '''Malandi''' ka. Palibhasa hindi ka na nakakantot ng asawa ko.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1996|author=J. Neil C. Garcia|title=Philippine gay culture: the last thirty years : binabae to bakla, silahis to MSM|publisher=University of Philippines Press
|passage=Nagkataon lang na mahinhin ka . . . at ako&#39;y galawgaw . . . '''malandi''' ako sa labas,  pero '''malandi''' ka rin . . . sa loob lamang. [Julie: Fidel, you will not accomplish  anything by moping around like that. Fidel: Didn&#39;t I tell you we are not alike! Julie:  I&nbsp;...}}
# {{lb|tl|vulgar}} [[contemptible]]
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2003|author=Martin F. Manalansan IV|title=Global Divas: Filipino Gay Men in the Diaspora|publisher=Duke University Press|isbn=9780822385172|page=59
|passage=Once at a party, a fight broke out between two Filipino gay men, and one of them  said, &#39;&#39;Hoy, walang hiya ka, wala ka namang papeles, illegal ka, '''malandi''' ka!  Isumbong kita sa immigration makita mo!&#39;&#39; [Hey you shameless person, you don&#39;t &nbsp;...}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|malandî|b=+}}

# [[flirt]]
# {{lb|tl|mildy|_|vulgar}} [[promiscuous]] person; [[slut]]
# {{lb|tl|derogatory|vulgar}} [[asshole]]; [[scumbag]]
-------- end text --------
