===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|maluwag ang turnilyo||superseded|2014}}

===Etymology===
{{ellipsis|tl|[[maluwag]] [[ang]] [[tornilyo]] [[sa]] [[utak]]|t=insane|lit=having a loose screw in the brain}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|maluwág ang tornilyo}}

===Adjective===
