===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|mamain|mamin||uncommon}}

===Etymology===
From {{syncopic form|tl|mamain|nocap=1}}, from {{suffix|tl|mama|in}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|mam7in|mam7ín<qq:obsolete>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# combination of [[betel]] nut, chewing [[tobacco]], and a little [[lime]] wrapped in a betel leaf prepared for chewing
#: {{syn|tl|hitso|nganga}}
