Page 12215 mama: WARNING: Didn't see {{tl-IPA}} in Pronunciation section, skipping
Page 12215 mama: Skipped, no changes
Page 12215 mama: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*mama}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*mamah||father’s brother}}. Also possibly borrowed from {{bor|tl|sa|माम}} or from {{bor|tl|ta|மாமா}}. Compare {{cog|ms|mamak}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|mamà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|mamà|b=+}}

# {{n-g|a term used in referring to, or in addressing, a male unknown to the speaker}}
#: {{syn|tl|mang|manong}}
# {{lb|tl|archaic|familiar}} [[uncle]] (parent's younger brother)
# {{lb|tl|archaic|familiar|childish}} any [[relative]] of the father or mother

=====Derived terms=====
* {{ltl|mang}}

====See also====
* {{ltl|ale}}

===Etymology 2===
Each pronunciation has a different source:
* {{IPAchar|/maˈma/}} from {{bor|tl|es|mamá}}, adapted from {{der|tl|fr|maman}}
* {{IPAchar|/ma.ma/}} from {{bor|tl|nan-hbl|媽媽|tr=mâ-mâ}}
* {{IPAchar|/ˈmama/}} from {{bor|tl|en|mama}} / {{m|en|momma}}

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr
|mamá<qq:Spanish pronunciation>
|mámá<qq:Hokkien pronunciation>
|+<qq:English pronunciation>
}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|+|head2=mamá|b=+|m=papa}} {{tlb|tl|colloquial|familiar|childish}}

# [[mum]], [[mom]]
#: {{syn|tl|ma|ina|nanay|inay|nay|inang|nanang}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*mamaq}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*mamaq||chew without intending to swallow, as betel nut; premasticate food to give to an infant; premasticated food}}. Compare {{cog|jv|ꦩꦩꦃ}} and {{cog|ms|mamah}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|mamâ}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|mamâ|b=+}}

# [[betelnut]] [[chew]]ing

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|mam-in|magmam-in|maminan|mangmama|pamama|pamamain|palamama|palamam-an|palamam-inan}}

=====See also=====
{{rel3|tl|buyo|hitso|ikmo|itmo|nganga|sama}}

===Etymology 4===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|mamâ}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|mamâ|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# {{n-g|name of the Baybayin letter {{l|tl|ᜋ}}, corresponding to "ma"}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|ma}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613}}
** page 173: “Comer) Mama (pc) buyo”
** page 400: “M) Mama (pc) letra del .A.b.c. Tagalog .{{!}}. mama yaon .{{!}}. {{tl-bay sc|ma|disp=1}} . ſumulat ca nang mama nang iniõg ſulat, eſcriue la. M. de bueſtra eſcritura, yſulat mo aco nang mama, eſcriueme vna .M.”
** page 575: “Tio) Mama (pp) llamandole el ſobrino y como en Eſpañol vſamos llamar tio al hias viejo, tambien lo vſan eſtos y diçen, mama ay, ola tio, yaring ſi mama a, eſte mi tio.”

-------- end text --------
