Page 12363 mandurukot: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 12363 mandurukot: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|mandudukot}}
* {{alt|tl|manrurukot||dialectal|Rizal|informal}}

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|tl|man|dukot}} with initial {{rdp|tl|nocap=1}} of the root {{m|tl|dukot}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[pickpocket]]
#: {{syn|tl|magnanakaw|manduduwit|mang-uumit|dorobo|q4=slang}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1988|author=Reynaldo Arquero Duque; Jose Asia Bragado; Hermilinda T. Lingbaoan; GUMIL Metro Manila|title=Kurditan
|passage=Pinitserahan ni  Charlie ang '''mandurukot''' sabay ipit ng kanang bisig niya ang leeg nito. Hinablot niya agad ang pitaka saka ibinulsa.
|translation=Charlie took a picture of the '''pickpocket''' while he clasped his arm. He immediately grabbed the wallet and placed it on his pocket.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1996|author=Rosario de Guzman- Lingat|title=Kung wala na ang tag-araw: Ano ngayon, Ricky?|publisher=Ateneo University Press|isbn=9789715501927|page=34
|passage=Sabay sa pagpihit ni Maneng, walang salitang binuntal siya sa mukha. Napahiga si Victor sa mga taong nakatayo sa kanyang likuran. "'''Mandurukot'''!" sigaw ni Maneng. At isa pa uling suntok. Nagkagulo sa sasakyan.
|t=As Maneng steered hard, he was speechlessly hit on the face. Victor lay down on the people standing behind him. '''Pickpocket'''! Maneng shouted. And another punched. A commotion broke out inside the vehicle.}}
# [[thief]]
#: {{syn|tl|magnanakaw}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1982|author=Lázaro Francisco|title=Maganda pa ang daigdig|publisher=Ateneo University Press|isbn=9789715501699|page=3
|passage=Nakatayo ang magninang sa mataong gilid ng Simbahan ng Kiyapo at nag-aabang ng taksi upang pahatid sa Ospital Heneral nang biglang labnutin ang handbag ni Miss Sanchez ng isang '''mandurukot'''.
|t=She and her godmother are standing in a corner full of people at Quiapo Church and are waiting for a taxi to bring them to the Philippine General Hospital when a '''thief''' snatched her bag.}}

===Verb===
{{tl-head|verb form|b=+}}

# {{verb form of|tl|mandukot||contemplative|asp}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|tl|dukutan}}
* {{l|tl|madukutan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:KWF Diksiyonaryo}}

{{C|tl|Crime|People}}
-------- end text --------
