Page 12477 mang-: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 12477 mang-: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}
Page 12477 mang-: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*maN-}}. Compare {{cog|ms|meng-}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|b=+}}

# {{n-g|3rd actor trigger verb prefix}}
## {{n-g|to practice the action of the root}}
##: {{prefex|tl|mang-|gamot|t2=medicine|manggamot|t3=to practice medicine; to work as a doctor}}
##: {{prefex|tl|mang-|anak|t2=child|manganak|t3=to give birth}}
##: {{prefex|tl|mang-|bili|t2=buying|mamili|t3=to go shopping}}
##: {{prefex|tl|mang-|abala|t2=bothersome|mang-abala|t3=to bother}}
##: {{prefex|tl|mang-|kabayo|t2=horse|mangabayo|t3=to go horseback riding}}
## {{n-g|To take the state expressed by the root partially or temporarily}}
##: {{prefex|tl|mang-|pula|t2=red|mamula|t3=to redden; to go reddish}}
# {{lb|tl|with root reduplication}} {{n-g|Forms nouns signifying occupations or doer of the action expressed by the root}}
#: {{prefex|tl|mang-|isda|t2=fish|mangingisda|t3=fisher; fisherman}}
#: {{prefex|tl|mang-|batas|t2=law|mambabatas|t3=lawmaker; legislator}}

====Usage notes====
* Along with the prefix {{m|tl|pang-}}, this prefix is affected by initial consonant mutations.
* The prefix becomes {{m|tl|mam-}} before {{angbr|b}} or {{angbr|p}}. Where the root begins with {{angbr|p}}, the consonants in question may be deleted.
* the prefix becomes {{m|tl|man-}} before {{angbr|d}}, {{angbr|l}}, {{angbr|s}}, {{angbr|t}}. Where the root begins with {{angbr|s}} or {{angbr|t}}, the consonants in question may be deleted (e.g. {{m|tl|manusok}}, root {{m|tl|tusok}})).
* Where the initial of the root is a {{IPAchar|/k/}}, the sound is dropped (e.g. {{m|tl|manguha}}, root {{m|tl|kuha}})).
* Where the initial of the root is a vowel, the resulting affixed form is written without a hyphen (e.g. {{m|tl|manganak}}, root {{m|tl|anak}})), however this is typically not observed in more recent affixed forms where a hyphen is added (e.g. *{{m|tl|mang-inis}} for {{m|tl|manginis}}, root {{m|tl|inis}})).

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|tl}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
