* {{cite-book|en|author=F. Landa Jocano|title=Outline of Philippine Mythology|year=1969|publisher=Centro Escolar University Research and Development Center|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Outline_of_Philippine_Mythology/82jgAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=0}}
* {{cite-book|en|author=Florentino H. Hornedo|title=Taming the Wind: Ethno-cultural History on the Ivatan of the Batanes Isles|year=2000|publisher=University of Santo Tomas Publishing House|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Taming_the_Wind/27cuAQAAIAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=0|isbn=978-971-506-123-0}}
