By folk etymology, from {{m|tl|[[Mare]], [[ito]] [[ang]] {{l|en|latest}}|lit=Sis, here's the latest}}, but actually after {{m|tl|Marites}}, the eponymous character in TikTok videos by content creator Justine Luzares in 2020. The senses {{m-g|buzz; gossip}} emerged by 2021.

