Page 13084 maya: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|ma|ya}}
Page 13084 maya: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 13084 maya: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|ma|ya}}
Page 13084 maya: Replaced {{tl-IPA|mayâ}} with {{tl-pr|mayâ}}
Page 13084 maya: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}} (2); remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification (2)
Page 13084 maya: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*máya||rice bird, small bird found in rice fields}}. Alternatively, from {{der|tl|sa|माया||illusion}}, according to Pardo de Tavera (1887).

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[chestnut munia]] ({{taxlink|Lonchura atricapilla|species}})
# [[sparrow]]
# [[Eurasian tree sparrow]] ({{taxfmt|Passer montanus|species}})

===Etymology 2===
The original term has become obsolete. However recent usage is due to {{clipping|tl|mamaya|nocap=1}}. 

Pardo de Tavera (1887) posits it to come from {{der|tl|sa|समय||appointed or proper time, right moment for doing anything, opportunity, occasion, time, season}} with the first syllable mistaken as the {{m|tl|sa-}} prefix, hence later elided. Compare {{cog|jv|ꦱꦼꦩꦪ|t=to postpone; to delay}}, {{cog|kaw|samaya}}, {{cog|id|semaya}}. See also {{m|tl|samaya}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|mayâ}}

====Adverb====
{{tl-adv|mayâ|b=+}}

# [[after]] a [[short]] [[period]]

=====Usage notes=====
* Used mostly in derived terms.

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|maya-maya|mamaya-maya|maya't maya|magmamaya-maya|pamaya-maya|ipagpamaya-maya|ipagpamaya't maya|magmaya|maya-mayain|maya ma't}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Diksyunaryo tesauro Pilipino-Ingles 1973|page=689}}
* {{R:Diccionario tagálog-hispano|827}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613}}
* {{R:map:ACD|máya}}
* {{cite-book|last=Pardo de Tavera|first=Trinidad Hermenegildo|title=El sanscrito en la lengua tagalog|year=1887|publisher=la Faculté de médecine, A. Davy|pageurl=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=JYdBAAAAYAAJ&newbks=0&printsec=frontcover&fbclid=IwAR0VwhFGsg6LiBqrxHP01s0Ye2-IVegbBmDzgPz6ToCaomiBcVX-yf4OHEA#v=onepage&q&f=false|pages=37-38}}

{{C|tl|Perching birds|Weaver finches|Time}}

