#: {{syn|tl|feslak|q1=gay slang}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|pagmumukha|magmukha|kamukha|kapal ng mukha|bukas ng mukha|may mukha|tabla ang mukha|magkamukha|magkakamukha|mamukhaan|mukhaan|mukhang pera|mukhasim|ipamukha}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|mukhâ|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|pseudoverb}} [[look like|looking like]]; [[seeming]]
#: {{syn|tl|para}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Mukha''' kang paa.|You '''look like''' feet. (insult)}}

