Page 13480 mundo: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|mundó}}
Page 13480 mundo: Skipped, no changes
Page 13480 mundo: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|mondo||obsolete|Abecedario}}
* {{alt|tl|munro||dialectal}}

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|mundó}}

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|es|mundo||world}}, from {{der|tl|la|mundus||world}}, {{calque|tl|grc|κόσμος|nocap=1|nocat=1}}. Compare {{cog|pam|mundu}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|mundó|b=+}}

# [[world]]; the [[earth]]
#: {{syn|tl|daigdig}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|kamunduhan|ang liit ng mundo}}

===Etymology 2===
{{clipping|tl}} of {{bor|tl|es|vagamundo}}, rare form of {{m|es|vagabundo}} with influence of {{m|es|mundo||world}}, from {{der|tl|LL.|vagabundus}}. The original word was possibly interpreted to contain the interrogative particle {{m|tl|baga}}. Compare {{cog|ceb|bagamundo}}. {{doublet|tl|bagamundo}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|mundó|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[vagabondage]]; act of [[wandering]] [[around]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magmundo}}

=====See also=====
{{col3|tl|lagalag|gala|libot}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|591|Vaguear) Mondo (pc) C. hecho vagamundo}}
