===Etymology===
According to the ''Vocabulario de la lengua tagala'' (1860), the variant {{m|tl|pungkahi}} is the same with {{m|tl|pungka}}, which is said to be of {{der|tl|zh|-}} origin. Possibly from {{der|tl|nan-hbl|[[旁]][[敲]]|tr=pông-khà||sidestrike}} according to Manuel (1948).

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|mungkahì}}

===Noun===
