#: {{syn|tl|suhestiyon}}
# [[motion]] or [[proposition]] for [[discussion]] in a [[meeting]] or [[assembly]]
#: {{syn|tl|panukala|masyon|resolusyon|proposisyon}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[incitation]]; [[provocation]]; [[exhortation]]
#: {{syn|tl|buyo|himok|hikayat|kumbinsi|ulok|tukso}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magmungkahi|mungkahiin|imungkahi|ipagmungkahi|pagmungkahian|mamungkahi|pamungkahi|ipamungkahi}}

