Page 13500 mura: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|mu|ra}}
Page 13500 mura: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 13500 mura: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|+,murá}}
