Page 13500 mura: Replaced {{tl-IPA|murà}} with {{tl-pr|murà}}
Page 13500 mura: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}} (2); remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification (2)
Page 13500 mura: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|mora||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}

===Etymology 1===
{{unc|tl}}. Dempwolff 1934-1938 posited this (along with the Malay etymon and cognates in Javanese, Malagasy, Ngaju Dayak and Toba Dayak) to be inherited from {{cog|map-pro|*mudaq||cheap; easy}}, but this would result in the Tagalog being *''murà'' ({{IPAchar|/ˈmuɾaʔ/}}). Blust 2010- posits this (and cognates) are a possibly a borrowing from {{bor|tl|ms|murah}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|b=+}}

# [[cheap]]
#: {{ant|tl|mahal}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magmura|mumurahin|pagkamura|pagmura|kamurahan|ipagmura|makamura|mamura}}

===Etymology 2===
{{clipping|tl|alimura}} or possibly similar to etymology 1, with the sense of degrading someone's worth. Compare {{m|tl|mahal||precious; high value; love}}, {{cog|bcl|muda|t=swear word}}, {{cog|hil|mulay|t=to criticize maliciously; to [[disparage]]}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+,murá}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|+|head2=murá|b=+}}

# [[swear word]]; [[slander]]; [[vulgarity]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|pagmumura|magmura|murahin|magmurahan|murahan|pakamura-murahin|mamura|mapagmura|palamura}}

===Etymology 3===
Cognate of {{cog|ms|muda}}. Either from:
* From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*muda|t=young (of fruits); immature; light (of colors)}}
* From {{der|tl|pi|muddha|t=[[foolish]], [[bewildered]]}}, from {{der|tl|sa|मुग्ध|t=[[foolish]], [[bewildered]], [[young]]}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|murà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|murà|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|dialectal|Southern Tagalog}} {{gl|young fruit of}} [[coconut]]
#: {{syn|tl|buko}}
# [[young]] {{q|particularly of fruit, or human age}}
#: {{syn|tl|bata}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|murà|b=+}}

# [[young]]
#: {{syn|tl|bata}}
# [[unripe]] {{q|of fruits}}
#: {{syn|tl|hilaw|bubot}}
# [[light]] {{q|of colors}}
#: {{syn|tl|mapusyaw}}
#: {{ant|tl|magulang}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|murang edad|murang katawan|murang bait|pagkamura|kamuraan|magmurang-kamatis}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

