{{tl-pr|nagká-}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|nagká-|b=+}}

# {{form of|tl|completed form|magka-}}
## {{ngd|Prefix for completed aspects of verbs with actor focus and causative mood}}: to have occurred involuntarily or unexpectedly
### {{m|tl|nagka-}} + {{m|tl|salubong||[[encounter]]}} → {{m|tl|nagkasalubong||to have met unexpectedly}}
## {{ngd|Prefix for completed aspects of verbs with actor focus and causative mood}}: to have come to have or possess
### {{m|tl|nagka-}} + {{m|tl|kotse||car}} → {{m|tl|nagkakotse||to have gotten a car}}

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|tl}}

===Further reading===
* [https://learningtagalog.com/grammar/verbs/verb_affixes/magka_1.html magka-] in ''Learning Tagalog''
* [https://learningtagalog.com/grammar/verbs/verb_affixes/magka_2.html magka-] in ''Learning Tagalog''
