{{bor+|tl|es|ni||not even}}, from {{der|tl|osp|nin}}, from {{der|tl|la|nec}}, [[apocopation|apocopated]] form of {{m|la|neque}}.

====Conjunction====
{{tl-head|conjunction|b=+}}

