Page 14037 one to sawa: WARNING: Non-default pronunciation wan tu sawà and specified syllabification one to sa.wa not equal to respelling auto-syllabification (nil) or pagetitle auto-syllabification o.ne to sa.wa, adding explicitly: {{hyph|tl|one to sa|wa}}
