Page 14037 one to sawa: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|want to sawa}}
* {{alt|tl|wantusawa||colloquial}}

===Etymology===
{{Taglish}}, from {{compound|tl|[[one]] [[to]]|sawa|lang1=en|lit=(from) one to (the time of) lost interest}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|wan tu sawà|syll=one to sa.wa}}

===Adverb===
{{tl-adv|{{l|en|one}} {{l|en|to}} [[sawà]]|b=wan tu sawa}}

# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} done [[continuously]] until [[stop]]ped {{q|such as by [[boredom]], lost of [[interest]], [[satisfaction]], or [[interruption]] by an external force}}
#: {{syn|tl|[[hanggang]] [[magsawa]]}}
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/705772/binay-seeks-lifting-of-term-limitations-one-to-sawa|title=Binay seeks lifting of term limitations: One to ‘sawa’|date=2015-07-17|author=Carla P. Gomez|work=INQUIRER.net|text=Itong term na ito ’di talaga ako naniniwala d’yan. Kailangan '''one to sawa''' ’yan, hangga’t gusto ng tao. Kaya kung meron amendments sa Constitution, ipapaalis ko yung term limitation. Hangga’t maaari, iboto nang iboto.|t=On this term, I don't really believe that. It should be '''until one is satisfied''', as long as the person still wants to. So if there are amendments to the Constitution, I would ask the term limitation to be removed. As much as possible, [a person] should be voted.}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|url=https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/balitambayan/talakayan/844884/mala-maldives-at-mala-venice-na-travel-destinations-alamin-kung-saan-matatagpuan/story/|title=Mala-Maldives at mala-Venice na travel destinations, alamin kung saan matatagpuan|date=2022-09-14|work=Balitambayan|text=Alok din ng resort ang pamamangka nang libre o '''one to sawa'''.|t=The resort also offers boating freely or '''until one is satisfied'''.}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|url=https://lifestyle.inquirer.net/122147/kim-atienza-from-stroke-survivor-to-triathlete/|title=Kim Atienza: From stroke survivor to triathlete|date=2013-08-26|work=Lifestyle.INQ|text=I have a big bowl of salad, marami, kahit mag one to sawa ka sa salad okay lang, lalo ‘pag green leafy...|t=I have a big bowl of salad, a lot, even if I [eat] '''until satisfaction''', it's okay, especially if it's green leafy...}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|magdamag}}
-------- end text --------
