Page 14055 Ongpin: Skipped, no changes
Page 14055 Ongpin: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
The street was renamed after {{w|Roman Ongpin}}'s surname. The surname is from {{bor|tl|nan-hbl|[[王]][[彬]]|tr=Ông Pin}}, the [[surname]] and part of the [[given name]] of the Hokkien Chinese name of {{w|Roman Ongpin}}'s father, Simon Ongpinco, known in {{ncog|nan-hbl|-}} as {{m|nan-hbl|[[王]][[翼]][[彬]]|tr=Ông Ia̍k-pin}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|b=+}}

# {{surname|tl|Chinese Filipino|from=Hokkien}}
# {{w|Binondo|Ongpin Street}} in [[Binondo]] {{q|former Calle Sacristia, the historical [[main street]] of Binondo}}
# {{lb|tl|Chinese Filipino|colloquial}} {{w|Binondo}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|tl|Ong}}
