===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|tl|map-pro|*pa|t=still, yet, til now, first (before doing something else)}}. Cognate with {{cog|ceb|pa|t=id}}, {{cog|mg|fa|t=for, but, therefore, because, that}}.

====Adverb====
{{tl-adv|b=+}}

# [[yet]]
#: {{ux|tl|Hindi '''pa''' niya binuhay ang sinaing.|He hasn't turned the rice cooker on '''yet'''.}}
# [[still]]; [[eventually]]; [[in the future]]
#: {{ux|tl|Buhay '''pa''' ang bintilador; bakit hindi mo 'to pinatay?|The fan is '''still''' on; why didn't you turn it off?}}
# [[in addition]], [[too]]
# [[in the past]]
# [[even]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|pa naman|pa rin}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|pa-}}

===Etymology 2===
Influenced by Baybayin character {{m|tl|{{tl-bay sc|pa}}}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{tl-letter name|P|p|alph=abak}}
#: {{syn|tl|pi|pe|q1=in the Filipino alphabet|q2=in the Abecedario}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|papa}}

===Etymology 3===

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|informal|familiar|childish}} {{clipping of|tl|papa}}
#: {{syn|tl|papa|ama|tatay|itay|tay|tatang}}
#: {{cot|tl|ma}}

