===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|pa- -hin}}
* {{alt|tl|pa- -nin}}

===Circumfix===
{{tl-head|circumfix|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|causative}}  Object trigger -  Circumfix to form the causative verb form of the adjectives
#: {{afex|tl|tahimik|t1=quiet|pa- -in|patahimikin|t3=to silence}}
#: {{afex|tl|lamig|t1=cold|pa- -in|patahimikin|t3=to cool}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Palamigin''' mo itong inumin.|'''Cool''' this drink.}}
# {{lb|tl|causative}}  Object trigger -  Indicates performance of the action of the verb
#: {{afex|tl|daan|t1=pass|pa- -in|paraanin|t3=make someone give way}}
#: {{afex|tl|upo|t1=sitting|pa- -in|paupuin|t3=make someone sit down}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Paupuin''' mo 'ang mga bisita.|'''Ask''' the visitors '''to sit down'''.}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, {{IPAchar|/h/}} is inserted before ''-in'' when the root word ends with a vowel that is not followed by a glottal stop. In some cases, phoneme change can occur and {{IPAchar|/h/}} becomes {{IPAchar|/n/}}.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|punta|[[papuntahin|papunta'''h'''in]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|ganda|[[pagandahin|paganda'''h'''in]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|laki|[[palakihin|palaki'''h'''in]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|tawa|[[patawanin|patawa'''n'''in]]}}

* Due to [[allophony]], {{IPAchar|/d/}} turns into {{IPAchar|/r/}} when inserted before ''-in'' or after ''pa-''.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|tawad|[[patawarin|patawa'''r'''in]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|dami|[[paramihin|pa'''r'''amihin]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|danas|[[paranasin|pa'''r'''anasin]]}}

====Derived terms====
{{circumfixsee|tl}}

===Further reading===
* https://learningtagalog.com/grammar/verbs/verb_affixes/pain.html
