{{wikipedia|lang=tl}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|tl|aral|pa- -an}}. Said to be {{coin|tl|Eusebio T. Daluz|w=-|in=1915|nocap=1}}, but has been used prior to 1915.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|pá7aralán<audio:Tl-PH-paaralan.ogg>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|páaralán|b=+}}

# [[school]]
#: {{syn|tl|eskuwela|eskuwelahan}}
#: {{ux|tl|Papasok na ako sa '''paaralan''', Nay.|I'm going to '''school''' now, Mom.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1902|author=Philippines. Exposition Board|title=Ley no. 514 creando la junta de la exposición Carta circular del gobernador Taft, etc
|passage=Mg̃a sadyáng palakad sa pagtuturò.—Mg̃a libróng gamit.—Kasangkapan at mg̃a gamit sa '''páaralan'''.}}
# [[place]] of [[studying]]

