Page 14274 pag-: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 14274 pag-: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}
Page 14274 pag-: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*paʀ-}}. Cognate with {{cog|ceb|pag-}}, and {{cog|ms|per-}} and {{cog|id|per-}}.

====Prefix====
{{tl-head|prefix|b=+}}

# the act of doing the action expressed by the root; or, the manner in which the action expressed by the root is performed
#: {{prefixusex|tl|gawa|t1=make|paggawa|t2=making}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|basa|t1=read|pagbasa|t2=reading}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The root and the affixed word generally mean the same thing.
*: {{ux|tl|Mabagal ang lakad niya.|He/she walks slowly.|inline=1}}
*: {{ux|tl|Mabagal ang paglakad niya.|He/she walks slowly.|inline=1}}

====Prefix====
{{tl-head|prefix|b=+}}

# (''with syllable reduplication'') the act of doing the action expressed by the root repeatedly or habitually
#: {{prefixusex|tl|aral|t1=study|pag-aaral|t2=studying habitually}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|basa|t1=read|pagbabasa|t2=reading habitually}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{m|tl|pag|t=if}}, which is a {{clipping|tl|kapag|t=if|nocap=1}}, which is a {{clipping|tl|kapagka|t=if|nocap=1}}.

====Prefix====
{{tl-head|prefix|b=+}}

# [[when]]; [[at]] (or [[as soon as]]) that time that; [[if]]
#: {{ux|tl|pag-alis nila|when they leave/left|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|tl|pagbalik nila|when they return/returned|inline=1}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{prefixsee|tl}}
-------- end text --------
Page 14275 pag- -an: Skipped, no changes
Page 14275 pag- -an: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|pag- -han}}
* {{alt|tl|pag- -nan}}

===Circumfix===
{{tl-head|circumfix|b=+}}

# Object trigger - perform the action of the verb on/ at/ to/ in something or someone
#: {{suffixusex|tl|sabi|t1=say|pagsabihan|t2=to be reprimanded, to be warned}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Pinagsabihan''' ko na siya.|I already '''warned''' him.}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|higanti|t1=revenge|paghigantihan|t2=to be taken revenge on}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Pinaghigantihan''' niya ang pagkamatay ng lolo niya.|He '''took revenge''' on the death of his grandfather.}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|himasok|t1=say|panghimasukan|t2=to be meddled in}}
#: {{ux|tl|Huwag mong '''panghimasukan''' ang buhay ko.|Don't '''poke your nose''' in my life.}}

====Derived terms====
{{circumfixsee|tl}}

===Further reading===
* https://learningtagalog.com/grammar/verbs/verb_affixes/pagan_1_pangan.html
-------- end text --------
Page 14276 pag- -han: Skipped, no changes
Page 14276 pag- -han: -------- begin text --------

===Circumfix===
{{tl-head|circumfix|b=+}}

# {{alt form|tl|pag- -an|nocap=1|nodot=1}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, {{IPAchar|/h/}} is inserted before {{m|tl|-an}} when the root word ends with a vowel that is not followed by a glottal stop. In some cases, phoneme change can occur and {{IPAchar|/h/}} becomes {{IPAchar|/n/}}.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|sabi|[[pagsabihan|pagsabi'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|duda|[[pagdudahan|pagduda'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|base|[[pagbasehan|pagbase'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|tawa|[[pagtawanan|pagtawa'''n'''an]]}}

