Page 14371 paging-: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|pa|ging-}}
Page 14371 paging-: Replaced {{tl-IPA|pagíng-}} with {{tl-pr|pagíng-}}
Page 14371 paging-: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 14371 paging-: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Possibly from obsolete root {{m|phi-pro|*ging}} (also possible to be {{m|phi-pro|*gi}}/{{m|phi-pro|*giq}}/{{m|phi-pro|*gin}} + {{m|tl|-ng}} suffix).<ref>{{cite-journal|title=Tagalog Monosyllabic Roots|work=Oceanic Linguistics|page=345–374|year=1995|url=https://www.jstor.org/stable/3623048|volume=34|issue=2|issn=0029-8115|doi=10.2307/3623048|last=Potet|first=Jean-Paul G.}}</ref> Cognate with {{cog|ceb|pangin-}} and {{cog|hil|[[pangin-]] and [[paning-]]}}. Compare {{m|tl|maging|pos=to be}} and {{m|tl|pagiging|pos=being}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|pagíng-}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|pagíng-|b=+}}

# {{tlb|tl|rare}} {{n-g|the act of change, making, or becoming towards the idea expressed by the root; or, emphasizing the fact of being or existence of the idea expressed by the root}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|dapat|t1=just|napaging-dapat|t2=became justified}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|dapat|t1=just|napagiging-dapat|t2=becoming justified}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|banal|t1=holy|pinapaging-banal|t2=become holy; sanctified}}

====Usage notes====
The root and the affixed word generally mean the same thing, although it lends greater emphasis to the fact of being or becoming expressed by the root. All known occurrences of the affix indicate it also needs a preceding prefix before it, such as {{m|tl|ma-}}, {{m|tl|pa-}}, {{m|tl|i-}}, and {{m|tl|kina-}}, amongst others. The affix is rare conversationally, and mostly found in liturgical, biblical, or philosophical use.
* {{ux|tl|Ang mga pagyayaring ito ay ikinabayani ni Mabini.|These events made Mabini into a hero.|inline=1}}
* {{ux|tl|Ang mga pangyayaring ito ay ikinapaging-bayani ni Mabini.|These events made Mabini to become a hero.|inline=1}}

The difference in emphasis can be discerned:
* {{ux|tl|Sapagkat pinabanal ang mga ito sa pamamagitan ng salita ng Diyos at panalangin.| Because these are made holy by the word of God and prayer.|inline=1}} 
* {{ux|tl|Sapagkat pinaging-banal ang mga ito sa pamamagitan ng salita ng Diyos at panalangin.| Because these are made to become holy by the word of God and prayer.|inline=1}}

===References===
<references />
-------- end text --------
