{{tl-pr|pagkakapagíng-}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|pagkakapagíng-|b=+}}

# {{tlb|tl|rare}} {{n-g|the act or manner of the act of coming to a state of being in the past of the idea expressed in the root.}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|hayag|t1=open, manifest, shown|pagkakapaging-hayag|t2=the act or manner of having come to being manifested}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|alipin|t1=slave|pagkakapaging-alipin|t2=the act or manner of having come to being a slave}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|maringal|t1=splendid|pagkakapaging-maringal|t2=the act or manner of having come to being splendid}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|guro|t1=teacher|pagkakapaging-guro|t2=the act or manner of having come to being a teacher}}

====Usage notes====
* Emphasizes a past temporal process of transition towards the realization of the idea in the root.

====See also====
*[[pagkakanaging-]]
*[[pagkakamaging-]]
*[[pagkapagiging-]]
