Page 14612 pakulo: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|pa|ku|lo}}
Page 14612 pakulo: Replaced {{tl-IPA|pakulô}} with {{tl-pr|pakulô}}
Page 14612 pakulo: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 14612 pakulo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|tl|pa|kulo|t2=act of boiling}}. From the 1970s.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|pakulô}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|pakulô|b=+}}

# [[ingenious]] [[scheme]] to [[brag]] about, especially for [[entertainment]]
#: {{syn|tl|katusuhan|pasiklab}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1983|author=Nicanor G. Tiongson|title=The Urian Anthology, 1970-1979: Selected Essays on Tradition and Innovation in the Filipino Cinema of the 1970s by the Manunuri Ng Pelikulang Pilipino : with about 550 Photos and Illustrations and a Filmography of Philippine Movies, 1970-1979
|passage=Sabi nga'y kanya-kanya sila ng lakad at '''pakulo'''. Sa kasalukuya'y may 150 na rehistradong prodyuser ( hindi kasama ang mga fly-by-night).
|translation=They say they do a lot and create new ideas all on their own. Presently, there are 150 registered producers (not including those who fly by night).}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1982|author=Frank G. Rivera|title=Ama, Atbp. Sari-Saring Dula
|passage=TAO 3: Hindi kaya '''pakulo''' na naman ito ni Mayor?<br>TAO 1: Hindi naman eleksiyon ngayon! Kaya maaaring hindi pakulo. Tuwing eleksiyon lang naman siya nangangako&#39;t napapako.
|translation=PERSON 3: Isn't our mayor just bragging something again?<br>PERSON 1: It's not election yet! So it'a possibly not. Only during election he makes broken promises.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1989|title=Philippine Currents
|passage=Mukhang ito ay isang magandang '''pakulo''' para sa pakikipag-usap ng ating pamahalaan sa Bise-Presidente ng Amerika.
|translation=This looks like something good to brag about as our government talks with the U.S. Vice President}}
# [[publicity stunt]]
# [[gimmick]]; [[ploy]]
#: {{syn|tl|lansi}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Tagalog Slang Dictionary}}
-------- end text --------
