===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|sa|-}} {{prefix|sa|परि-|भाषा|nocat=1}}. Compare {{cog|tsg|pulibahasa}}, {{cog|ms|peribahasa}}, and {{cog|hi|परिभाषा|gloss=definition}}.

