===Conjunction===
{{tl-head|conjunction|palibhasà|b=+}}

# [[because]] {{q|of the fact that}}
#: {{syn|tl|kawasa|q1=Quezon}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Palibhasa''' at hindi nila pera kaya wala silang pakialam sa magagastos.|'''Since''' it's not their money, they don't care about the expenses.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Palibhasa't''' kasamahan mo siya kaya pinagbigyan mo.|'''Since''' he was your colleague, you gave him permission.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Nagkakasiyahan sila ngayon, '''palibhasa''' hindi nila ramdam ang kahirapan.|They are enjoying themselves now '''because''' they don't feel the poverty.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Palibhasa''' sa lalaki, imposibleng mangyari sa kanila iyon..|'''Because''' [of the fact that] they are men, it was impossible for it to happen to them.}}

