===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[barter]]
# [[exchange]]; [[substitution]]
# [[exchange rate]]
#: {{uxi|tl|Magkano na ang '''palitan''' ng piso at dolyar?|How much is the peso-dollar '''exchange rate''' by now?}}

