===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*palu}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*palu}} (cf. {{cog|ms|palu||hammer}}). Some writers (e.g. English 1985) treat this as a borrowing from Spanish {{m|es|palo||stick, cudgel}}, but it is most likely a chance resemblance.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|palò}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|palò|b=+}}

# [[stroke]] with the [[hand]] or a [[stick]], usually as [[punishment]]; [[spank]]
#: {{syn|tl|gulpi|hampas}}

