#: {{afex|tl|bili|t1=purchase|pam- -an|pamilihan|t3=market}}
#: {{afex|tl|puno|t1=leader|pam- -an|pamunuan|t3=administration}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, {{IPAchar|/h/}} is inserted before {{m|tl|-an}} when the root word ends with a vowel that is not followed by a glottal stop.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|bili|[[pamilihan|pamili'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|pito|[[pampituhan|pampitu'''h'''an]]}}

====Derived terms====
{{circumfixsee|tl}}
