{{tl-pr}}

===Circumfix===
{{tl-head|circumfix|b=+|b2=pan- an}}

# {{alt form|tl|pang- -an|nocap=1|nodot=1}} for roots with initials (d), (s) and (t), which will usually have them removed
#: {{afex|tl|titik|t1=letter|pan- -an|panitikan|t3=literature}}
#: {{afex|tl|sandali|t1=a moment|pan- -an|panandalian|t3=short-term}}
#: {{afex|tl|sagot|t1=response|pan- -an|pananagutan|t3=responsibility}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, {{IPAchar|/h/}} is inserted before {{m|tl|-an}} when the root word ends with a vowel that is not followed by a glottal stop. In some cases, phoneme change can occur and {{IPAchar|/h/}} becomes {{IPAchar|/n/}}.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|tira|[[panirahan|panira'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|talo|[[panaluhan|panalu'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|talo|[[panalunan|panalu'''n'''an]]}}

====Derived terms====
{{circumfixsee|tl}}
