Page 14871 panahon: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr}}
Page 14871 panahon: Skipped, no changes
Page 14871 panahon: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{af|tl|pan-|alt2=*tahon}}, with the root from {{cog|ms|tahun}}, or presumably an older form of {{m|tl|taon}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Potet|NUOT|page=252}}</ref>  {{surf|tl|pan-|taon}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|panawen}} and {{cog|pag|panaon}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|panahón}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|panahón|b=+}}

# [[time]]
#: {{syn|tl|tiyempo}}
# a [[point]] in time; a [[duration]] of time, [[while]]
#: {{syn|tl|oras|sandali}}
# a [[period]] of time; [[age]]; [[era]]
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Panahong''' Bakal|Iron '''Age'''}}
# [[epoch]]; [[season]]; [[tide]]
#: {{syn|tl|salukoy|q1=obsolete|musim|q2=obsolete}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''panahon''' ng ani|harvest '''season'''}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''panahon''' ng Pasko|Christmas '''tide'''}}
# [[weather]]
#: {{syn|tl|weder|bayan|q2=obsolete}}
# [[tense]]
#: {{uxi|tl|panghinaharap na '''panahon'''|future '''tense'''}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[sowing]] [[period]] {{defdate|16th|17th c.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|Gitnang Panahon|kapanahon|kapanahunan|habang-panahon|hindi panahon|magkapanahon|magkasapanahon|may-panahon|may-sapanahon|napapanahon|pampanahon|pamanahon|panahunan|panahunin|pana-panahon|pinapanahon|sapanahon|takdang panahon|unang panahon|wala sa panahon|panahon ni Limahong|panahon ni Mahoma|Karaniwang Panahon|isapanahon|mabilis ang panahon|ginintuang panahon}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|klima}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{af|tl|pan-|dahon}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[cultivation]] of [[palm]] or [[coconut]] trees in other's land

===Etymology 3===
Possibly related to {{cog|ms|penaung||patron; guardian; protector}}, from {{m|ms|naung}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# act of staying in someone else's home to [[protect]] them

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|panahunan|panahunin|magpapanahon}}

===References===
<references/>

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613}}
** page 196: “Coſecha) Panahon (pc) de trabajo”
** page 570: “Temporal) Panahon (pc) de ſembrar”
** page 574: “Tiempo) Panahon (pc) de ſembrar”

