===Etymology 1===
Each pronunciation has a different source:
* {{IPAchar|/paˈpa/}} from {{bor|tl|es|papá}}, adapted from {{der|tl|fr|papa}}
* {{IPAchar|/papa/}} from {{bor|tl|nan-hbl|爸爸|tr=pâ-pâ}}
* {{IPAchar|/ˈpapa/}} from {{bor|tl|en|papa}} / {{m|en|poppa}}

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr
|papá<qq:Spanish pronunciation>
|raw:/pa.pa/ [pa.pa]<qq:Hokkien pronunciation>
|+<qq:English Pronunciation>
}}

====Noun====
