Page 15325 Pasig: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|tl|pasig||sandy riverbank}}.

Common {{glossary|folk etymologies}} include claims of {{der|tl|sa|-}} origin, or a corruption of {{m|tl|mabagsik}} by Chinese. No Sanskrit words sounding similar to ''Pasig'' exist, however.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|b=+}}

# {{place|tl|independent city|r/Metro Manila|c/Philippines|t=Pasig}}
# {{place|tl|river|c/Philippines|t=Pasig}}

====Descendants====
* Chinese
*: {{desc|cmn|帕西格|tr=Pàxīgé|bor=1}}
*: {{desc|nan|巴石|tr=Pa-se̍k|bor=1}}
* {{desc|en|Pasig|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ja|パシッグ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|es|Pásig|bor=1}}

===Further reading===
* {{pedia|lang=tl}}
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
