====See also====
{{col-auto|tl|kitil|kaluluwa|puksa|bitay|tiyanak|katay|paslang}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|patáy|b=+}}

# [[oh no]]
#: {{ux|tl|'''Patay'''! Nakalimutan ko yung sinaing!|'''Oh no'''! I forgot about the rice!|lit='''(I'm) dead'''! I forgot about the rice!}}
# {{n-g|expression when one is [[doomed]] to be severely punished}}: [[dead meat]]
#: {{syn|tl|yari}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Patay''' ka sa nanay mo!|You're '''doomed''' from your mother!}}

