Early {{glossary|borrowing}} from {{bor|tl|es|zapatos}}, plural of {{m|es|zapato||shoe}}, with {{clipping|tl|nocap=1}}. The first syllable may have been misinterpreted as the preposition {{m|tl|sa||in; on; at}}. {{doublet|tl|sapatos}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[shoe]]
#: {{syn|tl|sapatos|paruka|q2=obsolete}}
#: {{ux|tl|Patusin mo itong '''patos'''.|Wear this '''shoe''' as your shoe.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magpatos|patusin|patos-na-kahoy|patusan}}

