Page 15615 petsa de peligro: WARNING: {{tl-IPA}} used with '+' or empty respelling but specified syllabification pet.sa de pe.li.gro not equal to respelling/pagetitle auto-syllabification pet.sa de pe.lig.ro, adding explicitly: {{hyph|tl|pet|sa de pe|li|gro}}
