From {{clipping|tl|nocap=1}} of {{af|tl|en:picture|-s}}. Pictures are synonymous with images, and [[image]] is abbreviated as [[IMG]] in Internet slang. IMG when spelled letter by letter as {{m-g|I-M-G}}, sounds like {{m-g|I am G}}. See {{m|tl|G}} for more details.

