Page 15821 pito: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*pitu}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*pitu}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|pitó<audio:TL-PH-pito.ogg><audio:LL-Q34057 (tgl)-Filipinayzd-pito.wav>}}

====Numeral====
{{tl-num|pitó|b=+}}

# {{cln|tl|cardinal numbers}} [[seven]]
#: {{syn|tl|siyete}}

=====Usage notes=====
* To describe the quantity of something, the number is placed before the noun and affixed with a '''-ng''' when the word ends with a vowel, and a separate word '''[[na]]''' for a consonant.
*: '''''Isang''' saging, '''dalawang''' pinya''
*: '''''Apat na''' mansanas, '''anim na''' mangga''

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|ikapitong langit|ikapito|pampito|Pitong Wika|pitumpu|pitumbuko|kulang sa pito, labis sa walo|pitong nakamamatay na kasalanan|pitong punong kasalanan}}

