{{bor+|tl|es|pito}}, alteration of {{m|es|pico}}, from {{der|tl|osp|bico}}, from {{der|tl|la|beccus}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[whistle]] {{sense|device}}
#: {{syn|tl|silbato}}
# [[whistle]] {{sense|sound}}
#: {{syn|tl|sipol}}

