Page 16057 produkto: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|producto}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# a [[commodity]] offered for sale
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=1987|title=Tulay: Literary Journal of the World News, Volume 1, Issues 1-4|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=iJJkAAAAMAAJ&redir_esc=y|page=76|text=Ang '''mga produktong''' ito'y dinadala sa Maynila para ibenta sa mga negosyanteng Tsino at Europeo, kapalit ng mga yaring '''produktong''' ipinamamahagi naman sa buong Kabisayaan.|t=These '''products''' are sent to Manila for sale to Chinese and European merchants, in exchange for manufactured '''products''' that are then distributed to the entire Visayas.}}
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=2009|author=Institute for Social Service Alternatives|title=The Catalyst 2|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=aXZTzsnxi90C&redir_esc=y|publisher=Rex Bookstore, Inc.|text=Dahil dito, nagsimula na ring humina ang kita ng mga kumpanyang nagbebenta ng '''mga produkto''' at serbisyo sa Amerika.|t=Because of this, the profits of the companies that are selling '''products''' and services in America have started to decrease.}}
# a [[result]] of a process
#: {{syn|tl|bunga}}
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=1981|publisher=College of Liberal Arts, University of the Philippines|title=Philippine Social Sciences and Humanities Review, Volume 45|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=ARc7AAAAIAAJ&redir_esc=y|text=Masasabi kung ganoon na ang burges-komprador ay '''produkto''' ng isang lipunang kolonyal.|t=It can thus be said that the comprador bourgeoisie is a '''product''' of a colonial society.}}
#* {{quote-web|1=tl|year=2006|publisher=Palimbagang Sentral Partido Komunista ng Pilipinas|work=Manipesto ng Partido Komunista|url=https://www.marxists.org/tagalog/marx-engels/1848/m-e-manipesto-ng-partido-komunista.pdf|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20191019185520/https://www.marxists.org/tagalog/marx-engels/1848/m-e-manipesto-ng-partido-komunista.pdf|archivedate=19 Oct 2019|page=38|text=Kung gayon, makikita natin kung paano ang modernong burgesya ay '''produkto''' mismo ng mahabang proseso ng pag-unlad, ng isang serye ng mga rebolusyon sa moda ng produksyon at palitan.|t=We see, therefore, how the modern bourgeoisie is itself the '''product''' of a long course of development, of a series of revolutions in the modes of production and of exchange.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der2|tl|magprodukto}}
-------- end text --------
