Page 16060 promdi: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From a {{glossary|pronunciation spelling}} of {{der|tl|en|[[from]] [[the]] ''(''[[province]]'')''}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|eye dialect|slang|ethnic slur|possibly|_|offensive}} a term used for people transitioning from [[rural]] to [[urban]] life; a [[country bumpkin]]
#: {{syn|tl|taga-bundok|probinsiyano|probinsiyana}}

====Usage notes====
This term can be offending or stereotypical, as it is often used to make fun of people who first arrive in a big city and wear unfashionable clothes or speak in a rural-like accent, common stereotypes of people coming from the countryside. It is being reclaimed as a symbol of pride.

===Further reading===
* {{R:Tagalog Slang Dictionary}}
