# [[grammar cop]]; [[grammar police]]; [[prescriptivist]]
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=18 July 2019|author=@missingcodec|work=w:Twitter|url=https://twitter.com/missingcodec/status/1151881294457921536|passage=Frens, #TanggolWika ha, hindi #'''PulisWika'''. Tigil tigilan niyo yang {{m|tl|ng}} vs {{m|tl|nang}} na yan, di niyo kinagaganda yan.|t=Friends, be a #LanguagePreservator, not a #LanguagePrescriptivist. Stop with those ''ng'' vs ''nang'' stuff, you don't get beautiful doing stuff like that.}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=14 April 2021|author=Ricardo Ma Nolasco|work=w:Facebook|url=https://www.facebook.com/754488599/posts/pfbid0FghURow2oTvd3TgWHAZrkWiXLWW6jz4td7zTsGCXtxQXSXG6gBc4UruR8uCVSb9Nl/|passage=6.  Dapat maging matalas ang mga seryosong iskolar ng wika. Kapag nagbago ng paraan ng pagsulat o pagbigkas ang maygamit ng wika, dapat nating usisain ang mga dahilan ng gayong pagbabago. Huwag natin itong maka-isang panig na itakwil gaya  ng nakasanayan ng mga pulis-wika.}}
