Page 16203 puno: Skipped, no changes
Page 16203 puno: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*pənuq}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*pənuq}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*pəNuq}}. Akin to {{cog|ms|penuh}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|punô}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|punô|b=+}}

# [[full]]
#: {{ant|tl|basyo}}
# {{lb|tl|euphemism}} [[annoyed]]; [[fed up]]
#: {{syn|tl|konsumido|yamot}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|mapuno|punong-puno|punuin|ipuno|magpuno|pumuno|kapupunan|pagpunan|punan|pamuno}}

===Etymology 2===
From Greater Central Philippine ''*punuq'', {{metathesis|tl}} of {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*puqun}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*puqun||base of a tree; cause; source, origin}}. Compare {{cog|ceb|puno}}, {{cog|mrw|pono'an}}, {{cog|tsg|puun}}, and {{cog|ms|pohon}}. {{doublet|tl|puhunan}}. See also {{m|tl|poon}}. Possibly related to {{ncog|nan-hbl|本|tr=pún|t=source; origin; root; foundation}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|punò|hmp=Puno}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|punò|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|botany|plant}} [[tree]]
#: {{syn|tl|punongkahoy}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[source]]; [[origin]]
#: {{syn|tl|pinagmulan|pinanggalingan|ugat}}
# [[head]]; [[leader]]
#: {{syn|tl|pinuno|pangulo}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|mapuno|punongkahoy|pinuno|pamunuan|mamuno|puno't dulo|punong-abala|punong-banta|punong barangay|punong-bayan|punong-guro|punong-himpilan|punong-katawan|punong lalawigan|punong-lungsod|punong ministro|himuno|manghimuno|himunuin|himunuan|kung ano ang puno, siya ang bunga|Pambansang Punong Rehiyon|pitong nakamamatay na kasalanan|pitong punong kasalanan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|peNuq}}
* {{R:map:ACD|puqun}}

{{C|tl|Trees}}

