===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|putang inabit|taena||minced oath}}
* {{alt|tl|P.I.|PI||bowdlerization}}
* {{alt|tl|putang-ina|putangina}}
* {{alt|tl|tangina}}
* {{alt|tl|putaera||Rizal}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|tl|puta|t1=prostitute|-ng|pos2=[[enclitic]] suffix|ina|t3=mother}} or a {{partial calque|tl|es|puta madre|nocap=1}}.

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|[[puta|putang]] [[iná]]|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|vulgar|offensive}} [[prostitute]] [[mother]]
# {{lb|tl|idiomatic|vulgar|derogatory}} any [[contemptible]] person
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2006|author=Ireneo Perez Catilo|title=Pandesal: at iba pang kuwento|text=Nagtutungayaw na sinalubong ito ng kanyang ina. &quot;Ang puta! '''Putang ina''' ka! Buwisit, salot ka sa lugal na ito!&quot; Sinampal at sinabunutan ang nagugulumihanang si Aling Marta. Dumurugo ang labi at lumuha na lamang ito, hindi man lamang&nbsp;...|translation=His mother greeted him with a smile. &quot;Damn it! You '''piece of shit'''! For god's sake, you're a plague on this place!&quot; He slapped and beat the disturbed Mrs. Marta. Her lips were bleeding and she was merely weeping, not even&nbsp;...}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|[[puta]]ng [[iná]]|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|vulgar|derogatory}} [[annoying]]; [[wretched]]; [[fucked up]]
#: {{ux|tl|Umaasa ka pa sa '''putang inang''' ex mo, e mukhang wala na siyang pakialam sa'yo kahit humagulgol ka.|You're still hoping for that '''jerk''' ex of yours, but she doesn't seem to care about you even if you sob.}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|[[puta]]ng [[iná]]|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|vulgar}} [[fuck]]! {{gl|may be negative or positive}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Putang ina''', bagsak ako sa relihiyon at kimika!|'''Fuck''', I failed religion and chemistry!}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Putang ina''', ang galing niyang maggitara!|'''Holy fuck''', he's really good at playing the guitar!}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|ano ba 'yan|diyos ko po|kupal|kainaman na|putang ina mo|puki ng ina}}

{{cln|tl|swear words}}
