===Etymology===
{{Taglish}}, from {{w|Philippine English|Philippine}} {{infix|tl|ref|in|lang1=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|rinéf}}

===Verb===
{{tl-verb|rinéf|rinef|rineref|rerefin|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|informal}} to put something in a [[refrigerator]]; to [[refrigerate]]
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2014-10-21|author=@neversherender|work=Twitter|text=Kapag '''rinef''' mo yung tubig, magiging ano? DIba malamig?|t=If you '''refrigerate''' water, it will become what? Right [it will be] cold?}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2018-12-24|author=@Aetalya18|work=Twitter|text=Panis yang••••ulam niyo kung di nyo '''rinef'''. Hmm|t=Your viand will be spoiled if you don't '''refrigerate''' it. Hmm}}
#* {{quote-web|en,tl|year=2022|author=Christine Hazel Cabato|work=YouTube|text=Hi, can I ask po after mixing '''rinef''' nyo po or hindi?|t=Hi, can I respectfully ask if after mixing, did you '''refrigerate''' [it] or not?|title=How to Prepare Ever Whip cream icing{{!}} Super stable icing{{!}} Ever Whip review by Mommy rheine}}
# {{lb|tl|informal}} [[refrigerated]]
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2013-01-13|author=@XYZyrilSntx|work=Askfm|text={{...}}May joke ako. Ref? Ayan yung tawag kapag may ginawa ang lalaki sa babae na hind kaaya-aya. Ex: "Uy, '''RinEF''' niya ako!!!{{...}}|t=I have a joke. Ref? That's what's called when a boy does something to a girl that is not pleasant. Example: "Hey, they '''refrigerated''' me!!!{{...}}"|title=Ano ang Tagalog ng Ref?|trans-title=What is the Tagalog of Ref?}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2019-12-25|author=@unofficial_kth|work=Twitter|text=Yung tipong pagbukas mo sa ref wala na yung pagkain na '''rinef''' mo...|t=That moment when you opened the refrigerator and the food you '''refrigerated''' is gone...}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2020-12-15|author=@tangomqureen|work=Twitter|text=Guys '''rinef''' ko yung asin 🙂|t=Guys I '''refrigerated''' the salt 🙂}}

====Inflection====
{{tl-infl-table|[[-in-]]|object|[[refin]]|[[rinef]]<br/>[[niref]]|[[rineref]]<br/>[[nireref]]|[[rerefin]]|[[kareref]]|[[kakaref]]|[[refin]]|[[ref]]}}
