===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|sa lupa ng mga bulag, ang naghahari ang pisak}}

===Etymology===
{{lit|in the land of the blind, the one-eyed reigns}}, a translation of {{calque|tl|es|notext=1|en tierra de los ciegos, el que tiene un ojo es rey}} and {{m|es|en el reino de los ciegos, el tuerto es el rey}}, a calque of {{der|tl|la|in regione caecorum rex est luscus}}.

===Pronunciation===
