===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*sabuʀ||to sow, scatter; scattered about; splash water on something}}, {{m|poz-pro|*saq(ə)buʀ||to strew, sow, sprinkle}}. Compare {{cog|ms|sabur}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|sabóg<a^>|+<n^>}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|sabóg|b=+}}

# [[scattered]] [[all around]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalat|nakakalat}}
# [[dispersed]] {{q|of light}}
#: {{syn|tl|kalat}}
# [[living]] in [[separate]] [[place]]s {{q|especially of family members}}
#: {{syn|tl|hiwa-hiwalay|layo-layo}}
# {{lb|tl|slang}} [[drugged]]; [[high]]; [[intoxicated]]; [[stoned]]
#: {{syn|tl|bangag|lango|nakadroga}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1988|title=National Mid-week
|passage=Pagkatapos magprito ng itlog at mag-init ng tubig ay ginising niya sina Marjorie  at Cynthia. Susuray-suray na bumaba ang dalawang Lata. &quot;Mommy, ba&#39;t ganyan  ang mata mo? '''Sabog''' ka ba?&quot; usisa ni Marjorie habang nagtitimpla ito ng gatas.}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=2014|author=Mina V. Esguerra; Jhing Bautista; Jonnalyn Cabigting; Leng de Chavez; Katherine C. Eustaquio-Derla; Rachelle Belaro; Rayne Mariano|title=Say That Things Change|publisher=Bright Girl Books
|passage=that Will guy, bigla kang naging, pano ba, safe? And then you end up  accomplishing nothing anymore. Sure, medyo '''sabog''' ka like all of us in marketing  but youhad that firein you. Engaged kamanohindi,dapat hindi mawala sayo yun.”  “Alam mo&nbsp;...}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2018|author=Dag Heward-Mills|title=Paano Ka Magiging Isang Matatag Na Kristiyano|publisher=Dag Heward-Mills|isbn=9781683986713
|passage=Ang sabi ng iba, “Hindi pa ako nakagamit ng droga at gusto kong malaman ano ang pakiramdam ng maging &#39;'''sabog'''&#39;”. Maaari mo lamang malaman kung ano ang  pakiramdam ng maging baliw!
|t=Others said, "I haven't used drugs and I wanted to know how it feels to be 'high'". You may only know how to feel insane.}}
# {{lb|tl|slang}} [[groggy]]; [[dazed]]; [[disoriented]] {{q|due to severe fatigue}}
#: {{syn|tl|bangag}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[explosion]]; [[loud]] [[burst]]
#: {{syn|tl|putok}}
# [[eruption]] {{q|of a volcano}}
#: {{syn|tl|putok}}
# [[scattering]] of [[thing]]s [[all around]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalat|pagkakalat}}
# [[planting]] of [[seed]]s by [[sow]]ing
#: {{syn|tl|hasik|paghahasik}}
