====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|salâ|b=+}}

# [[broken]] or [[dislocated]] {{q|of one's bones}}
#: {{syn|tl|bali|linsad|q2=dislocated}}

===Etymology 6===
{{bor+|tl|ar|صَلَاة}}. {{root|tl|ar|ص ل و}} Compare {{cog|mrw|salat}}, {{cog|tsg|salat}}, {{cog|id|salat}}, and {{cog|ms|solat}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|salá}}

