* {{cite-journal|en|title=The Spanish overlay in Tagalog|work=Lingua|year=1965|url=https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/0024384165900586|volume=14|issn=0024-3841|doi=10.1016/0024-3841(65)90058-6|last=Lopez|first=Cecilio|page=480}}
