Page 17170 salumpuwit: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|sa|lum|pu|wit}}
Page 17170 salumpuwit: Replaced {{tl-IPA|salumpuwít}} with {{tl-pr|salumpuwít}}
Page 17170 salumpuwit: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 17170 salumpuwit: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{compound|tl|salo|-m-|puwit|lit=support for the buttocks}}. According to Jose Villa Panganiban,<ref>{{cite-book|year=1970|title=The Case for Pilipino|pages=99|author=Apolinar B. Parale|location=Manila|publisher=MCS Enterprises, Inc.}}</ref> it was initially coined by a critic of {{w|Lope K. Santos}}, together with {{m|tl|salipawpaw}}, as an equivalent of the Spanish-derived {{m|tl|silya}} to ridicule his use and coinage of Tagalog words, however it is nowadays often mistakenly attributed to {{w|Lope K. Santos}}. Compare {{m|tl|salungso}} and {{m|tl|salungki}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|salumpuwít}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|salumpuwít|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|neologism|sometimes|_|humorous|or|literary}} [[chair]]; [[seat]]
#: {{syn|tl|silya|upuan|bangko}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=2007|author=Epifanio San Juan|title=Salud algabre, babaeng mandirigma: at iba pang bagong tula
|passage=Bumabanat pa rin napako sa '''salumpuwit''' ni Kuh Ledesma Kung saan iluluwal ang binabalangkas ng panata't pintuho Kahit nagiginaw di naligaw patungong lunggang panaginip}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=2021|author=Kael Luzon|title=Victims of Medusa
|passage=Halos nasa pinsan na yata lahat ng katangian ng isang perpektong asawang lalake, kaya imposibleng walang magkakagusto rito, kaya minsan ay nagtataka talaga siya kung bakit hindi pa ito nagkakaroon ng sariling pamilya. ''Agnes only gave him a hum'' bago lumapit at umupo sa isang '''salumpuwit''' bilang pagtalima.}}
# {{lb|tl|neologism|sometimes|_|humorous|or|literary}} [[anything]] used to [[support]] the [[buttocks]]

===References===
<references/>
: 2. {{cite-web|title=Salumpuwit|titleurl=https://www.tagaloglang.com/salumpuwit/|work=Tagalog Lang|date=August 27, 2018|accessdate=July 17, 2019}}.
: 3. {{cite-journal|author=Alfie Vera Mella|title=Salungso, Salungki, Salumpuwit, Salungtak, Salompas at iba pa|titleurl=https://filipinojournal.com/salungso-salungki-salumpuwit-salungtak-salompas-iba-pa/|journal=Filipino Journal|year=2016|volume=27|issue=24}}.

