===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|sanaol|naol||pronunciation spelling}}

===Etymology===
{{Taglish}}, from {{m|tl|sana||hopefully; I wish}} + {{der|tl|en|all}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|sana ol}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|[[sana]] {{l|en|all}}|b=sana ol}} {{tlb|tl|slang}}

# {{n-g|used to express hope that everyone, including the speaker, will experience the same as whatever is being talked about, usually in a joking manner, but sometimes in an envious manner}}: [[hopefully]] [[all]]; [[if only]] [[everybody]] [[could]] [[be]] [[like]] [[that]]
#: {{ux|tl|Namigay ang tanod ng ayuda sa barangay ninyo? '''Sana all'''.|The chief gave relief goods for your barangay? '''I wish we had it too'''.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Sanaol''' may ''boyfriend''.|'''If only everybody''' had a boyfriend.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://entertainment.inquirer.net/395179/model-in-park-seo-joon-telco-ad-catches-filipino-k-drama-fans-attention-sana-all|title=Model in Park Seo-joon telco ad catches Filipino K-drama fans’ attention: ‘Sana all’|date=2020-10-30|author=Ryan Arcadio|work=INQUIRER.net|text=Ang swerte naman ni Girl. '''Sana all'''.|t=The girl is so lucky. '''I wish everyone is'''.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/lifestyle/familyandrelationships/810055/sana-all-kiray-celis-receives-louis-vuitton-iphone-13-from-boyfriend-stephen-estopia/story/|title=Sana all: Kiray Celis receives Louis Vuitton, iPhone 13 from boyfriend Stephen Estopia|author=G. M. A. News|work=GMA News Online|date=2021-11-08|text=Niregaluhan ako ng jowa ko ng iPhone 13 Pro Max! '''Sana all'''?! Oh yes! '''Sana all'''!|t=My boyfriend gave me an iPhone 13 Pro Max! '''Wishing this is for all'''?! Oh yes! '''I wish everyone (would have one)'''!}}
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://www.rappler.com/nation/overseas-filipinos/earl-beran-teaching-thailand-after-struggling-find-work-philippines/|title=Teaching in Thailand after struggling to find work in the Philippines|date=2021-12-31|work=RAPPLER|text=Mapapa-’'''sana all'''’ ka sa lahat, di lang sa education sector. Di ko maiwasang isipin na, ‘E di sana kung may solid plans ‘yung mga nasa itaas, e di sana okay na din tayo.|t=It has you saying “'''I wish this was for all'''” in everything, not just for the education sector. I can’t help but think, “If only authorities had solid plans, then we would be okay too.”}}
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/1499100/emotional-pangilinan-feels-weight-of-call-of-duty-in-vp-run|title=Emotional Pangilinan feels weight of ‘call of duty’ in VP run|date=2021-10-08|author=Christia Marie Ramos|work=INQUIRER.net|text=Ang pangarap ko para sa bayan: '''Sana all''' may trabaho at maayos na kita. '''Sana all''' may sapat na pagkain sa mesa. '''Sana all''' may bakuna. '''Sana all''' ligtas sa sakit.|t=My dream for the country: '''I wish everyone''' has a job and a decent income. '''I wish everyone''' has enough food on the table. '''I wish everyone''' is vaccinated. '''I wish everyone''' is safe from illnesses.}}

{{cln|tl|catchphrases}}
