=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|manasa}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|sasâ<a^>|sasà<n^>}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|sasâ|b=+}}

# [[enjoying]] great [[abundance]]
#: {{syn|tl|sagana|masagana}}
# [[satiated]]; [[supplied]] with [[too much]]
#: {{syn|tl|sawa}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|sasà|b=+}}

# [[abundance]] {{q|of supplies, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|kasaganaan|pagkasagana}}
# [[feeling]] of having had [[too much]] of something
#: {{syn|tl|sawa|pagsasawa}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|pagpapasasa|kasasaan|magpasasa|masasaan|pasasa|pasasaan}}

