|passage=Nakakaramdam siya ng pagnanasa. Mas masidhi ang sumpong ng isang taong bitin o kulang sa sex. Lalo na kung kargado sa gamot o bumatak ng '''shabu'''. Tulad ngayong solong nagmumukmok ang kanyang laman.
|t=He has sexual desire toward her. The temperament of a person lacking in sex is more intense, especially when he is high on [illegal] drugs or he sniffed shabu, like right now, when his body is sulking solo.}}
#* '''2017''' July 11, Jamil Santos, [http://www.gmanetwork.com/news/news/ulatfilipino/617633/4-na-drug-suspect-na-nanlaban-daw-sa-mga-pulis-patay-sa-buy-bust-operation/story/ '"4 na drug suspect na nanlaban daw sa mga pulis, patay sa buy-bust operation"], GMA News
