Page 18151 siyam: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|siyám<audio:TL-PH-siyam.ogg>|si..yám<a:regional><audio:Tl-siyam.oga>|hmp=Siam}}
Page 18151 siyam: Skipped, no changes
Page 18151 siyam: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Etymology===
From Proto-Central Philippine ''*siyam'', from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*siam}}. Cognate with {{cog|ilo|siam}}, {{cog|pam|siam}}, {{cog|bcl|siyam}} and {{cog|ceb|siyam}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|siyám<audio:TL-PH-siyam.ogg>|si..yám<a:regional><audio:Tl-siyam.oga>|hmp=Siam}}

===Numeral===
{{tl-num|siyám|b=+}}

# [[nine]]
#: {{syn|tl|nuwebe}}

====Usage notes====
* To describe the quantity of something, the number is placed before the noun and affixed with a '''-ng''' when the word ends with a vowel, and a separate word '''[[na]]''' for a consonant.
*: '''''Isang''' saging, '''dalawang''' pinya''
*: '''''Apat na''' mansanas, '''anim na''' mangga''

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|siyaman|siyamin|siyamnaraan|siyamnapu|siyamnalibo|siyam-siyam|ikasiyam|makasiyam|tigsisiyam|pagsisiyam|labinsiyam|ikasiyamnapu|pansiyamnapu|pansiyam|ikalabinsiyam|panlabinsiyam|siyam-siyamin|siyam-siyaman|siyamnapu't anim|siyamnapu't apat|siyamnapu't dalawa|siyamnapu't isa|siyamnapu't lima|siyamnapu't pito|siyamnapu't siyam|siyamnapu't tatlo|siyamnapu't walo|abutin ng siyam-siyam}}

{{cln|tl|cardinal numbers}} 
{{C|tl|Nine}}

