===Etymology===
{{rdp|tl|siyam||nine}}. The sense {{m-g|monsoon rain}} from days of continuous rain, ranging around nine days, used to mark the beginning of the rainy season usually by the end of the month of May.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|siyám-siyám}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|[[siyám]]-[[siyám]]|b=+}}

# [[monsoon]] [[rain]] that usually [[last]]s for more than a [[week]]

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|[[siyám]]-[[siyám]]|b=+}}

# [[nine]] at a [[time]]

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

{{C|tl|Nine|Rain}}
