Page 18183 siyentista: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{pseudo-loan|tl|es|en:scientist}}, influenced by {{der|tl|es|-ista}}. Almario (2014)<ref>{{cite-book|year=2014|last=Almario|first=Virgilio S.|title=Masinop na Pagsulat|url=https://kwf.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/MMP_Full.pdf|publisher=Komisyon sa Wikang Filipino|accessdate=5 March 2022|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20220223061510/https://kwf.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/MMP_Full.pdf|archivedate=23 February 2022}}</ref> suggests that this word was coined in order to avoid the ambiguity of an adjective or a noun present in the word {{m|tl|siyentipiko}}, but the existence of other pseudo-Hispanisms such as {{m|tl|antropolohista}}, {{m|tl|biyolohista}}, and {{m|tl|sosyolohista}} makes this unlikely.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[scientist]]
#: {{syn|tl|siyentipiko|dalub-agham}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|tl|siyensiya}}

===References===
<references/>

{{C|tl|Occupations}}
