Page 18188 siyete: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|syete}}
* {{alt|tl|s'yete}}

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|es|siete}}, from {{der|tl|la|septem}}. The {{m-g|gossip}} sense may possibly be from the following:
* From {{ellipsis|tl|siyete pekados|nocap=1}}, {{glossary|gay slang}} meaning {{m-g|gossipmonger}}, from {{der|tl|es|siete pecados capitales||seven deadly sins}}.
* Some controversy in the 1980s involving {{w|Student Canteen}} under the {{w|GMA Network}}'s channel 7.

====Numeral====
{{tl-num|b=+}}

# [[seven]]
#: {{syn|tl|pito}}

=====Related terms=====
{{rel3|tl|alas-siyete|ikasiyete|beynte siyete|treynta y siyete|kuwarenta y siyete|singkuwenta y siyete|sesenta y siyete|setenta y siyete|otsenta y siyete|nobenta y siyete|disisiyete|setesiyentos|setenta|siyete kolores|Siyete Palabras|siyete pekados|siyete-mesino}}

=====See also=====
{{col3|tl|abrasiyete}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|slang}} [[gossip]]; [[idle]] [[talk]]
#: {{syn|tl|tsismis}}

===Etymology 2===
A {{glossary|minced oath}} of {{der|tl|en|shit}}.

====Interjection====
{{tl-head|interjection|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|colloquial|euphemistic}} {{n-g|used to express anger, irritation, disappointment, annoyance, contempt, surprise, etc.}}: [[damn]]!; [[shit]]!

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* [https://web.archive.org/web/20050510033936/http://klockworkx.com/copongcopong/?siyete “siyete” in ''Pinoy Slang Dictionary'', Copongcopong]
