Page 18295 subo: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|subò<n^>|subô<a^>}}
Page 18295 subo: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|su|bo}}
Page 18295 subo: Replaced {{tl-IPA|subó}} with {{tl-pr|subó}}
Page 18295 subo: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 18295 subo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*súbuq||put something into or through an opening}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|subo}}, {{cog|pam|subu}}, and {{cog|bcl|subo}}. Alternatively, from {{bor|tl|nan-hbl|嘴末|tr=chhùi-boa̍h}} according to Manuel (1948).

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|subò<n^>|subô<a^>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|subò|b=+}}

# [[amount]] of [[food]] taken into the [[mouth]] at a time; [[bite]]; [[mouthful]]
# [[putting]] of [[food]] into one's [[mouth]]
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[reluctant]] [[involvement]] {{q|into an affair or act of responsibility}}
#: {{syn|tl|pagsubo|pagkapasubo|lulong|paglulong|pagkapalulong}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|sansubo| isubo|magsubo|sumubo|mapasubo|subuan|pagsusubo}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|sakol}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|subô|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[inserted]] too [[deep]]
#: {{syn|tl|pasok}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[daring]]ly [[bold]]
#: {{syn|tl|pangahas|sagasa}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*səbuh}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*səbuS||douse a fire, extinguish a fire with water; to hiss, as water on fire}}. Compare {{cog|ivb|asbo}}, {{cog|ilo|subbo}}, {{cog|pam|asbu}}, {{cog|bcl|sabo}} / {{m|bcl|subo}}, {{cog|akl|suebo}}, {{cog|ceb|subo}}, {{cog|hil|subo}}, {{cog|mrw|sebo}}, and {{cog|ms|sebu}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|subó}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|subó|b=+}}

# [[seething]] {{q|of boiling water or liquid}}
#: {{syn|tl|sulak|pagsulak}}
# [[tempering]] of [[metal]] {{q|by immersing in water after heating it red}}
#: {{syn|tl|pagsusubo|pagkasubo}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[violent]] [[agitation]]; [[sudden]] [[fit]] of [[anger]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|pagkasubo|isubo|magsubo|pagsusubo|subuhan|subhan|pagsubo}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:KWF Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|súbuq}}
* {{R:map:ACD|sebuS}}
* {{R:tl:Manuel 1948|q=Subò.|page=86}}
-------- end text --------
