* {{alt|tl|suca||obsolete|Abecedario}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*suka||to vomit}}. Compare {{cog|bcl|suka}}, {{cog|ceb|suka}}, {{cog|hil|suka}}, {{cog|pam|suka}}, {{cog|tsg|suka}}, and {{cog|war|suka}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[vomit]]
#: {{syn|tl|duwal|lungad|alibukay|q3=obsolete}}
# [[vomiting]]; [[emesis]]
#: {{syn|tl|duwal|alibukay|q2=obsolete}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|isuka|masuka|magsuka|sumuka|makapagpasuka|makasuka|mapasuka|nakakasuka|napapasuka|pagsuka|pagsusuka|pampasuka}}

