* {{l|tl|lungad}}

===Etymology 2===
Ultimately from {{der|tl|sa|चुक्र||tamarind tree; vinegar made by acetous fermentation}}, possibly through {{bor|tl|ms|cuka||soured wine, vinegar}}. Cognate with {{cog|bcl|suka}}, {{cog|ceb|suka}}, {{cog|ilo|suka}}, {{cog|mrw|soka'}}, {{cog|pag|tuka}}, and {{cog|tsg|suka'}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|sukà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|sukà|b=+}}

