Page 18407 Sulu: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|Joló|alt=Sulu/Sulú}}, from {{der|tl|tsg|Sulug|t=Sulu}}, an older form of {{m|tsg|Sūg|t=Sulu}}, possibly from {{der|tl|tsg|sulug}}, an older form of {{m|tsg|sūg||current}}.<ref>{{cite-book|last=Saleeby|first=Najeeb M.|title=The History of Sulu|url=https://www.gutenberg.org/files/41771/41771-h/41771-h.htm|year=1908|page=133}}</ref><ref>{{cite-web|last=Dino|first=Nelson S.|title=In Situ, You Are Sug!|url=https://www.layagsug.com/home/category/suluktausug|work=Layag Sug|date=May 17, 2017|accessdate=6 March 2022|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20220305092720/https://www.layagsug.com/home/category/suluktausug|archivedate=5 March 2022}}</ref> Compare {{cog|mrw|Solog}}, {{cog|ms|Suluk}}, {{cog|nan-hbl|蘇祿|tr=So͘-lo̍k}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|Sulú}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|Sulú|b=+}}

# {{q|lalawigan/probinsiya ng ~}} {{place|tl|province|c/Philippines|t=Sulu}}
# {{place|tl|archipelago|c/Philippines|t={{w|Sulu Archipelago}}}}
# {{lb|tl|historical}} {{w|Sultanate of Sulu}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|tl|Jolo}}

===References===
<references/>
-------- end text --------
