Page 18564 suso: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*susu}} (compare with {{cog|ms|susu}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*susu}}. See {{cog|fj|sucu}}, {{cog|to|huhu}} and {{cog|haw|ū}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|anatomy}} [[breast]]
#: {{syn|tl|dibdib|dede|q2=colloquial|joga|q3=gay slang}}
# [[suckling]] from the [[breast]]; [[nursing]]; [[breastfeeding]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagsuso|pagpapasuso|pag-ut-ot}}
# {{lb|tl|anatomy}} [[nipple]]; [[teat]]; [[udder]]
#: {{syn|tl|utong}}
# any of the [[four]] [[projection]]s at the [[bottom]] [[corner]]s {{q|of a sack, basket, etc.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|susong-kabayo|susong-kalabaw|susuhan|sumuso|susuhin|pasusuhin|magpasuso|susong-damulag|pagpapasuso|kaagaw-suso}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*susuq}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|soso}}, {{cog|ceb|suso}}, {{cog|war|suso}}, {{cog|kaw|susuh}}, and {{cog|ban|susuh}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|susô}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|susô|b=+}}

# [[snail]] {{q|especially river snails with a cornucopia-like shell}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|golden suso|susong-kati|susong-dagat|susong-ilog|susong-tubig|susong-papan}}

=====See also=====
{{col3|tl|kuhol|bisukol|bitoo}}

===Etymology 3===
Possibly from {{der|tl|zh}}. Compare {{cog|nan-hbl|唆使|tr=so-sú||incitation; instigation}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[setting]] on [[fire]] {{q|especially of fireworks}}
#: {{syn|tl|sindi|pagsisindi}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[instigation]]
#: {{syn|tl|sulsol|pagsusulsol|apoyo|pag-apoyo}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magsuso|susuhan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|susu1}}
* {{R:map:ACD|susuq}}

