Page 18609 suyod: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|+<n^>|suyód<a^>}}
Page 18609 suyod: Skipped, no changes
Page 18609 suyod: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|soyor||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|suyor||dialectal|Rizal|informal}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|tl|poz-pro|*sujud||fine-toothed lice comb}}, possibly borrowed via an intermediary language or existed as ''*sulod'' with elision of {{IPAchar|/l/}} becoming {{IPAchar|/j/}} instead of {{IPAchar|/w/}} or {{IPAchar|/ʔ/}}. Compare {{cog|bcl|surod}} and {{cog|duo|surod}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<n^>|suyód<a^>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[fine]]-[[toothed]] [[comb]] for [[remove|removing]] [[lice]] and [[nit]]s
# [[catching]] of [[lice]] using such a [[comb]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagsusuyod}}
# {{lb|tl|agriculture}} [[harrow]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalaykay|kalmot}}
# {{lb|tl|agriculture}} [[harrowing]] of a [[plowed]] or [[cultivated]] [[field]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagsuyod|pagsusuyod}}
# {{lb|tl|sewing}} [[shuttle]]
#: {{syn|tl|lansadera}}
# [[currycomb]] {{q|for horses, cattle, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|almohasa}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[combing]] of a [[place]] {{q|to search for something}}
#: {{syn|tl|saliksik|pagsaliksik|pagsasaliksik}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magsuyod|pagsuyod|suyurin|sinuyod|panuyod|pagsusuyod|masuyod}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|kalmot}}
* {{l|tl|suklay}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|suyód|b=+}}

# [[already]] [[harrowed]] {{q|of a cultivated field}}
#: {{syn|tl|nasuyod}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[thoroughly]] [[combed]] or [[searched]] {{q|of a place}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|sujud}}
