===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*taqan}}, {{m|poz-pro|*taqən}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*taqan|t=to set a trap; to set a snare}}. Compare {{cog|ceb|taon}} and {{cog|ms|tahan}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|ta7án,ta7an}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|taán|head2=+|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|fishing}}

