Page 18687 tadhana: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|tadhanà|tadhanâ<qq:obsolete>}}
Page 18687 tadhana: Skipped, no changes
Page 18687 tadhana: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|tarhana|taghana||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{der|tl|sa|-}}, possibly from either:
* From {{cog|sa|साधन||leading straight to a goal; bringing about, carrying out; acquisition; preparation}}
* From {{cog|sa|सन्धान||bond; union; alliance; preparation}}
* From {{cog|sa|विधान||rule, regulation; fate, accomplishment}}.
Compare {{cog|ilo|sagana}}, {{cog|pam|tagana}}, {{cog|ceb|tagana}}, {{cog|hil|tigana}}, {{cog|war|tagana}}, and {{cog|tsg|tagama}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|tadhanà|tadhanâ<qq:obsolete>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|tadhanà|b=+}}

# [[fate]]; [[destiny]]
#: {{syn|tl|kapalaran|suwerte|destino|kalma}}
# [[provision]]; [[stipulation]]; [[term]] {{q|of an agreement, contract, ordinance, law, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|takda|probisyon|kondisyon}}
# [[determined]] and [[fixed]] [[time]] {{q|for payment of debts, completion of an obligation, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|taning|takda}}
# [[nature]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalikasan}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[assignment]]; [[destining]]
#: {{syn|tl|talaga|takda|laan|destino}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[warning]]; [[sign]]; [[advise]]
#: {{syn|tl|bala|babala}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[secret]] about a [[negotiation]] or [[affair]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[act]] of [[prepare|preparing]] something in [[secret]] for a [[purpose]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[arrangement]] of [[two]] [[people]] in [[accordance]] to their [[wish]]es

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magtadhana|itadhana|pagtatadhana|tadhanaan|biro ng tadhana|tumadhana|magtatadhana|magtadhanaan|ipagtadhana|matadhana}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|sadya|katalagahan}}

