* {{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=298}}
* {{cite-book|es|author=Trinidad Hermenegildo Pardo de Tavera|title=El sanscrito en la lengua tagalog|year=1887|publisher=Imprimerie de la Faculté de Médecine, A. Davy|location=Paris|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=JYdBAAAAYAAJ&newbks=0|page=52}}
