* {{alt|tl|taguictic||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*tiktik||to tap, strike lightly}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*tiktik||to tap, strike lightly}} (cf. {{cog|ceb|tiktik||to tap lightly}}, {{cog|id|titek||heavy pounding blow; to rap}}, {{cog|ilo|tiktik||sound of striking metal against stone}}. See also {{m|tl|tiktik}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|tagiktík}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|tagiktík|b=+}}

# [[patter]]; [[light]] but [[sharp]] [[sound]] caused by [[consecutive]] [[drop]]s {{q|especially on a hard surface}}
# [[ticking]] of a [[clock]], [[watch]], etc.
#: {{syn|tl|tiktik|tiktak}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|tl|tumagiktik}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|tagaktak|tagistis|lagitikan|patak-patak}}

