{{tl-pr|tagilíd<a^>|+<n^>}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|tagilíd|b=+}}

# with the [[body]] [[turned]] to a [[side]] {{q|of a person lying down}}
# [[tilted]] [[sideways]]; [[crooked]]
#: {{syn|tl|hilig|nakahilig|kiling|nakakiling|tagibang|tawisi}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} in [[danger]] of; on the [[verge]] of {{gl|defeat, bankruptcy, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|namemeligro}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magtagilid|itagilid|pagtagilid|tumagilid|tagiliran}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[tilt]]; [[slant]]; [[inclined]] [[position]]
#: {{syn|tl|hilig|kiling}}
# [[act]] of [[turn]]ing one's [[body]] to a [[side]] {{q|of a person lying down}}
# [[act]] of [[lean]]ing or [[incline|inclining]] one's [[position]] while [[standing]]
#: {{syn|tl|hilig|paghilig|kiling|pagkiling}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|gílij|ta-gílij}}
