====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+,tahán<n,int^>|tahán<a^>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|+|head2=tahán|b=+}}

# [[stopping]] from [[cry]]ing
# {{lb|tl|loosely}} [[stopping]]; [[ceasing]] {{q|of rain, running, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|hinto|tigil|humpay|tugot|likat|paghinto|pagtigil|paghumpay|pagtugot|paglikat}}
