# not [[moving]]; [[resting]]; [[at rest]]
#: {{syn|tl|tigil|nakatigil|hinto|nakahinto}}
# not [[working]]; [[resting]]
#: {{syn|tl|namamahinga|nagpapahinga}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*tahan|t=abode, place of residence}}, from a {{metathesis|tl|}} of {{inh|tl|map-pro|*taNaS|t= village; place of residence}}.<ref>{{R:map:ACD|taNaS}}</ref>

