[[File:Tambiolo.jpg|thumb|right|A traditional tambiolo, used for playing [[jueteng]]]]
[[File:Lottery drum (tambiolo).jpg|thumb|right|A slightly more modern tambiolo, seen here full of [[raffle]] [[ticket]]s]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|tambyolo||nonstandard}}
* {{alt|tl|tambola}}

===Etymology===
{{glossary|Borrowed}} from {{w|Philippine Spanish|Philippine}} {{bor|tl|es|tambiolo}}, possibly via {{suffix|es|tómbola|-olo|lang2=it|nocat=1}}. {{cog|es|tómbola}} itself is from {{der|tl|it|tombola}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|gambling}}

# [[tambiolo]]; [[revolving]] [[lottery]] [[drum]] where [[numbered]] [[ticket]]s or [[ball]]s are [[placed]] and [[drawn]] to [[get]] the [[winning]] [[number]]s
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2000|author=Rey Edrozo De la Cruz; Mag Cruz Hatol|title=Tatlong manyika hanggang sa Pulburon|isbn=9789719223405|publisher=University of Michigan|page=180
|passage=Bago ang lahat, Isang, pakiikot mo ang '''tambiyolo''' at bumunot ka ng numero ng tiket.|t=Before anything else, first, spin the '''tambiolo''' and pull out one of the numbered tickets.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2014|author=Rei Lemuel Crizaldo|title=Boring ba ang Bible mo?|isbn=9789719223405|location=Mandaluyong|publisher=OMF Literature|page=37
|passage=Pero para sa mga normal na tao, walang kasing pait ang magpalakad-lakad sa kadiliman at tumaya sa '''tambiyolo''' ng buhay hoping na may mapuntahan at magpapatuloy sa iyo na kaibigan.|t=But for normal people, it's not as easy as walking around in the dark and betting your life on a spin of a '''tambiolo''' hoping that your friends will be there to come to your aid.}}
#* {{quote-journal|tl|date=17 January 2018|author=Jamil Santos|journal=GMA News Online
|passage=[https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/balitambayan/talakayan/640071/mag-asawa-na-hikahos-noon-naging-milyonaryo-dahil-sa-tambiyolo/story/ Mag-asawa na hikahos noon, naging milyonaryo dahil sa '''tambiyolo''']
|translation=They were poor when they married, but now are millionaires due to '''tambiolos'''}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|ruleta|loto|huweteng|binggo|loteriya|wahoy}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
-------- end text --------
