Page 19155 tanga: Already saw {{tl-pr}}, skipping: {{tl-pr|+|tangà<qq:obsolete>}}
Page 19155 tanga: Skipped, no changes
Page 19155 tanga: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*taŋa|gloss=to gape stupidly; to gawk}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*taŋa|gloss=to open wide}}.<ref>{{R:map:ACD|taŋa1|taŋa|id=10479}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|tangá}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|tangá|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|offensive}} [[stupid]]; [[foolish]]; [[ignorant]]; [[slow-witted]]
#: {{syn|tl|gunggong|tunggak|bangag|ungas|hangal|mangmang|maang|manga|uslak|banggak|tunggak|ungag|libsang|binsa|supak}}
#: {{ux|tl|Mukha kang '''tanga!'''|You look '''stupid'''!}}
# {{lb|tl|offensive}} [[uneducated]]
#: {{syn|tl|walang-pinag-aralan}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|tumanga-tanga|tumanga|mapatanga|napakatanga|pagkatanga|nakatanga|may-pagkatanga|matanga|katangahan|shunga|tangengot|tange}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|tangá|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|offensive}} [[idiot]]; [[stupid]] [[person]]; [[fool]]
#: {{ux|tl|Hoy, '''tanga'''!|Hey, '''fool'''!}}
# [[act]] of [[gaze|gazing]] [[absentminded]]ly {{q|at something}}
#: {{syn|tl|pagtanga}}
# {{lb|tl|by extension}} [[act]] of [[waste|wasting]] one's [[time]] by [[gaze|gazing]] [[absentminded]]ly {{q|at something}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|tl|nan-hbl|蟲仔|tr=thâng-á||little vermin; insect; bug}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Chan-Yap 1980|page=134}}</ref> Compare {{cog|bcl|tanga}} and {{cog|ceb|tanga}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|tangà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|tangà|b=+}}

# [[clothes moth]]
# [[potato worm]]; [[weevil]] {{gl|the presence of which is with a certain peculiar taste or odor}}
# [[bookworm]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|tangain|matanga}}

=====Related terms=====
{{rel3|tl|simutsang}}

===Etymology 3===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|tangà}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|tangà|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[ancient]] [[prohibition]] with [[penalty]] [[clause]]
# [[act]] of [[make|making]] and [[fulfill]]ing a [[promise]]
# [[payment]] [[agreement]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magtanga|pagtangaan|ipagtanga|tumanga|tangaan|itanga}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|kabawalan}}

===Etymology 4===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+|tangà<qq:obsolete>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[act]] of [[extend]]ing the [[neck]] to [[see]] something

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|tumanga|tangahin|itanga|tangahan}}

===References===
<references/>

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:tl:Pinoy Dictionary}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613}}
** page 64: {{m-g|Apolillarſe) Tang̃a (pp) las palmas}}
** page 311: {{m-g|Eſtender) Tang̃a [(pp)] el cuello para ver algo q̃ no al cança auer}}
** page 488: {{m-g|Polilla) Tang̃a (pp) dela ropa}}
** page 595: {{m-g|Vedar) Tang̃a (pp) mandando noſe haga tal o tal cosa}}

