Page 19164 tanggap: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|tang|gap}}
Page 19164 tanggap: Replaced {{tl-IPA|tanggáp}} with {{tl-pr|tanggáp}}
Page 19164 tanggap: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 19164 tanggap: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Either {{inh+|tl|poz-pro|*taŋgap||accept|nocap=1}} or {{bor+|tl|ms|tangkap|nocap=1||gripping; clasping; capture by the hand}}, from {{der|tl|poz-pro|*taŋkəp|t=catch, as by covering}}. The two etymology sources may be equivalent. Compare {{cog|pam|tanggap||accept}}, {{cog|mrw|tangkap||accept}}, and {{cog|ban|tanggap||take into hand}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|tanggáp}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|tanggáp|b=+}}

# [[admitted]] {{q|of one's guilt, crime, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|inamin}}
# [[accepted]]; [[recognized]]; [[admitted]]
#: {{syn|tl|kinilala}}
# [[received]]
#: {{syn|tl|tinanggap}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|tanggapin|tumanggap|di-matatanggap|di-pagtanggap|di-pagkatanggap|pagtanggap|mananggap|matanggap|pagkatanggap|pananggapan|punong tanggapan|tanggapan}}

====See also====
* {{l|tl|tangan}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|tanggáp|b=+}}

# [[acceptance]] of something [[offered]] or [[given]]
#: {{syn|tl|aseptasyon}}
# [[reception]] of something [[sent]] {{q|by letter, text message, etc.}}
# [[admission]]; [[confession]] {{q|of one's guilt, crime, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|pag-amin|pagtanggap}}
# [[admission]]; [[approval]] {{q|of one's application for employment, enrollment, etc.}}
# [[recognition]]; [[acceptance]] {{q|as of evidence or testimony in court}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
-------- end text --------
