From {{der|tl|nan-hbl|燈樓|tr=teng-lâu||[[lampstand]]; [[lighthouse]]}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Chan-Yap 1980|page=132}}.</ref><ref>{{cite-journal|year=1977|last=Chan-Yap|first=Gloria|editors=Casilda Edrial-Luzares & Austin Hale|title=Hokkien Chinese loanwords in Tagalog|journal=Studies in Philippine Linguistics|url=https://www.sil.org/system/files/reapdata/10/23/25/102325434532460686121798952145796593575/SIPL_1_1_017_049.pdf|format=PDF|volume=1|issue=1|publisher=Ateneo de Manila University|page=21}}.</ref><ref>{{cite-web|year=1932|title=台日大辭典(台譯版)|work=台語辭典(台日大辭典台語譯本)查詢2019|url=https://taigi.fhl.net/dict/index.html|section=編號: 58878|sectionurl=https://taigi.fhl.net/dict/search.php?DETAIL=1&LIMIT=id=58878&dbname=dica&graph=2|page=301|pageurl=https://taigi.fhl.net/dict/gm.php?fn=B/B0347.png}}</ref><ref>{{cite-web|year=2016+|title=iTaigi 愛台語|work=iTaigi華台對照典|url=https://itaigi.tw/|section=燈樓|sectionurl=https://itaigi.tw/k/%E7%87%88%E6%A8%93|accessdate=14 February 2022|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20181018065702/http://itaigi.tw/|archivedate=18 October 2018}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|tangláw}}

===Noun===
