Page 19207 taon: Skipped, no changes
Page 19207 taon: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|ta7ón}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*taqun}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|tawen}}, {{cog|agn|takon}}, {{cog|mrw|tahon}} / {{m|mrw|ta'on}}, {{cog|tsg|tahun}}, {{cog|ms|tahun}}, {{cog|mg|taona}}, {{cog|mi|tau}}, and {{cog|haw|kau||season}}. See also {{cog|map-pro|*CawiN||year}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|taón|b=+}}

# [[year]]
#: {{syn|tl|anyo}}
# [[chance]] [[happening]]; [[coincidence]] {{gl|especially in {{m|tl|mataon}} and {{m|tl|kataon}}}}
#: {{syn|tl|koinsidensiya}}
# [[act]] of doing something to [[coincide]] with another
#: {{syn|tl|pagtataon|tiyap}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} act of being a [[go-between]] for [[admit]]ting [[guest]]s in one's [[house]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[catching]] [[in the act]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[encounter]] of [[two]] [[people]] at some place {{q|especially [[by chance]]}}
#: {{syn|tl|salubong|tiyap}}
#: {{ux|tl|Dili kita '''nagtaon''' niyong kamakailan.|The two of us did not '''come across each other''' recently.}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[finding]] someone being [[look for|looked for]] [[by chance]]
#: {{ux|tl|Saan mo '''nataunan''' siya? '''Nataunan''' ko sa bahay niya.|Where '''did''' you happen to '''find''' him? I '''found''' him at his home.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|makataon|itaon|taunin|kataon|pagkakataon|magkataon|mapataon|mataon|mataunan|nagkataon|sa ibang pagkakataon|sa isang pagkakataon|tumaon|taon-taon|taunan|taong pares|taong bisyesto|santaunan|dantaon|santaon|sasantaunin|makasantaon|taong piskal|taong panuusan|noong taon|pagkasantaon|guning taon|Manaon|Bagong Taon|Bisperas ng Bagong Taon|Manigong Bagong Taon|libuntaon|pultaon|taon-taunin|taong panuruan|Bagong Taon ng mga Tsino|Bagong Taong Tsino|magpataon|pagtaunan|pagtaunin|magtaon`|Isang Daang Taong Digmaan}}

=====Related terms=====
{{rel3|tl|panahon}}

===Etymology 2===
{{rfe|tl|No etymology found so far. Perhaps a euphemistic semantic shift from Etymology 1, from "chance happening" > "convulsion"?}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|taón|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|pathology}}

# (attack of) [[convulsion]] {{q|especially in children and infants}}
#: {{syn|tl|taol|kombulsiyon|pangingisay|pagkisay}}
# [[infantile]] [[beriberi]]

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alt|tl|taun}}

===Further reading===
