#: {{syn|tl|tasasyon}}
# [[act]] of [[limit]]ing to the [[minimum]] {{q|as of expenses, supplies, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|tipid|pagtitipid}}
# [[act]] of [[dieting]]; [[self-control]] in [[eating]]
#: {{syn|tl|diyeta|pagdidiyeta|pagtatasa}}
# [[act]] of [[fixing]] the [[price]] of something
#: {{syn|tl|paghahalaga}}
