===Etymology===
From a {{blend|tl|time-out|lang1=en|first|lang2=en|nocap=1}}, used to call a timeout.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[time-out]]; [[time]] [[freeze]]
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} act of [[call]]ing a [[time-out]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magtaympers|itaympers|mataympers|nakataympers}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[time-out]]!
#: {{ux|tl|'''Taympers''' muna!|Let's have a '''time-out''' first!}}
