# [[feature]]s; [[physical]] [[appearance]]; [[shape]]; [[form]]
#: {{syn|tl|anyo|hugis|itsura}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The word can be used to elaborate a situation.
*: {{ux|tl|Gusto ko ng kasama, yung '''tipong''' sasamahan ka kahit may problema.|I like a partner, a '''type''' where he/she will abide by you despite problems.}} 

