#: {{syn|tl|banat|atake|batikos|tuligsa|bugbog|gulpi|bira|buntal|bambu}}
# {{lb|tl|by extension|vulgar}} to have [[sexual intercourse]]

=====Usage notes=====
* Sense 4 is very inappropriate, possibly even on colloquial conversations, but not necessarily derogatory. It is usually censored through replacement with the filler {{m|tl|ano}}, as in ''makipag-ano kay'' instead of ''tirahin si''.

