===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|tiric||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*tə(n)dək}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|teddek||post; pillar; column; headman; chief}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<n^>|tirík<a^>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# act of [[building]], [[erecting]], or [[constructing]]
#: {{syn|tl|tayo|pagtatayo|gawa|paggawa|tindig|pagtitindig}}
# [[act]] of [[set up|setting up]] {{q|as of a post}}
#: {{syn|tl|tayo|pagtatayo}}
# [[act]] of [[light up|lighting up]] a [[candle]]
# [[position]] of one's [[pupil]]s [[directed]] [[upward]] {{q|as when one's death throes}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[stalling]] {{q|of a vehicle}}
# [[condition]] of being [[erect]] {{q|of a penis}}
#: {{syn|tl|tayo|pagtayo|tigas|paninigas|tingaro|pagtingaro}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|magtirik|pagtirikan|tumirik|nakatirik|itirik|matirik|pagtirik|pagtitirik|patirik|magpatirik|patirikin|tirikan|tirikan ng kandila}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|tirík|b=+}}

# [[set]] [[upright]]; [[set]] in an [[erect]] or [[straight]] [[position]]
#: {{syn|tl|patayo|nakatayo|nakatindig|patindig}}
# [[frequently]] [[stalling]] on the [[road]] {{q|of a vehicle}}
# with one's [[eye]]s looking [[upward]]

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
