Page 20032 tubig: Skipped, no changes
Page 20032 tubig: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From Proto-Central Philippine ''*tubig'', from Proto-Greater Central Philippine ''*tubig'' (cf. {{cog|bno|tubi}}, {{cog|ubl|tobig}}, {{cog|cps|tubi}}, {{cog|ilo|tubbog}}, and {{cog|msk|tobig}}). Dempwolff (1938) posited it to be from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*tubiʀ||deep place in the water}} (cf. {{cog|ms|tubir||ledge, steep riverbank, cliff}}) but the meaning in Central Philippine languages is consistently "water" or "juice", and no forms have been found to bridge the semantic gap with the Malay term, making the etymology unlikely.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+,tubeg<n^><q:colloquial>|tubíg,tubég<a^><q:colloquial>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[water]]
#: {{syn|tl|agwa|borbeg|q2=gay slang}}
# [[body]] of [[open]] [[water]] {{q|as opposed to land}}
#: {{ant|tl|katihan}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|bulutong-tubig|itubig|magpatubig|magtubig|magtubig-tubig|manubig|matubig|matubigan|magkatubig|pampatubig|pantubig|pantubigan|papagtubigin|patubig|patubigan|tubig-alat|tubig-dagat|tubigan|tubig-tabang|tubig-ulan|walang-tubig|tubig-baha|tubig-gripo|takaw-tubig|kutong-tubig|anyong-tubig|takot sa tubig|tubig-inumin|tubigbilos|bulantubig|mas matimbang ang dugo kaysa tubig|tubig-ilog|lamang-tubig}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|bor=1|alj|tubig}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|tubog}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|tubíg|b=+}}

# [[watery]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|tubig-tubig|matubig-tubig}}

===Etymology 2===
{{rfe|tl}}

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|tubíg}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|tubíg|b=+}}

# [[talkative]] and [[dishonest]] {{q|of a person}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:map:ACD|type=n|deep place in water}}

