===Etymology===
According to del Rosario (1969), the word is from {{cog|tl-old|-}}; but it is not found in Fr. San Buena Ventura's ''Vocabulario de lengua tagala'' (1613). Compare {{noncog|ilo|ummong||to gather}} and {{cog|ibl|olnong||gathering in one place; meetings to decide on changes to the law}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|ulnóng}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|ulnóng|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|neologism}} [[society]] {{gl|social order}}

