===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*qulu}} (cf. {{cog|ceb|ulo}}, {{cog|ch|ulu}}, {{cog|ilo|ulo}}, {{cog|jv|ꦲꦸꦭꦸ}}, {{cog|ms|hulu||head, handle}}, {{cog|mi|uru||head, hair}}, {{cog|tsg|ū}}, {{cog|tet|uluk||formerly, before}}, {{cog|tiy|ulew}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*quluh}} (cf. {{cog|pwn|qulu}}). {{doublet|tl|hulo}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+<n^>|uló<a^>}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|anatomy}} [[head]] {{gl|part of the body containing the brain}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[brains]]; [[talent]]; [[intelligence]]
#: {{syn|tl|utak|talino|dunong|alam}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[mind]]; [[thought]]s
#: {{syn|tl|utak}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[common sense]]
#: {{syn|tl|sentido komun|likas na pagkukuro|karaniwang pagkukuro|magmag|q4=obsolete}}
#: {{ux|tl|Gamitin mo nga ang '''ulo''' mo!|Use your '''common sense''', man!}}
# [[chief]]; [[boss]]; [[head]] {{q|of an group, office, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|puno|pinuno|lider|hepe}}
# [[head]]; [[unit]] [[number]] {{q|used in counting herd}}
#: {{syn|tl|bilang|dami}}
# [[principal]] [[part]]; either of the [[two]] [[end]]s {{q|of a table}}
#: {{syn|tl|kabesera}}
# [[heading]]; [[title]] {{q|of a story, news, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|pamagat|titulo|kapsiyon|ulong pambungad}}
# [[top]]; [[summit]] {{q|of a mountain, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|tuktok|tugatog|taluktok}}
# [[front]] or [[principal]] [[part]] or [[position]]; [[head]] {{q|of a column, squad, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|unahan|harapan|bukana}}
# [[dead]] or [[living]] [[body]] {{q|of a wanted criminal}}
#: {{syn|tl|buhay|katawan|bangkay}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sinumang makahahanap sa '''ulo''' ng kriminal ay tatanggap ng ₱2,000.|Whoever finds the criminal's '''body''' will receive ₱2,000.}}
# [[bulb]]; [[head]] {{q|of garlic, onion, etc.}}
# [[part]] of a [[plant]] that [[resemble]]s a [[head]] {{q|of cabbages, and other vegetables and the like}}
# [[top]]; [[tip]] {{q|of a thing}}
#: {{syn|tl|dulo|tuktok}}
## [[head]] or [[top]] used for [[strike|striking]] other [[object]]s {{q|of a hammer, axe, etc.}}
## [[head]] or [[top]] for [[strike|striking]], [[hold]]ing, or [[push]]ing {{q|of a pin, nail, etc.}}
## [[projecting]] [[part]] of an [[object]] {{q|of an arrow, egg, etc.}}
##: {{syn|tl|tingi}}
## [[head]] of a [[boil]], [[abscess]], [[acne]], etc. {{gl|where pus accumulates}}
##: {{syn|tl|mata}}
# [[headboard]]; [[top]] [[side]] {{q|of a bed}}
#: {{syn|tl|ulunan}}
# [[beginning]]; [[start]]
#: {{syn|tl|simula|umpisa}}
# [[topic]]; [[subject]] {{q|of one's speech, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|paksa}}
# [[source]]; [[origin]]
#: {{syn|tl|mula|pinagmulan|pinanggalingan}}
#: {{ux|tl|sa '''ulo''' ng mga nagbabagang balita|at the '''source''' of breaking news}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[cause]]
#: {{syn|tl|sanhi|dahilan}}
# [[highest]] [[distinction]] of [[honor]] {{q|as in a class}}
# {{n-g|used with {{m|tl|ng}} to express the superlative degree}}: [[most]]; [[best]]; [[-est]]
#: {{ux|tl|Siya ang '''ulo''' ng yaman sa aming bayan.|He is the rich'''est''' in our town.}}
#: {{syn|tl|sakdal|ubod|saksakan}}
# {{lb|tl|slang}} [[glans penis]]
#: {{syn|tl|burat}}
# {{lb|tl|board games}} [[main]] [[hole]] of a [[congkak]] [[board]]

