{{bor+|tl|en|w}}. Each pronunciation has a different source:
* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der|tl|en|w}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m|tl|{{tl-bay sc|wa}}}}.

Formerly, the letter {{m|tl|u}} was used to represent {{IPAchar|/w/}} in the Spanish-based orthography.

