Page 20764 wahoy: Removing explicit syllabification same as auto-syllabification: {{hyph|tl|wa|hoy}}
Page 20764 wahoy: Replaced {{tl-IPA}} with {{tl-pr}}
Page 20764 wahoy: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 20764 wahoy: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|wahuy}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|nan-hbl|-}}, specifically {{bor|tl|nan-zha|花會|tr=hoa-hōe}} as per Douglas (1873/1899).<ref>{{R:nan:Douglas|hoe-hē|124}}</ref><ref>{{R:nan:Douglas|hoe-hē (C. hoa-hōe)|147}}</ref><br>
The [[gambling]] [[game]] traces back to [[China]] where it is known more popularly and historically as [[花會]] and has been played since Early {{w|Ming Dynasty}} to Late {{w|Qing Dynasty}} times starting in Coastal China, specifically in [[Fujian]], [[Guangdong]], [[Guangxi]], [[Shanghai]], [[Zhejiang]], [[Jiangsu]], [[Tianjin]], [[Beijing]], and spreading across Inland [[China]] and [[abroad]] and finally banned last in [[China]] since 1949.<ref>{{cite-web|date=January 8, 2018|title=清末明初的另類彩票——打花會|trans-title=An Alternative Lottery Ticket in the Early Ming Dynasty and Late Qing Dynasty - To Play [[花會]]|work=每日頭條|trans-work=KK News Daily Headlines|url=https://kknews.cc/history/xvbbyyo.html}}</ref> {{w|Jueteng}} has been made [[illegal]] in the [[Philippines]] in 1907 under {{w|History of the Philippines (1898–1946)|American rule}}. In the 21st century, it is still played illegally [[in secret]] in [[China]] and the [[Philippines]] under the {{w|informal economy}} of both countries, but government-run lotteries are used to regulate and compete against the illegal private practice.<br>
Compare {{cog|tsg|wahuy}}. See also {{m|tl|huweteng}} with {{ncog|nan-qua|花當|tr=hoe-tǹg}} and {{ncog|nan-xia|花會|tr=hoe-hē}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|gambling}} a [[Chinese]] [[lottery]] [[numbers game]] of number pairs from 1 to 37, similar to [[jueteng]], but the [[winning]] [[number]] on a [[ball]] or a [[raffle]] [[ticket]] [[paper]] is placed into a {{w|Tombola (game)|tambola}}/[[tambiyolo]] [[raffle]] [[container]] [[before]] [[betting]] [[start]]s

====See also====
* {{l|tl|huweteng}}

===References===
<references>
</references>

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo|wahuy}}
* {{cite-book|year=1988|title=Philippine Law Dictionary|last=Moreno|first=Federico B.|edition=Third|publisher=Rex Bookstore, Inc.|
isbn=9789712349119|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=9kHxFAegYEsC&printsec=frontcover&dq=Philippine+Law+Dictionary&hl=en&newbks=1&newbks_redir=0&sa=X&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=wahoy&f=false}}
-------- end text --------
