Page 20771 wala: Skipped, no changes
Page 20771 wala: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Etymology 1===
From Proto-Central Philippine ''*wadaq'', from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*wada||to be, exist}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*wada}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|tl|wla||text messaging}}
* {{alt|tl|ala||colloquial}}
* {{alt|tl|ula||dialectal|colloquial}}
* {{alt|tl|uala||obsolete|Abecedario}}

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|walâ}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|walâ|b=+}}

# [[nothing]]; to [[not]] [[exist]]; [[there is]] [[no]]
#: {{ux|tl|'''Walang''' tao diyan.|'''There's no''' people there.}}
#: {{syn|tl|waley|was|q1=slang, gay slang|q2=gay slang}}
#: {{ant|tl|may|mayroon}}
## not [[in]]; [[missing]]
##: {{ux|tl|'''Wala''' pa sila dito...|They '''aren't''' here yet...}}
##: {{ux|tl|'''Wala''' 'yung kaibigan mo ah.|Your friend '''isn't with''' you, hm.}}
## not [[have|having]]; [[no]]
##: {{ux|tl|'''Wala''' sa akin ang ballpen mo, '''wala''' akong kailangang ibalik sa iyo!|I '''don't have''' your pen, I '''don't''' have to return '''anything''' to you!}}
##: {{ux|tl|'''Wala''' akong pagkain, sa iba ka na lang.|I '''don't have''' food here, go to another person.}}
## [[no]]; I/you/they don't have any; there isn't any
##: {{ux|tl|Ay, '''wala''', hindi ako nakakuha.|Oh, '''I don't have any''', I didn't get to grab any.}}
## [[nothing]]; [[no-one]]
##: {{ux|tl|'''Wala''' 'yun sa akin.|She's '''nothing''' to me.}}
##: {{ux|tl|Ay, '''wala''' 'yun, 'wag mo na lang pansinin.|Oh, they're '''no-one''', don't mind them.}}
##: {{ux|tl|'''Wala'''... hindi 'yan gagana.|'''That's nothing'''... that won't work.}}
# [[free]] {{q|from}}; [[lacking]]; [[without]]
#: {{syn|tl|ligtas}}
# {{lb|tl|by extension}} [[break up|broken up]] {{q|in a relationship}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Wala''' na sila.|They aren't together anymore.}}
# {{lb|tl|euphemistic}} [[dead]]
#: {{syn|tl|patay}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col-auto|tl|balewala|kawalan|makawala|magpakawala|pakawalan|magwala|mawala|mawalan|mawalang-galang|pagkawala|walain|walang anuman|walang-bahala|walang-bayad|walang-bisa|walang-hiya|walang-hanggan|walang-buhay|walang-kabuluhan|walang-kamatayan|walang-kapares|walang-karapatan|walang katapusan|walang-kibo|walang-kinalaman|walang-kuwenta|walang iba|walang laban|walang labis, walang kulang|walang-laman|walang-malay|walang-galang|walang ginagawa|walang-humpay|walang-puso|walang tigil|walang-wala|walang-muang|walang-habas|walang-pakundangan|walang-dila|walang-ingay|walang-sala|walang-awa|wa epek|walang-tulog|walang-suwerte|wala sa lugar|wala akong pakialam|wala kang pakialam|parang wala nang bukas|wala siyang malay|hiwala|walang ano-ano|walang-bibig|walang-budhi|walang-damdamin|walang-damit|walang-dugo|walang-halaga|walang-hapo|walang-hilig|walang-hirap|walang kaluluwa|walang-imik|walang-kapalaran|walang-kapansanan|walang-kapareho|walang-kasalanan|walang-kasaysayan|walang-kasiyahan|walang-katarungan|walang-katulad|walang-katuturan|walang-kita|walang-kupas|walang-lingon-likod|walang-liwag|walang-loob|walang-malisya|walang-malay-tao|walang-maliw|walang-mata|walang-modo|walang-mukha|walang oras|wala sa huwisyo|walang-pakialam|walang-paki|walang-panahon|walang-pangalawa|walang-pasintabi|walang-pangarap|walang-patumangga|walang-pinag-aralan|walang-pitagan|walang-sakit|walang-saysay|walang-sikmura|walang-tahan|walang-talo|walang-taros|walang-turing|walang-ulo|walang-utak|walang-utang-na-loob|walang-wawa|batas ng wala|walang atubili|walang buto|walang grasya|walang gulugod|walang hinaharap|walang ilong|walang isip|walang kahulilip|walang-kusa|walang mata sa kulay|walang pisngi|walang puno, walang dulo|walang-konsiderasyon|walang-lusot|walang-sentido-kumon|kawalang-tiwala|walang kawala|walang problema|kawalang-kasiguraduhan|warla|was|waley|waling-bahala|walang-bait|walang-bala|walang-bale|walang-balik|walang-balino|walang-abala|walang-abog|walang-abog-abog|walang-akyat|walang-ag