Page 20836 walo: Would save with comment = convert {{tl-IPA}} to {{tl-pr}}; incorporate {{audio|tl|TL-PH-walo.ogg|Audio}} into {{tl-pr}}; remove {{hyph}} same as respelling auto-syllabification
Page 20836 walo: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*walu}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*walu}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|waló<audio:TL-PH-walo.ogg>}}

===Numeral===
{{tl-num|waló|b=+}}

# {{cln|tl|cardinal numbers}} [[eight]]
#: {{syn|tl|otso}}

====Usage notes====
* To describe the quantity of something, the number is placed before the noun and affixed with a '''-ng''' when the word ends with a vowel, and a separate word '''[[na]]''' for a consonant.
*: '''''Isang''' saging, '''dalawang''' pinya''
*: '''''Apat na''' mansanas, '''anim na''' mangga''

