Compare {{m|tl|ngek|nge / ngek / nye / nyek}}. See also {{ncog|nan-hbl|諧|tr=ôe|t=to persuade; to advise; to [[harmonize]]}} as in {{m|nan-hbl|諧煞|tr=ôe-soah|t=to [[mediate]]; to [[conciliate]]; to [[reconcile]]}}.

====Interjection====
{{tl-head|interjection|weh?|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|slang}} {{n-g|Expression of [[disbelief]] or [[skepticism]]}}: [[oh really]]
#: {{syn|tl|ows}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Weh''', di nga?|'''Oh really''', is it really not?}}

===Etymology 2===

====Interjection====
{{tl-head|interjection|+|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|dialectal|chiefly|Bulacan}}

# {{alt sp|tl|e}}

===Further reading===
* [https://www.tagalog.com/#weh “Weh?!” in ''Tagalog.com''.]
* [https://www.tagaloglang.com/weh/ “WEH” in ''Tagalog-English Dictionary'', TAGALOG LANG, 2007.]

{{cln|tl|catchphrases}}
