* {{cite-thesis|date=January 1963|last=Francisco|first=Juan R.|title=Indian Influences In The Philippines With Special Reference To Language And Literature|publisher=University of Madras|type=PhD|chapter=1|page=57|url=https://shodhganga.inflibnet.ac.in/handle/10603/278294}}
* {{cite-book|title=Pilipinas|year=2004|publisher=Philippine Studies Committee, Southeast Asia Council, Association for Asian Studies|pageurl=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Pilipinas/qR9MsZ2fH3YC?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=v%C4%81ka|page=110}}
* {{cite-book|last=Pardo de Tavera|first=Trinidad Hermenegildo|title=El sanscrito en la lengua tagalog|year=1887|publisher=la Faculté de médecine, A. Davy|pageurl=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/El_sanscrito_en_la_lengua_tagalog/JYdBAAAAYAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=wika|page=54}}
