===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|tl|ms|jadi||to become}}, from {{uder|tl|sa|जाति||birth}}. {{doublet|tl|dati|Henesis}}. See also {{m|tl|ari}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{n-g|root of words meaning "[[event]]" or "[[occurrence]]", such as {{m|tl|mangyari}} or {{m|tl|pangyayari}}}}
# {{n-g|root of words meaning "[[power]]", such as {{m|tl|kapangyarihan}}}}

=====Usage notes=====
* This word (with the pronunciation above) can no longer stand alone.

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|kapangyarihan|makapangyari|makapangyarihan|mangyari|pangyayari|pinangyarihan|pangyari|nakapangyayari|kungyari}}

===Etymology 2===
Compare with etymology 1.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|yarì<n^>|yarî<a^>}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|yarì|b=+}}

# act or manner of [[making]] or [[manufacturing]] something
#: {{syn|tl|gawa|paggawa|pagkagawa|pagyari|pagkayari}}
# [[product]]; thing [[manufacture]]d or [[made]]
#: {{syn|tl|gawa|produkto}}
# {{n-g|used with {{m|tl|sa}} to mean "made of"}}
#: {{syn|tl|niyari}}
#: {{ux|tl|Mayroon siyang ngipin na '''yari''' sa ginto.|He has a golden tooth. (lit. He has a tooth '''made of''' gold.)}}
# [[completion]] or [[finishing]] of something being [[done]], [[made]], or [[manufactured]]
# [[output]]; [[amount]] [[produced]]
# [[style]]; [[make]]; [[build]]
#: {{syn|tl|kayarian|modelo}}
# [[texture]]; [[structure]]; [[composition]]
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} meeting one's downfall or getting what one deserves

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|yarì|b=+}}

# [[made]]; [[finished]]; [[manufactured]]
#: {{syn|tl|gawa}}
# [[ready-made]]
#: {{syn|tl|niyari}}
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[done for]]; [[doomed]]
#: {{syn|tl|patay|lagot}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Yari''' ka.|You're '''done for'''.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|iyari|kayarian|makayari|magyari|mapagkayarian|mayari|pagkakayari|pagyari|pagyayari|yarian|yariin|yaring-kamay|yaring-makina|yaring-pabrika|yumari|pagkayari}}

====Adjective====
{{tl-adj|yarî|b=+}}

# [[finished]]; [[completed]] {{q|usually with '''{{m|tl|na}}'''}}
#: {{syn|tl|tapos}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Yari''' na ang mga damit.|The clothes have already been '''made'''.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Yari''' na ba ang palabas?|Is the show '''over'''?}}
# [[ready-made]]
# {{lb|tl|colloquial}} [[dead]]
#: {{syn|tl|patay|utas}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*a-di||that, there}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*-di}}. Cognate with {{cog|blw|yadi||that}}, {{cog|msk|yadi||this}}, and {{cog|mg|ary||there, yonder}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|yarí}}

====Pronoun====
{{tl-pron|yarí|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|dialectal}}

# [[this]] {{gl|close to the speaker}}
#: {{syn|tl|iri|ari|ito}}

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alt|tl|yare||colloquial}}

=====See also=====
{{tl-dem pronouns}}

